(2317330, 321944, 4226, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. A few things you could do to improve upon the processing.. the saree looks a bit over sharepened. In portrait, you would want to keep attention to face, so don''t sharpen the whole image, just sharpen face ( eyes basically ) and keep the other not-so-important things normal. A bit of vignetting may also improve things here.</td>', 'Nice portrait. A few things you could do to improve upon the processing.. the saree looks a bit over sharepened. In portrait, you would want to keep attention to face, so don''t sharpen the whole image, just sharpen face ( eyes basically ) and keep the other not-so-important things normal. A bit of vignetting may also improve things here.', '2006-04-17 01:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2317331, 321820, 46097, '<td valign="top">Stunning hair. The eyes seem a bit oversharpened to me.</td>', 'Stunning hair. The eyes seem a bit oversharpened to me.', '2006-04-17 01:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2317334, 321827, 37252, '<td valign="top">this would be a very nice portrait if it weren''t so dark</td>', 'this would be a very nice portrait if it weren''t so dark', '2006-04-17 01:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2317339, 321108, 4226, '<td valign="top">Great expression from your model. I also like the lighting. but the processing seems to be too much, too smooth skin ( may be too much of noise removal ) and also some marks on left cheeck ( close to nose) which could be pixelation.. I think processing can be improved.</td>', 'Great expression from your model. I also like the lighting. but the processing seems to be too much, too smooth skin ( may be too much of noise removal ) and also some marks on left cheeck ( close to nose) which could be pixelation.. I think processing can be improved.', '2006-04-17 01:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
