(2317466, 321229, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  I like the hair blowing over the face.  Maybe a little smoothing of the skin would have made it have that true studio feel.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  I like the hair blowing over the face.  Maybe a little smoothing of the skin would have made it have that true studio feel.', '2006-04-17 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2317467, 321858, 15811, '<td valign="top">oh wow...beautiful.  How in the heck did you get such great tones on the girl''s face?  She looks familiar, but I can''t remember where...awesome shot, definately top 10 <i>at least</i>.</td>', 'oh wow...beautiful.  How in the heck did you get such great tones on the girl''s face?  She looks familiar, but I can''t remember where...awesome shot, definately top 10 at least.', '2006-04-17 02:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2317469, 321907, 19982, '<td valign="top">Check your white balance - and then adjust the contrast using a curves adjustment to make it "pop".  The kid should be the star of the image, instead he feels "flat" - the curves adjustment would fix that.</td>', 'Check your white balance - and then adjust the contrast using a curves adjustment to make it "pop".  The kid should be the star of the image, instead he feels "flat" - the curves adjustment would fix that.', '2006-04-17 02:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2317473, 320675, 19982, '<td valign="top">Kudos for using a hair light...  only thing is, it appears really bright, especially compared to what the main light must have been as shown by the brightness of his face.</td>', 'Kudos for using a hair light...  only thing is, it appears really bright, especially compared to what the main light must have been as shown by the brightness of his face.', '2006-04-17 02:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
