(2318133, 320473, 34938, '<td valign="top">Nice angle of view...good lighting. Well done, hope you do well with this...</td>', 'Nice angle of view...good lighting. Well done, hope you do well with this...', '2006-04-17 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
