(2318149, 321858, 34938, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this! The eyes (all four of them) are connecting with the lens in a powerful way. I love the colour, the dof, the composition. Has to be a 15...oh, what, we only go to 10! Well it will have to be 10</td>', 'I LOVE this! The eyes (all four of them) are connecting with the lens in a powerful way. I love the colour, the dof, the composition. Has to be a 15...oh, what, we only go to 10! Well it will have to be 10', '2006-04-17 07:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318151, 321253, 34938, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic hat! Looks a bit outdoorsy rather than studio, but who said you couldn''t take a studio outside! Well done, hope you do well with this...</td>', 'What a fantastic hat! Looks a bit outdoorsy rather than studio, but who said you couldn''t take a studio outside! Well done, hope you do well with this...', '2006-04-17 07:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
