(2318154, 321832, 34938, '<td valign="top">I think you''ll get comments about the graininess. I believe grain is good in this shot. love it. Well done, hope you do well with this...</td>', 'I think you''ll get comments about the graininess. I believe grain is good in this shot. love it. Well done, hope you do well with this...', '2006-04-17 08:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318155, 321028, 34938, '<td valign="top">Christine has stunning eyes and face and you have captured them well here...Well done, hope you do well with this...</td>', 'Christine has stunning eyes and face and you have captured them well here...Well done, hope you do well with this...', '2006-04-17 08:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318157, 321451, 34938, '<td valign="top">OK...this is a REAL woman here, beautiful pose and classic shot, love the pearls and smile etc...but the photo...it''s really soft and processed in a funny kind of way. It just lacks some sharpness around the eyes...maybe that''s a preference for me, but it''s just too soft bordering on blurry...I''m sorry. I wish I could be more positive</td>', 'OK...this is a REAL woman here, beautiful pose and classic shot, love the pearls and smile etc...but the photo...it''s really soft and processed in a funny kind of way. It just lacks some sharpness around the eyes...maybe that''s a preference for me, but it''s just too soft bordering on blurry...I''m sorry. I wish I could be more positive', '2006-04-17 08:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318159, 322008, 34938, '<td valign="top">Angie looks vivacious and you have captured that in this shot..Well done, hope you do well with this...</td>', 'Angie looks vivacious and you have captured that in this shot..Well done, hope you do well with this...', '2006-04-17 08:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318160, 321359, 34938, '<td valign="top">Great poses and happy pretty kids...only distraction are the feet in the back of the shot that look uncofortable up against a wall (?) Also, the focus seems to be on the girl in pink...perhaps a smaller aperture would have had more of the shot in focus. Well done though, hope you do well with this...</td>', 'Great poses and happy pretty kids...only distraction are the feet in the back of the shot that look uncofortable up against a wall (?) Also, the focus seems to be on the girl in pink...perhaps a smaller aperture would have had more of the shot in focus. Well done though, hope you do well with this...', '2006-04-17 08:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
