(2318384, 321932, 15204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love her pose and her model stare.  I love the lines of her arms.  I would tone down the hot spot on her left arm, especially her elbow and shoulder; they distract from her face.  The one big earring is also distracting.  7 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love her pose and her model stare.  I love the lines of her arms.  I would tone down the hot spot on her left arm, especially her elbow and shoulder; they distract from her face.  The one big earring is also distracting.  7 from me.', '2006-04-17 09:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318396, 321335, 15204, '<td valign="top">While you might get voted lower for not being a ''studio'' portrait, I reallylike it.  I love the blue of the water.  It makes her face really stand out.  Great eye contact (and an adorable little girl1).  I would have cropped more off the top(maybe including some off the top of her head).  It would bring her eyes up higher in the frame, and eliminate the distracting line coming out of the back of her head.</td>', 'While you might get voted lower for not being a ''studio'' portrait, I reallylike it.  I love the blue of the water.  It makes her face really stand out.  Great eye contact (and an adorable little girl1).  I would have cropped more off the top(maybe including some off the top of her head).  It would bring her eyes up higher in the frame, and eliminate the distracting line coming out of the back of her head.', '2006-04-17 09:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318397, 321772, 9111, '<td valign="top">try moving your subject away from the wall... enough that the shadow is gone...   as a rule 6 ft away is good..</td>', 'try moving your subject away from the wall... enough that the shadow is gone...   as a rule 6 ft away is good..', '2006-04-17 09:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318398, 321932, 18080, '<td valign="top">The composition is greaat and the lightig looks spot on.<br/>My main problem is too much neat image or softening of the face.<br/>I like the noise<br/>I still like it though so a 9<br/>good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'The composition is greaat and the lightig looks spot on.My main problem is too much neat image or softening of the face.I like the noiseI still like it though so a 9good luck Kev', '2006-04-17 09:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318399, 322006, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow dof and the way the focus falls away on the clothing.  not sure about the orange thing in the background.  maybe needs to be more out of focus, it is a bit distracting to me as is.  all in all though good picture.  sorry I can''t vote though.</td>', 'I like the shallow dof and the way the focus falls away on the clothing.  not sure about the orange thing in the background.  maybe needs to be more out of focus, it is a bit distracting to me as is.  all in all though good picture.  sorry I can''t vote though.', '2006-04-17 09:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318401, 319495, 56998, '<td valign="top">Aw, really nice capture :]</td>', 'Aw, really nice capture :]', '2006-04-17 09:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318404, 321699, 36382, '<td valign="top">This is good I like the lighting and the way the picture in the back looks like the boy in the front with his ruffled dark hair and clothing.  Maybe the real boy could be just a tad higher.  Good.  Sorry can''t vote though.</td>', 'This is good I like the lighting and the way the picture in the back looks like the boy in the front with his ruffled dark hair and clothing.  Maybe the real boy could be just a tad higher.  Good.  Sorry can''t vote though.', '2006-04-17 09:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318406, 321898, 56998, '<td valign="top">If i could vote, it would be a 10!</td>', 'If i could vote, it would be a 10!', '2006-04-17 09:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318408, 320965, 36382, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, especially the eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, especially the eyes.', '2006-04-17 09:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318409, 319424, 15204, '<td valign="top">Great eye contact and ''model stare'' and an adorable little boy.  I think it would have been better with more room below him, showing a little more of his shoulders.  The one finger looks a little disembodied without seeing more of his hand.  Very nice lighting.</td>', 'Great eye contact and ''model stare'' and an adorable little boy.  I think it would have been better with more room below him, showing a little more of his shoulders.  The one finger looks a little disembodied without seeing more of his hand.  Very nice lighting.', '2006-04-17 09:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318413, 322013, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very *er* suggestive crop and light placement.  If that is what you were going for, you definitely acheived it.  I like the lines and the composition very much.</td>', 'Very *er* suggestive crop and light placement.  If that is what you were going for, you definitely acheived it.  I like the lines and the composition very much.', '2006-04-17 09:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318417, 321227, 24642, '<td valign="top">I really like mood and the crop.  Post processing and makeup is fantastic.</td>', 'I really like mood and the crop.  Post processing and makeup is fantastic.', '2006-04-17 09:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318418, 321898, 5728, '<td valign="top">Super lighting, it brings out the contours of the man''s face well. The motion blur on the hand is very fitting.</td>', 'Super lighting, it brings out the contours of the man''s face well. The motion blur on the hand is very fitting.', '2006-04-17 09:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318419, 321108, 56998, '<td valign="top">This one stands out. If i could vote it would be a 10 :]</td>', 'This one stands out. If i could vote it would be a 10 :]', '2006-04-17 09:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318420, 321878, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fitting background, good!</td>', 'Fitting background, good!', '2006-04-17 09:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318423, 321985, 15204, '<td valign="top">Beuatiful blue eyes.  The skin is a little too soft for my taste, but that is a personal preference.  I think I would prefer it short lit (with the main light on the side of the face away from the camera).  I like the composition, although I might have left a little more room below her, showing a little more of her shoulders.  Very nicely done and a lovely model.</td>', 'Beuatiful blue eyes.  The skin is a little too soft for my taste, but that is a personal preference.  I think I would prefer it short lit (with the main light on the side of the face away from the camera).  I like the composition, although I might have left a little more room below her, showing a little more of her shoulders.  Very nicely done and a lovely model.', '2006-04-17 09:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318425, 320822, 56998, '<td valign="top">Wow, i love this, shame i can''t vote! Good luck :]</td>', 'Wow, i love this, shame i can''t vote! Good luck :]', '2006-04-17 09:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318427, 321192, 56998, '<td valign="top">Love the metallic tones :]</td>', 'Love the metallic tones :]', '2006-04-17 09:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318430, 321604, 47294, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  Got a good feeling about this one, I think you are in ribbon country!!</td>', 'Great concept!  Got a good feeling about this one, I think you are in ribbon country!!', '2006-04-17 09:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318431, 320587, 56998, '<td valign="top">The simple look is definitley a striking one! :]</td>', 'The simple look is definitley a striking one! :]', '2006-04-17 09:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318432, 321874, 47294, '<td valign="top">Very effective photo.  Actually reminds me far more of Hugo Weaving from The Matrix than Big Brother...Either way I like it and it''s fresh.  Well done.</td>', 'Very effective photo.  Actually reminds me far more of Hugo Weaving from The Matrix than Big Brother...Either way I like it and it''s fresh.  Well done.', '2006-04-17 09:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318434, 321726, 47294, '<td valign="top">Starting to know this subject very well.  Great photo with contrasting colours.</td>', 'Starting to know this subject very well.  Great photo with contrasting colours.', '2006-04-17 09:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318435, 321873, 47294, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful capture of your subjects eyes.  Very nice composition and DOF too.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful capture of your subjects eyes.  Very nice composition and DOF too.', '2006-04-17 09:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318436, 321967, 47294, '<td valign="top">Bazz, looks like we collaborated on this concept for an entry  Great minds must think alike.<br/> <br/>Great shot BTW, good luck.</td>', 'Bazz, looks like we collaborated on this concept for an entry  Great minds must think alike. Great shot BTW, good luck.', '2006-04-17 09:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318438, 320965, 47294, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, love the colours.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, love the colours.', '2006-04-17 09:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318439, 321229, 47294, '<td valign="top">Love the messy hair, great subject.</td>', 'Love the messy hair, great subject.', '2006-04-17 09:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318440, 321910, 47294, '<td valign="top">Very effective!  Looks a little grainy - you may have been going for that.  Great shot.</td>', 'Very effective!  Looks a little grainy - you may have been going for that.  Great shot.', '2006-04-17 09:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318441, 321929, 47294, '<td valign="top">Very intense, love it.</td>', 'Very intense, love it.', '2006-04-17 09:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318442, 321872, 47294, '<td valign="top">God damn!!!</td>', 'God damn!!!', '2006-04-17 09:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318453, 320846, 15204, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and tones in your setting.  Great use of windowlight for a ''studio'' portrait.  I love contrast of the little girl in the big chair. And her arms around her knees is perfect for the feeling of the shot.  A minor nitpick - it would be better with a shirt that blends into the colors of the wall and florr and chair.  The cool purple sleeves stand out against all the warm tones. 7 from me.</td>', 'Very nice color and tones in your setting.  Great use of windowlight for a ''studio'' portrait.  I love contrast of the little girl in the big chair. And her arms around her knees is perfect for the feeling of the shot.  A minor nitpick - it would be better with a shirt that blends into the colors of the wall and florr and chair.  The cool purple sleeves stand out against all the warm tones. 7 from me.', '2006-04-17 09:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318455, 321922, 43405, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph, good pose and subject. The only thing that is a little distracting is the shadow on her left cheek, as it tends to draw the eye. Perhaps a fill would have helped.</td>', 'Nice photograph, good pose and subject. The only thing that is a little distracting is the shadow on her left cheek, as it tends to draw the eye. Perhaps a fill would have helped.', '2006-04-17 09:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318456, 321147, 15204, '<td valign="top">Cool angle and great smiles.  I love how close their faces are, and the vertical composition really enhances the closeness.  I would have cropped a little off the bottom, so that the little boy''s hand is not so obviously cut off.  If the light would have allowed it, stopping down would have allowed for a little more DOF so that Dad''s beard was more in focus.  Very cute! 8 from me.</td>', 'Cool angle and great smiles.  I love how close their faces are, and the vertical composition really enhances the closeness.  I would have cropped a little off the bottom, so that the little boy''s hand is not so obviously cut off.  If the light would have allowed it, stopping down would have allowed for a little more DOF so that Dad''s beard was more in focus.  Very cute! 8 from me.', '2006-04-17 10:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318460, 320063, 43405, '<td valign="top">Like this. Nice and sharp, and the the background makes this photograph. Well done.</td>', 'Like this. Nice and sharp, and the the background makes this photograph. Well done.', '2006-04-17 10:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318464, 321678, 43405, '<td valign="top">Clever. Focus spot on, excellent composition. Well done.</td>', 'Clever. Focus spot on, excellent composition. Well done.', '2006-04-17 10:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318466, 321423, 22856, '<td valign="top">Dosent seems like an studio enviromnet.</td>', 'Dosent seems like an studio enviromnet.', '2006-04-17 10:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318467, 322001, 22856, '<td valign="top">To much blue reflection from something.</td>', 'To much blue reflection from something.', '2006-04-17 10:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318472, 322015, 22856, '<td valign="top">Too blurry/soft. Needs sharpness in her eyes.</td>', 'Too blurry/soft. Needs sharpness in her eyes.', '2006-04-17 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318475, 320078, 22856, '<td valign="top">I dont like the lightning on this shot. Is her hair red or is it just the lightning?</td>', 'I dont like the lightning on this shot. Is her hair red or is it just the lightning?', '2006-04-17 10:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
