(2318503, 321556, 38592, '<td valign="top">I like the soft feel to this picture, but the un-eveness of the eyes is the first thing that draws my attention.  One of them is a bit darker and also not fuly opened</td>', 'I like the soft feel to this picture, but the un-eveness of the eyes is the first thing that draws my attention.  One of them is a bit darker and also not fuly opened', '2006-04-17 10:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
