(2318516, 321854, 38592, '<td valign="top">Looks like you missed the focus.  Focus seems to be on the statue below the arms rather than on the eyes of the subject</td>', 'Looks like you missed the focus.  Focus seems to be on the statue below the arms rather than on the eyes of the subject', '2006-04-17 10:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318517, 321957, 22856, '<td valign="top">What the h. happened here? Not talking about the person.</td>', 'What the h. happened here? Not talking about the person.', '2006-04-17 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318518, 321315, 38198, '<td valign="top">Love the color! Good light, creative set up.</td>', 'Love the color! Good light, creative set up.', '2006-04-17 10:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318519, 321983, 38592, '<td valign="top">White balance is off... too much yellow saturated in the skin tones in an already yellow dominated pic (shirt and guitar)</td>', 'White balance is off... too much yellow saturated in the skin tones in an already yellow dominated pic (shirt and guitar)', '2006-04-17 10:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318521, 321939, 54044, '<td valign="top">My god this hair is like fire ,very nice work</td>', 'My god this hair is like fire ,very nice work', '2006-04-17 10:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318523, 321309, 51003, '<td valign="top">what a gorgeous girl. Cool reflection!</td>', 'what a gorgeous girl. Cool reflection!', '2006-04-17 10:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318524, 320738, 38592, '<td valign="top">There are a few dark spots on your background which you should have cloned out (top left and left of the models face).  Also I think if the model had turned her head and look more towards the camera it would have more impact since her hair is hiding most of her face.  Nice sharp focus though.</td>', 'There are a few dark spots on your background which you should have cloned out (top left and left of the models face).  Also I think if the model had turned her head and look more towards the camera it would have more impact since her hair is hiding most of her face.  Nice sharp focus though.', '2006-04-17 10:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318526, 322015, 38592, '<td valign="top">Over processed and a bit too soft for me</td>', 'Over processed and a bit too soft for me', '2006-04-17 10:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318528, 321912, 46177, '<td valign="top">I love the colour tones in this, she is a very lovely model as well. One of my fav''s. 9</td>', 'I love the colour tones in this, she is a very lovely model as well. One of my fav''s. 9', '2006-04-17 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318529, 321867, 38198, '<td valign="top">Wow I love this, I think I would like it less dark, but I am guessing you set the color this way for mood. Love it!! 10</td>', 'Wow I love this, I think I would like it less dark, but I am guessing you set the color this way for mood. Love it!! 10', '2006-04-17 10:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318531, 321328, 51003, '<td valign="top">AWESOME! This will win I am sure of it</td>', 'AWESOME! This will win I am sure of it', '2006-04-17 10:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318532, 320538, 46177, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very natural, hope you do well.</td>', 'Great shot, very natural, hope you do well.', '2006-04-17 10:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318534, 321980, 38592, '<td valign="top">Top of the head is a bit dark... try using a hair light next time to get more contrast between hair and background</td>', 'Top of the head is a bit dark... try using a hair light next time to get more contrast between hair and background', '2006-04-17 10:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318537, 321858, 43405, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... Striking image and have scored it reasonably well. However, IMHO I think the child''s right cheek has been a bit over edited (Bit of powder on the nose would also have helped on the nose shine). Top notch on the eyes though.</td>', 'Hmmm.... Striking image and have scored it reasonably well. However, IMHO I think the child''s right cheek has been a bit over edited (Bit of powder on the nose would also have helped on the nose shine). Top notch on the eyes though.', '2006-04-17 10:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318540, 321423, 46177, '<td valign="top">its a good portrait but is it a studio shot, anyway still very good.</td>', 'its a good portrait but is it a studio shot, anyway still very good.', '2006-04-17 10:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318541, 321867, 46177, '<td valign="top">Love the set up, a little dark for me but still lovely.</td>', 'Love the set up, a little dark for me but still lovely.', '2006-04-17 10:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
