(2318549, 321858, 15711, '<td valign="top">AWW. Love the eyes.  Nice lighting and DOF. Great focus.  On second pass, this gets my only 10.  I just love it.  A true shining moment.</td>', 'AWW. Love the eyes.  Nice lighting and DOF. Great focus.  On second pass, this gets my only 10.  I just love it.  A true shining moment.', '2006-04-17 10:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
