(2318564, 319965, 9111, '<td valign="top">this photograph has such great potential.. the glasses cutting her eyes in half take so much out fo this photo.   if the glasses had properly sat where they should be this would be fantastic!  they look too low onthe nose, and crooked...i''d love to see this retaken with her glasses sitting properly to show off her beautiful eyes</td>', 'this photograph has such great potential.. the glasses cutting her eyes in half take so much out fo this photo.   if the glasses had properly sat where they should be this would be fantastic!  they look too low onthe nose, and crooked...i''d love to see this retaken with her glasses sitting properly to show off her beautiful eyes', '2006-04-17 10:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
