(2318638, 321726, 47117, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, Erlinda again. If this is unother than Librodo, then I would be shocked.<br/> <br/>She took first in Textures.  I voted it pretty high there.  She was in Candid, and I gave it a so-so score because it was the same woman.  Now, here she is again in Color Portrait. Will she also be in "Something Old"????<br/> <br/>Nice photo, great subject, but now it is too over used and a bit tiring.  I hold anonymity in high regard when I vote, and to me this is just milking it too much. My score reflects that in this challenge.  I "try" to vote the photo on its merits, but when I see a photo over milked and shoehorned in nearly every challenge, I simply can''t get past that faux pax by the photographer.  Good luck with it though.</td>', 'Ahhh, Erlinda again. If this is unother than Librodo, then I would be shocked. She took first in Textures.  I voted it pretty high there.  She was in Candid, and I gave it a so-so score because it was the same woman.  Now, here she is again in Color Portrait. Will she also be in "Something Old"???? Nice photo, great subject, but now it is too over used and a bit tiring.  I hold anonymity in high regard when I vote, and to me this is just milking it too much. My score reflects that in this challenge.  I "try" to vote the photo on its merits, but when I see a photo over milked and shoehorned in nearly every challenge, I simply can''t get past that faux pax by the photographer.  Good luck with it though.', '2006-04-17 10:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
