(2318813, 321932, 40750, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2006-04-17 12:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318818, 321826, 52336, '<td valign="top">For me, the highlights are a bit too washed out, but an excellent photo!  Great expression, lovely echoing colours in hair and shirt, terrific pose.</td>', 'For me, the highlights are a bit too washed out, but an excellent photo!  Great expression, lovely echoing colours in hair and shirt, terrific pose.', '2006-04-17 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318819, 322016, 46294, '<td valign="top">It''s out of focus, too bad, because it''s a very nice pose.</td>', 'It''s out of focus, too bad, because it''s a very nice pose.', '2006-04-17 12:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318823, 320380, 46294, '<td valign="top">I love it, it''s a diffrent kind of portrait!!</td>', 'I love it, it''s a diffrent kind of portrait!!', '2006-04-17 12:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318824, 321315, 52336, '<td valign="top">:) Neat idea well executed.</td>', ':) Neat idea well executed.', '2006-04-17 12:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318826, 320846, 52336, '<td valign="top">Wow, great picture!  Lovely colours and lighting, and a cute model. :)</td>', 'Wow, great picture!  Lovely colours and lighting, and a cute model. :)', '2006-04-17 12:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318829, 321833, 46294, '<td valign="top">Owww this is nice. I love the lightnig. Alltough you edited it a bit to much, you can see the dodge stains a bit. That''s a shame.</td>', 'Owww this is nice. I love the lightnig. Alltough you edited it a bit to much, you can see the dodge stains a bit. That''s a shame.', '2006-04-17 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318836, 320337, 13982, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but I think you dodged the eyes a little too much.  It gives a bit of an unreal look to it.  Also, It seems the focus is a bit soft on the lower mouth and upper head.  This is good, because it draws attention to the eyes, but is a tad bit distracting.  Overall, I give you a 6.</td>', 'Good picture, but I think you dodged the eyes a little too much.  It gives a bit of an unreal look to it.  Also, It seems the focus is a bit soft on the lower mouth and upper head.  This is good, because it draws attention to the eyes, but is a tad bit distracting.  Overall, I give you a 6.', '2006-04-17 12:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318837, 319738, 46294, '<td valign="top">Too bad you croped the nose. It would have been a beautiful portrait if the nose in the picture. I love those eyes!</td>', 'Too bad you croped the nose. It would have been a beautiful portrait if the nose in the picture. I love those eyes!', '2006-04-17 12:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318838, 321604, 13982, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflection.  Amazing sharpness and nice color -8</td>', 'Great use of reflection.  Amazing sharpness and nice color -8', '2006-04-17 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318840, 321400, 46294, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit out of focus</td>', 'It''s a bit out of focus', '2006-04-17 12:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318841, 321573, 52336, '<td valign="top">Sweet image with lovely echoing colours.</td>', 'Sweet image with lovely echoing colours.', '2006-04-17 12:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318843, 320077, 13982, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is very odd.  The face is much too dark, and the weird blue light on the right side of face is strange.  -4</td>', 'The lighting here is very odd.  The face is much too dark, and the weird blue light on the right side of face is strange.  -4', '2006-04-17 12:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318845, 321192, 13982, '<td valign="top">Very interesting colors.  I like how the colors in the mascara match the colors in the metal? in the back. I do think the whole image has a bit of a yellow wash in it, especially the eyes.  -5</td>', 'Very interesting colors.  I like how the colors in the mascara match the colors in the metal? in the back. I do think the whole image has a bit of a yellow wash in it, especially the eyes.  -5', '2006-04-17 12:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318847, 320380, 13982, '<td valign="top">Great use of size and angle!</td>', 'Great use of size and angle!', '2006-04-17 12:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318848, 321827, 37961, '<td valign="top">Really good subject...but a tad dark for me.</td>', 'Really good subject...but a tad dark for me.', '2006-04-17 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318850, 322015, 46294, '<td valign="top">A bit too soft...</td>', 'A bit too soft...', '2006-04-17 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318851, 321898, 52336, '<td valign="top">Great emotive portait.</td>', 'Great emotive portait.', '2006-04-17 12:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318852, 321412, 13982, '<td valign="top">Lighting on the face and shoulder is a bit too harsh.  Seems the whole pictures has a pink flare, as seen on his face.</td>', 'Lighting on the face and shoulder is a bit too harsh.  Seems the whole pictures has a pink flare, as seen on his face.', '2006-04-17 12:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318854, 321875, 13982, '<td valign="top">A little more light on her face would have brought out more detail.</td>', 'A little more light on her face would have brought out more detail.', '2006-04-17 12:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318857, 321827, 36606, '<td valign="top">gotta say i love htis one. Not sure the usually DPC''ers will like it. but I love the dark face with the beard</td>', 'gotta say i love htis one. Not sure the usually DPC''ers will like it. but I love the dark face with the beard', '2006-04-17 12:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318859, 321483, 36606, '<td valign="top">top notch photo! hope u do well! (8)</td>', 'top notch photo! hope u do well! (8)', '2006-04-17 12:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318862, 321950, 29490, '<td valign="top">Hmmm - not sure about this one:  messy hair, eyes closed, persimmon colored shirt.  Good luck ma''am - looking at the rest this should do quite well :)</td>', 'Hmmm - not sure about this one:  messy hair, eyes closed, persimmon colored shirt.  Good luck ma''am - looking at the rest this should do quite well :)', '2006-04-17 12:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318863, 321965, 13982, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, but whole face is a tad too orange.  -5</td>', 'Interesting picture, but whole face is a tad too orange.  -5', '2006-04-17 12:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318867, 321556, 13982, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the face is a bit too harsh, and that combined with the soft focus gives her an almost corpse feel.  The whiteness does really bring out the hair, eyebrows, eyes and lips, however.  An interesting portrait, for sure.  -6</td>', 'The lighting on the face is a bit too harsh, and that combined with the soft focus gives her an almost corpse feel.  The whiteness does really bring out the hair, eyebrows, eyes and lips, however.  An interesting portrait, for sure.  -6', '2006-04-17 12:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318868, 321911, 13982, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting on her face.  The angle is a bit odd as well.  -4</td>', 'Poor lighting on her face.  The angle is a bit odd as well.  -4', '2006-04-17 12:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318869, 321101, 13982, '<td valign="top">Good focus, lighting, etc.  A nice portrait, but nothing which is extremely captivating for the viewer who doesn''t know this man.  -5</td>', 'Good focus, lighting, etc.  A nice portrait, but nothing which is extremely captivating for the viewer who doesn''t know this man.  -5', '2006-04-17 12:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318874, 320925, 13982, '<td valign="top">The eyes are a dodged a bit too much, but overall a nice, interesting portrait.  -6</td>', 'The eyes are a dodged a bit too much, but overall a nice, interesting portrait.  -6', '2006-04-17 12:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318875, 321726, 37961, '<td valign="top">Here is that great model again, however I think the colors of the scarves overwhelm her a bit in this one. Perhaps a beige or darker color would have allowed more of a subtleness. Still, a really good portrait.  You rule.</td>', 'Here is that great model again, however I think the colors of the scarves overwhelm her a bit in this one. Perhaps a beige or darker color would have allowed more of a subtleness. Still, a really good portrait.  You rule.', '2006-04-17 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318876, 321897, 13982, '<td valign="top">The focus is a tad blurry.  Some unsharp mask would have helped, but a nice pic none the less.</td>', 'The focus is a tad blurry.  Some unsharp mask would have helped, but a nice pic none the less.', '2006-04-17 12:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318879, 321893, 13982, '<td valign="top">A good picture, great sunset and focus, but not really a studio portrait.  Unless the background is a drop, in which case this is awesome! ;)</td>', 'A good picture, great sunset and focus, but not really a studio portrait.  Unless the background is a drop, in which case this is awesome! ;)', '2006-04-17 12:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318882, 321328, 38592, '<td valign="top">Great shot... the background matches REALLY well with the hair and skin tones.  Can''t really find anything worng with it... 10</td>', 'Great shot... the background matches REALLY well with the hair and skin tones.  Can''t really find anything worng with it... 10', '2006-04-17 12:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318889, 321910, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice image with lovely soft lighting, but the noise in the photo really detracts for me.  I also think strong focus or selective sharpening on the eyes would have been great, and a portrait orientation of the image overall would have been most effective.</td>', 'Nice image with lovely soft lighting, but the noise in the photo really detracts for me.  I also think strong focus or selective sharpening on the eyes would have been great, and a portrait orientation of the image overall would have been most effective.', '2006-04-17 12:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318892, 321873, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice and classic, a lovely portrait.  I would have liked her left eye to be more highlighted.</td>', 'Nice and classic, a lovely portrait.  I would have liked her left eye to be more highlighted.', '2006-04-17 12:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318897, 321839, 52713, '<td valign="top">You need a shave!</td>', 'You need a shave!', '2006-04-17 12:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318898, 321486, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait well composed, but focus and sharpness needs to be more prominent on the eyes in my view.</td>', 'Nice portrait well composed, but focus and sharpness needs to be more prominent on the eyes in my view.', '2006-04-17 12:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318901, 321954, 13982, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, focus, and color.  The eyes very plesant to look at.  Perhaps some slight dodging of the whites would have given them a bit more focus.  (or if you did this already, maybe a tad more).  Overall, a very pleasing portrait.  -7</td>', 'Good lighting, focus, and color.  The eyes very plesant to look at.  Perhaps some slight dodging of the whites would have given them a bit more focus.  (or if you did this already, maybe a tad more).  Overall, a very pleasing portrait.  -7', '2006-04-17 12:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318906, 320965, 52336, '<td valign="top">Very sweet and colourful. :)  I would have liked to see a crop closer to her on the right to remove that blurry element.  Beautiful nonetheless.</td>', 'Very sweet and colourful. :)  I would have liked to see a crop closer to her on the right to remove that blurry element.  Beautiful nonetheless.', '2006-04-17 12:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318912, 320462, 13982, '<td valign="top">By biggest suggestion would have been to really zoom in close on her face, with the light.  The dead space of the floor and placement makes this one feel a bit odd.  The lighting on her face from the window is very natural though.  Also, the focus is quite blurry.  Some unsharp mask would have helped!  nice attempt though.  -3</td>', 'By biggest suggestion would have been to really zoom in close on her face, with the light.  The dead space of the floor and placement makes this one feel a bit odd.  The lighting on her face from the window is very natural though.  Also, the focus is quite blurry.  Some unsharp mask would have helped!  nice attempt though.  -3', '2006-04-17 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318913, 320538, 52336, '<td valign="top">Great character portrait.</td>', 'Great character portrait.', '2006-04-17 12:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318914, 321612, 13982, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and capture.</td>', 'Great lighting and capture.', '2006-04-17 12:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318915, 321383, 13982, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a tad more exposure would have brought out some of the colors in his hat, glasses, tie.  It is just a bit too dark overall.  Still, great focus, and unique shot.  -6</td>', 'Maybe just a tad more exposure would have brought out some of the colors in his hat, glasses, tie.  It is just a bit too dark overall.  Still, great focus, and unique shot.  -6', '2006-04-17 12:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318918, 322005, 13982, '<td valign="top">Just a tad blurry, and the shadow on her lower face is a bit strange.</td>', 'Just a tad blurry, and the shadow on her lower face is a bit strange.', '2006-04-17 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318919, 321147, 13982, '<td valign="top">If the focus and depth of field would have sharpened just a tad for their faces, this would have been perfect.  Still, a perfectly exposed shot with great color and lighting.  -8</td>', 'If the focus and depth of field would have sharpened just a tad for their faces, this would have been perfect.  Still, a perfectly exposed shot with great color and lighting.  -8', '2006-04-17 12:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318924, 321108, 13982, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  This is one of the more unique shots.  It really experiments with lightint and depth of field.  It is just very interesting.  -8</td>', 'Awesome!  This is one of the more unique shots.  It really experiments with lightint and depth of field.  It is just very interesting.  -8', '2006-04-17 12:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318927, 319965, 52336, '<td valign="top">The biggest issue I have with this is the fact that the right lens refracts the image of her eye.  Otherwise, a nice portrait well composed.</td>', 'The biggest issue I have with this is the fact that the right lens refracts the image of her eye.  Otherwise, a nice portrait well composed.', '2006-04-17 12:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318930, 321108, 52336, '<td valign="top">Great image, excellent lighting choice in my opinion.  Well composed, interesting expression.</td>', 'Great image, excellent lighting choice in my opinion.  Well composed, interesting expression.', '2006-04-17 12:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318931, 321400, 13982, '<td valign="top">The eyes look a bit strange here, they are very blue.  Was this from dodging?  Otherwise a nice shot and great colors of her shirt.</td>', 'The eyes look a bit strange here, they are very blue.  Was this from dodging?  Otherwise a nice shot and great colors of her shirt.', '2006-04-17 12:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318932, 320965, 13982, '<td valign="top">Great eyes, color, focus, lighting.  Basically a perfectly executed portrait.</td>', 'Great eyes, color, focus, lighting.  Basically a perfectly executed portrait.', '2006-04-17 12:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318934, 321836, 13982, '<td valign="top">Lighting on her left side is a bit harsh.  I think you could have toned that down a bit.  Still, a nice picture and great composition.</td>', 'Lighting on her left side is a bit harsh.  I think you could have toned that down a bit.  Still, a nice picture and great composition.', '2006-04-17 12:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318936, 321897, 52336, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and great expression, but the lighting really needs a bit of work.</td>', 'Nice portrait and great expression, but the lighting really needs a bit of work.', '2006-04-17 12:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318938, 321309, 13982, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  I love that in her relection, the eye is looking right at the camera.  A subtle element that makes this great.  The picture looks like it could have been a bit sharper (just barely).  Great job! -8</td>', 'Very cool!  I love that in her relection, the eye is looking right at the camera.  A subtle element that makes this great.  The picture looks like it could have been a bit sharper (just barely).  Great job! -8', '2006-04-17 12:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318942, 321957, 40679, '<td valign="top">a little too much editing for me..</td>', 'a little too much editing for me..', '2006-04-17 12:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318943, 321261, 40679, '<td valign="top">a little too much editing for me..</td>', 'a little too much editing for me..', '2006-04-17 12:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318944, 321827, 13982, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tad more exposure, or post-processing to just bring everything out a bit more.  I understand you were going for low key, but it is still a nice shot.</td>', 'Maybe a tad more exposure, or post-processing to just bring everything out a bit more.  I understand you were going for low key, but it is still a nice shot.', '2006-04-17 12:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318948, 321901, 40679, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is ok, but the photo is not 100% sharp. I also think a little fresher background would help a lot.</td>', 'I think the idea is ok, but the photo is not 100% sharp. I also think a little fresher background would help a lot.', '2006-04-17 12:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318952, 321324, 13982, '<td valign="top">Very nice, great composition, nice over all glamour shot.</td>', 'Very nice, great composition, nice over all glamour shot.', '2006-04-17 12:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318954, 322016, 40679, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say it''s out of focus. I think the most important thing in a portraitphoto is that the eyes are sharp.</td>', 'I''m sorry to say it''s out of focus. I think the most important thing in a portraitphoto is that the eyes are sharp.', '2006-04-17 12:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318955, 321081, 40679, '<td valign="top">a little too much editing for me..</td>', 'a little too much editing for me..', '2006-04-17 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318956, 321892, 13982, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit yellowish on her face.  Maybe white balance would have helped, or post processing out a touch of yellow.</td>', 'The light is a bit yellowish on her face.  Maybe white balance would have helped, or post processing out a touch of yellow.', '2006-04-17 12:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318957, 320685, 13982, '<td valign="top">A bit blurry, but a good portrait.</td>', 'A bit blurry, but a good portrait.', '2006-04-17 12:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318958, 321912, 52336, '<td valign="top">Really excellent portrait, nice lighting, and well composed.</td>', 'Really excellent portrait, nice lighting, and well composed.', '2006-04-17 12:50:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2318961, 321315, 13982, '<td valign="top">A refreshing, original take.  Good choice on keeping the portrait focused!</td>', 'A refreshing, original take.  Good choice on keeping the portrait focused!', '2006-04-17 12:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318967, 321451, 13982, '<td valign="top">The focus, while soft, is a bit blurry as a result.  However, you really did a great job with lighting.</td>', 'The focus, while soft, is a bit blurry as a result.  However, you really did a great job with lighting.', '2006-04-17 12:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318972, 321907, 13982, '<td valign="top">Well, the baby is definitely underexposed.  Perhaps some studio style lighting would have helped.</td>', 'Well, the baby is definitely underexposed.  Perhaps some studio style lighting would have helped.', '2006-04-17 12:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318973, 322006, 13982, '<td valign="top">Seems to be much too saturated.  The result is a bit distracting, but still an interesting, original image.  -5</td>', 'Seems to be much too saturated.  The result is a bit distracting, but still an interesting, original image.  -5', '2006-04-17 12:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318976, 321889, 13982, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Great color.  A tad sharper might have helped, and it seems just the faintest bit grainy.  The edges of her arms also seem to have strange lighting and contrast issues, but still I really like this one.  -6</td>', 'Very cool!  Great color.  A tad sharper might have helped, and it seems just the faintest bit grainy.  The edges of her arms also seem to have strange lighting and contrast issues, but still I really like this one.  -6', '2006-04-17 12:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318980, 321835, 13982, '<td valign="top">Very cool, although I would have liked to see it just a tad bit closer to the subject.</td>', 'Very cool, although I would have liked to see it just a tad bit closer to the subject.', '2006-04-17 12:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318983, 320645, 13982, '<td valign="top">The eyes here seem very artificial. Did you dodge them?  They are almost red, which is a bit odd.  Perhaps color balancing them or less processing.  Still, a nice shot. -6</td>', 'The eyes here seem very artificial. Did you dodge them?  They are almost red, which is a bit odd.  Perhaps color balancing them or less processing.  Still, a nice shot. -6', '2006-04-17 12:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318988, 321858, 13982, '<td valign="top">The eyes seem too artificial.  I think it would have been better to just leave them a tad more subtle.  Still, great composition, especially the angle.  Great focus, and nice depth of field.  -7</td>', 'The eyes seem too artificial.  I think it would have been better to just leave them a tad more subtle.  Still, great composition, especially the angle.  Great focus, and nice depth of field.  -7', '2006-04-17 12:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318989, 321103, 13982, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but seems a bit soft on the focus.</td>', 'Nice shot, but seems a bit soft on the focus.', '2006-04-17 12:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2318990, 321975, 13982, '<td valign="top">One more light to get rid of that hat shadow would have helped quite a bit.</td>', 'One more light to get rid of that hat shadow would have helped quite a bit.', '2006-04-17 12:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319001, 321726, 9111, '<td valign="top">This gives her an odd colour to her skin on my monitor... this photo of her is least complimentary of the three photos i''ve seen of her... Sorry Manny</td>', 'This gives her an odd colour to her skin on my monitor... this photo of her is least complimentary of the three photos i''ve seen of her... Sorry Manny', '2006-04-17 13:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319013, 321987, 13982, '<td valign="top">The hand and egg is terribly distracting from this shot.  I think I just would have like thid one better had you cropped out the whole left side and just focused on the girl.</td>', 'The hand and egg is terribly distracting from this shot.  I think I just would have like thid one better had you cropped out the whole left side and just focused on the girl.', '2006-04-17 13:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319014, 321922, 13982, '<td valign="top">One more light from another angle to get rid of the shadow on her face would have been nice.  Perhaps a tad sharper as well.  Still, nice job.</td>', 'One more light from another angle to get rid of the shadow on her face would have been nice.  Perhaps a tad sharper as well.  Still, nice job.', '2006-04-17 13:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319016, 321983, 13982, '<td valign="top">The white balance seems off, as the whole image is very very orange.  Still, nice lighting and composition.  -4</td>', 'The white balance seems off, as the whole image is very very orange.  Still, nice lighting and composition.  -4', '2006-04-17 13:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319019, 321912, 13982, '<td valign="top">The eyes seem much too artificial; too much dodging. Other than that, great composition and feel.</td>', 'The eyes seem much too artificial; too much dodging. Other than that, great composition and feel.', '2006-04-17 13:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319021, 320846, 13982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color, chair, wall, everything.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Wonderful color, chair, wall, everything.  One of my favorites.', '2006-04-17 13:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319024, 321848, 13982, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit harsh on the face.  Other than that, pretty good. -5</td>', 'Lighting is a bit harsh on the face.  Other than that, pretty good. -5', '2006-04-17 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319031, 321980, 13982, '<td valign="top">Eyes seem dodged a tad too much.  A small amount less would have made this seem less artificial.</td>', 'Eyes seem dodged a tad too much.  A small amount less would have made this seem less artificial.', '2006-04-17 13:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319034, 321957, 13982, '<td valign="top">Well, the eyes are totally blue, the face much too red.  Seems there are some odd color issues going around in post processing.</td>', 'Well, the eyes are totally blue, the face much too red.  Seems there are some odd color issues going around in post processing.', '2006-04-17 13:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
