(2319364, 321081, 37103, '<td valign="top">Is this a real person?  If it is it looks fake and very plastic like.  The eyelashes looks like spikes and the mouth and eyes look glossy and sort of slimy.  If it is a real model she looks like if she relaxed and posed in a more comfortable way and you did less post processing you could make a nice portrait.</td>', 'Is this a real person?  If it is it looks fake and very plastic like.  The eyelashes looks like spikes and the mouth and eyes look glossy and sort of slimy.  If it is a real model she looks like if she relaxed and posed in a more comfortable way and you did less post processing you could make a nice portrait.', '2006-04-17 15:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319366, 321726, 4482, '<td valign="top">Well Manny, another great portrait! :-D</td>', 'Well Manny, another great portrait! :-D', '2006-04-17 15:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319369, 321817, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  I like that it is outdoors and that he is looking at something out of our sight.  I think the outfit makes me feel like this might be a magazine/catalog ad, but it''s very nicely done.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  I like that it is outdoors and that he is looking at something out of our sight.  I think the outfit makes me feel like this might be a magazine/catalog ad, but it''s very nicely done.', '2006-04-17 15:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319372, 321042, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like her pose and how you cropped/composed this. The background looks good although the left side has an odd coloration to it that doesn''t match the hue of the right side at least not on my end. <br/> <br/>Back to the model, I like how you stayed true with this shot (i.e. keeping some/all of the age lines in there). However I''m wondering if a slight compromise would have worked better. I''m thinking just a little bit of smoothing/lighting up on the cheek area so that her skin complexion balanced out better with the rest of her face. Since her cheek is darker and more contrasty the details stand out more which takes some of the focus away from her eyes, which look good. <br/> <br/>Well that''s it. Good luck!</td>', 'I like her pose and how you cropped/composed this. The background looks good although the left side has an odd coloration to it that doesn''t match the hue of the right side at least not on my end.  Back to the model, I like how you stayed true with this shot (i.e. keeping some/all of the age lines in there). However I''m wondering if a slight compromise would have worked better. I''m thinking just a little bit of smoothing/lighting up on the cheek area so that her skin complexion balanced out better with the rest of her face. Since her cheek is darker and more contrasty the details stand out more which takes some of the focus away from her eyes, which look good.  Well that''s it. Good luck!', '2006-04-17 15:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319374, 321081, 4482, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is good.<br/> <br/>The use of a NI-like technique does, unfortunately ruin this shot for me. It is over processed including the whitening of the eyes.</td>', 'I think the composition is good. The use of a NI-like technique does, unfortunately ruin this shot for me. It is over processed including the whitening of the eyes.', '2006-04-17 15:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319378, 321506, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the low catchlights and tight crop on the face. I think he has an interesting beard, though, and would have liked to see more of his chin. The skin looks a little over processed, but it doesn''t detract from a great portrait.</td>', 'I like the low catchlights and tight crop on the face. I think he has an interesting beard, though, and would have liked to see more of his chin. The skin looks a little over processed, but it doesn''t detract from a great portrait.', '2006-04-17 15:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319380, 321985, 4482, '<td valign="top">I think the overall lighting is good as well as the composition.<br/> <br/>But the over use of a NI-like technique and the erasing of every single wrinkle as completely ruined this image for me. Portraiture isn''t about smoothe, plastic skin, but about capturing the essence of a person.</td>', 'I think the overall lighting is good as well as the composition. But the over use of a NI-like technique and the erasing of every single wrinkle as completely ruined this image for me. Portraiture isn''t about smoothe, plastic skin, but about capturing the essence of a person.', '2006-04-17 15:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319382, 321971, 4482, '<td valign="top">Was this image submitted in the wrong challenge?</td>', 'Was this image submitted in the wrong challenge?', '2006-04-17 15:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319388, 321315, 4482, '<td valign="top">I truly hope this scores well. I love story-telling images and this one is excellently done! :-)</td>', 'I truly hope this scores well. I love story-telling images and this one is excellently done! :-)', '2006-04-17 15:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319393, 321419, 33515, '<td valign="top">Something seems strange about this photo, her nose, chin and cheeks are all out of focus which don''t seem to be on the same plane.</td>', 'Something seems strange about this photo, her nose, chin and cheeks are all out of focus which don''t seem to be on the same plane.', '2006-04-17 15:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319394, 321872, 4482, '<td valign="top">A very nice glam shot! Great use of lighting. I can see the body was retouched quite a bit to give it that FHM look. You should be working for a top magazine!</td>', 'A very nice glam shot! Great use of lighting. I can see the body was retouched quite a bit to give it that FHM look. You should be working for a top magazine!', '2006-04-17 15:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319396, 321684, 41337, '<td valign="top">The pose and composition works. However the background and lighting are a real issue here. I''d try using a darker background for starters. That bright white not only is distracting but it makes the whites in your eyes look darker. Also try bouncing the flash (if possible) at the ceiling rather than directly at you so as to avoid those harsh shadows. It may under expose the shot in general if you don''t have other lighting equipment to compensate but at least doing it this way you can brighten things up in post using photoshop or the like.</td>', 'The pose and composition works. However the background and lighting are a real issue here. I''d try using a darker background for starters. That bright white not only is distracting but it makes the whites in your eyes look darker. Also try bouncing the flash (if possible) at the ceiling rather than directly at you so as to avoid those harsh shadows. It may under expose the shot in general if you don''t have other lighting equipment to compensate but at least doing it this way you can brighten things up in post using photoshop or the like.', '2006-04-17 15:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319398, 321604, 4482, '<td valign="top">Love the composition of this shot. I nive clean image.</td>', 'Love the composition of this shot. I nive clean image.', '2006-04-17 15:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319399, 320965, 30608, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!!!</td>', 'What a cutie!!!', '2006-04-17 15:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319403, 319830, 4482, '<td valign="top">VEry cool image! Love the movement. I love it when images convey a piece of someone''s personality. Good job!</td>', 'VEry cool image! Love the movement. I love it when images convey a piece of someone''s personality. Good job!', '2006-04-17 15:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
