(2320014, 320903, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good lighting on the model and great colors in the clothes and umbrella.  I''m not incredibly fond of the black background in the lower left corner, but everything else looks nice!</td>', 'Good lighting on the model and great colors in the clothes and umbrella.  I''m not incredibly fond of the black background in the lower left corner, but everything else looks nice!', '2006-04-17 19:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
