(2320070, 321889, 40667, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot! Not really sure about covering the mouth... but meh... lol, just adds mystery ;-) Really like it! Wonder who it could be ;-)</td>', 'Nice Shot! Not really sure about covering the mouth... but meh... lol, just adds mystery ;-) Really like it! Wonder who it could be ;-)', '2006-04-17 19:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
