(2320105, 321556, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like the hair, high-key and blue eye combination... Very good technically.</td>', 'Like the hair, high-key and blue eye combination... Very good technically.', '2006-04-17 19:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320122, 321794, 5664, '<td valign="top">Good work except the light   ice</td>', 'Good work except the light   ice', '2006-04-17 19:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320124, 321873, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed. Shallow DOF with soft focused lips gives your model a wonderful, seductive look. Technically superior image. My only recommendation would be to eliminate the slightly distracting strap in the upper left corner, but still one of the best of the challenge. Kudos to you!</td>', 'Beautifully composed. Shallow DOF with soft focused lips gives your model a wonderful, seductive look. Technically superior image. My only recommendation would be to eliminate the slightly distracting strap in the upper left corner, but still one of the best of the challenge. Kudos to you!', '2006-04-17 19:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320125, 321506, 5728, '<td valign="top">The composition is excellent, I couldn''t have hit it better myself, really a cool crop, respect on that! And as you already know there comes a BUT now, Sorry. The skin tones hit the image very well (that wasn''t the BUT part though). Here it comes: The softness, NeatImage or whatever it was you used, is a touch to exaggerated, esecially if you look at the area just between the eyebrows, just a bit too plastic you see? And also the eye whites are a bit too "overwhite". I would have taken out a little of the white so one could still see a tiny bit of texture in there. The little red veins are bothersome I know, but it is still okay to see a little of them, kind of faded out a touch. But overall, the processing is good, I see you put a lot of work into this.</td>', 'The composition is excellent, I couldn''t have hit it better myself, really a cool crop, respect on that! And as you already know there comes a BUT now, Sorry. The skin tones hit the image very well (that wasn''t the BUT part though). Here it comes: The softness, NeatImage or whatever it was you used, is a touch to exaggerated, esecially if you look at the area just between the eyebrows, just a bit too plastic you see? And also the eye whites are a bit too "overwhite". I would have taken out a little of the white so one could still see a tiny bit of texture in there. The little red veins are bothersome I know, but it is still okay to see a little of them, kind of faded out a touch. But overall, the processing is good, I see you put a lot of work into this.', '2006-04-17 19:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320132, 321930, 5664, '<td valign="top">It have been perfect if you had not have black background for so beautiful kid .. ice</td>', 'It have been perfect if you had not have black background for so beautiful kid .. ice', '2006-04-17 20:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
