(2320158, 321874, 5728, '<td valign="top">Detail amazing! Not oversharpened at all, a very well composed image which will be up there amongst the best at turnover. For me however the green tone is not as fitting as it could be, I would maybe have desaturated it just a touch, he looks a little like Shreck :) I like the processing you have done, but like I said the green is a touch overwhelming.</td>', 'Detail amazing! Not oversharpened at all, a very well composed image which will be up there amongst the best at turnover. For me however the green tone is not as fitting as it could be, I would maybe have desaturated it just a touch, he looks a little like Shreck :) I like the processing you have done, but like I said the green is a touch overwhelming.', '2006-04-17 20:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
