(2320179, 320337, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp, clear image.  Great post process on the eyes.  The crop is just a little tight for me.  Overall, good picture!</td>', 'Nice crisp, clear image.  Great post process on the eyes.  The crop is just a little tight for me.  Overall, good picture!', '2006-04-17 20:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320182, 321836, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression capture and backlighting.</td>', 'Wonderful expression capture and backlighting.', '2006-04-17 20:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320191, 321858, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great image!  The post process on the eyes (cat and girl) are great - I love the DOF.  The girl''s skin tones seem a little off, like curve adjustment was tweaked too much or something - textures seem forced as well. Overall, great image!!</td>', 'Great image!  The post process on the eyes (cat and girl) are great - I love the DOF.  The girl''s skin tones seem a little off, like curve adjustment was tweaked too much or something - textures seem forced as well. Overall, great image!!', '2006-04-17 20:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320196, 321309, 5728, '<td valign="top">Super image and I do like the idea with the reflection. The processing looks good, the skin tones come over well, the composition and lighting is very fitting, and I love the flow of her hair. Only something about the eyes gets me though, I am not too sure what it is though, maybe it is the whites that are too white and have lost their detail. Yep that is it, especially the bottom eye, it is too white, there should be more shadow there. My guess is this will be top ten though for sure.</td>', 'Super image and I do like the idea with the reflection. The processing looks good, the skin tones come over well, the composition and lighting is very fitting, and I love the flow of her hair. Only something about the eyes gets me though, I am not too sure what it is though, maybe it is the whites that are too white and have lost their detail. Yep that is it, especially the bottom eye, it is too white, there should be more shadow there. My guess is this will be top ten though for sure.', '2006-04-17 20:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320200, 320925, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice image - great post processing - should do well on DPC.  Great lighting as well, I love the way the jewelry hanging off the head band adds color and fills in the dark stop - very nicely done.</td>', 'Nice image - great post processing - should do well on DPC.  Great lighting as well, I love the way the jewelry hanging off the head band adds color and fills in the dark stop - very nicely done.', '2006-04-17 20:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320209, 320926, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Very sharp, great image quality.  I understand the closed eyes and listening to music theme - but I would have preferred to to see the eyes.  Something funny just to the right of the ear piece as well, like it was dodged a little too much, just doesn''t seem like a normal lighting effect (at least to me, I could be wrong - no points off my vote for that).</td>', 'Cute!  Very sharp, great image quality.  I understand the closed eyes and listening to music theme - but I would have preferred to to see the eyes.  Something funny just to the right of the ear piece as well, like it was dodged a little too much, just doesn''t seem like a normal lighting effect (at least to me, I could be wrong - no points off my vote for that).', '2006-04-17 20:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320216, 321335, 18197, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel like a studio portrait to me. Just an opinion.</td>', 'Doesn''t feel like a studio portrait to me. Just an opinion.', '2006-04-17 20:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320219, 322000, 40019, '<td valign="top">Classic shot!  Great quality image - nicely done!  Good luck.</td>', 'Classic shot!  Great quality image - nicely done!  Good luck.', '2006-04-17 20:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320225, 319830, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground, middleground, and background shapes in this. As an abstract, it succeeds brilliantly. But as a studio portrait, not so much. I can really see this as a successful commercial photograph. Maybe some monthly pub like <u>Wired</u>. Or possibly as the image behind a text print add. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the foreground, middleground, and background shapes in this. As an abstract, it succeeds brilliantly. But as a studio portrait, not so much. I can really see this as a successful commercial photograph. Maybe some monthly pub like Wired. Or possibly as the image behind a text print add. Good luck.', '2006-04-17 20:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320230, 320380, 56047, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mood set up by your lighting - well done...</td>', 'Wonderful mood set up by your lighting - well done...', '2006-04-17 20:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320233, 321726, 56047, '<td valign="top">The bright colors really set off her skin tones and the details in her face - excellent</td>', 'The bright colors really set off her skin tones and the details in her face - excellent', '2006-04-17 20:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320235, 321848, 18197, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge definition, I guess. If your goal was to create an emotional reaction in me, it worked! Do I like it? No. Would I like it better w/o blown highlights? Yes. Would I like a more traditional image better? Yes. Do I understand the title? No ... born in ''83 maybe?</td>', 'Meets the challenge definition, I guess. If your goal was to create an emotional reaction in me, it worked! Do I like it? No. Would I like it better w/o blown highlights? Yes. Would I like a more traditional image better? Yes. Do I understand the title? No ... born in ''83 maybe?', '2006-04-17 20:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
