(2320252, 321556, 45764, '<td valign="top">Looks like a little too much Neat image messed the eyes up a little.</td>', 'Looks like a little too much Neat image messed the eyes up a little.', '2006-04-17 20:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320266, 321963, 18197, '<td valign="top">This image is perfect. In 127,195 bytes it perfectly conveys the bored and disrespectful and intolerant culture of many of our young people ... the failure to accept parental values ... the intolerance of parental point of view that she is still a child held back from taking her rightful place in life. The colors are perfect with the background clashing violently with the color of the sweater. The choice of a benign Christian holy day is the perfect venue for the challenge of authority. No frilly Easter dress here. No "Pappa''s girl" image of devotion here. No care that folks might not approve of the nicotine. I originally gave this a 1. Because of my violent negative reaction to it. But upon further reflection I have to bump to 10 because it was so successful and technically perfect at creating that reaction. I hate the way the image makes me feel. But I love the photographic excellance that made me feel that way!</td>', 'This image is perfect. In 127,195 bytes it perfectly conveys the bored and disrespectful and intolerant culture of many of our young people ... the failure to accept parental values ... the intolerance of parental point of view that she is still a child held back from taking her rightful place in life. The colors are perfect with the background clashing violently with the color of the sweater. The choice of a benign Christian holy day is the perfect venue for the challenge of authority. No frilly Easter dress here. No "Pappa''s girl" image of devotion here. No care that folks might not approve of the nicotine. I originally gave this a 1. Because of my violent negative reaction to it. But upon further reflection I have to bump to 10 because it was so successful and technically perfect at creating that reaction. I hate the way the image makes me feel. But I love the photographic excellance that made me feel that way!', '2006-04-17 20:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
