(2320445, 321849, 42135, '<td valign="top">Eyes are totally oposite! Would have never guessed :)  I would have cloned the boys hair (on left) out so it''s not just sticking out there.</td>', 'Eyes are totally oposite! Would have never guessed :)  I would have cloned the boys hair (on left) out so it''s not just sticking out there.', '2006-04-17 22:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320446, 321408, 37893, '<td valign="top">This has emotion and power in it. The eyes speak to me as well. I think the whites of the eye are too white but that''s ok. The makeup is a bit overdone for my taste but this image just screams "Ad campaign". This is a powerful and emotive shot. If I were to guess, I would say seeing the ringlite and the pose, this is either Kiwiness or Nasti. If not, I apologize. Good luck. This is definitely top tier imagery ;)</td>', 'This has emotion and power in it. The eyes speak to me as well. I think the whites of the eye are too white but that''s ok. The makeup is a bit overdone for my taste but this image just screams "Ad campaign". This is a powerful and emotive shot. If I were to guess, I would say seeing the ringlite and the pose, this is either Kiwiness or Nasti. If not, I apologize. Good luck. This is definitely top tier imagery ;)', '2006-04-17 22:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2320447, 320078, 35078, '<td valign="top">Very natural beautiful model. Gorgeous eyes! Image a little too centered, but I''ll give you a 10 because she looks so friendly and welcoming!</td>', 'Very natural beautiful model. Gorgeous eyes! Image a little too centered, but I''ll give you a 10 because she looks so friendly and welcoming!', '2006-04-17 22:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
