(2320450, 321811, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting and unique image. I like the colors, composition, contrast and the focus is good. The white may be too extreme for many but it makes the image stand out. Also, it seems her arm is a bit soft along the edges where as the other parts of her like her face and shoulder is more sharp. Not sure if that was because of some post editing work or not but I''d try and get that all fairly sharp to be consistent and also because the areas where it is sharp helps produce good contrast.</td>', 'Interesting and unique image. I like the colors, composition, contrast and the focus is good. The white may be too extreme for many but it makes the image stand out. Also, it seems her arm is a bit soft along the edges where as the other parts of her like her face and shoulder is more sharp. Not sure if that was because of some post editing work or not but I''d try and get that all fairly sharp to be consistent and also because the areas where it is sharp helps produce good contrast.', '2006-04-17 22:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
