(2321256, 320380, 56266, '<td valign="top">Go Kermit</td>', 'Go Kermit', '2006-04-18 07:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321262, 321912, 1531, '<td valign="top">I like the low contrast in the face and shallow DOF. Overall, very good too. 9</td>', 'I like the low contrast in the face and shallow DOF. Overall, very good too. 9', '2006-04-18 07:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321276, 321328, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great coloring and light.  One of the few interesting portraits.  Gorgeous.</td>', 'Great coloring and light.  One of the few interesting portraits.  Gorgeous.', '2006-04-18 07:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321277, 321253, 55838, '<td valign="top">I like this portrait.  It''s clean and interesting.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like this portrait.  It''s clean and interesting.  Nice job.', '2006-04-18 07:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321279, 321867, 55838, '<td valign="top">Thanks for doing something a little different.  Cool.</td>', 'Thanks for doing something a little different.  Cool.', '2006-04-18 07:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321286, 320581, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not raelly fond of the composition here, you cut off parts of both his hands but just barely, I think it´s ok to do that when you really take big parts off but this just looks accidental or that you didn´t have enough space to back off from him (yourself)  Also the lighting isn´t really doing anything from me, I would suggest some way to light his face more and with softer lighting, doesn´t have to be complicated, just bounce a flash on a diffusing reflector a little bit from above.</td>', 'Not raelly fond of the composition here, you cut off parts of both his hands but just barely, I think it´s ok to do that when you really take big parts off but this just looks accidental or that you didn´t have enough space to back off from him (yourself)  Also the lighting isn´t really doing anything from me, I would suggest some way to light his face more and with softer lighting, doesn´t have to be complicated, just bounce a flash on a diffusing reflector a little bit from above.', '2006-04-18 08:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321287, 321827, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too dark and I have looked at it now on two monitors.  Shame really, I think I might have liked this a lot if it were brighter but with the same lighting, the shadow coming from his hat like that.</td>', 'Too dark and I have looked at it now on two monitors.  Shame really, I think I might have liked this a lot if it were brighter but with the same lighting, the shadow coming from his hat like that.', '2006-04-18 08:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321288, 321147, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit too shallow DOF for my taste here, I would have liked to see the mans chin in focus as well but other than that, pretty decent, I like the composition.</td>', 'A bit too shallow DOF for my taste here, I would have liked to see the mans chin in focus as well but other than that, pretty decent, I like the composition.', '2006-04-18 08:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321294, 319628, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of the backround or the post processing here, the glow effect you put on the skin isn´t to my taste and the backround is bugging me, in particular the lower corners that they are darker and seem wrinkled somehow.</td>', 'Not really fond of the backround or the post processing here, the glow effect you put on the skin isn´t to my taste and the backround is bugging me, in particular the lower corners that they are darker and seem wrinkled somehow.', '2006-04-18 08:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321298, 321932, 27482, '<td valign="top">Never been a fan of softfocus and this picture isn´t going to change that, I personally would have liked this heaps better if it were pristine sharp and crystal clear.  Also to nitpick, I didn´t open this in photoshop to verify the histogram but big parts of her arms seem to have blown out highlights, especially her left forearm and shoulder.  Gave this a 6 dispite my issues with softfocus, I like her expression and pose.</td>', 'Never been a fan of softfocus and this picture isn´t going to change that, I personally would have liked this heaps better if it were pristine sharp and crystal clear.  Also to nitpick, I didn´t open this in photoshop to verify the histogram but big parts of her arms seem to have blown out highlights, especially her left forearm and shoulder.  Gave this a 6 dispite my issues with softfocus, I like her expression and pose.', '2006-04-18 08:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321316, 322002, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is just so cute and at Easter time so very suitable.....Well done, great shot.....</td>', 'This is just so cute and at Easter time so very suitable.....Well done, great shot.....', '2006-04-18 08:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321319, 321944, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful, and such a wonderfull culture.....</td>', 'Very beautiful, and such a wonderfull culture.....', '2006-04-18 08:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321320, 321965, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice but did you try a cooler whitebalance, reducing the saturation and punching up the contrast?  I did and I thought it looked much cooler, more gritty somehow?  Anyway, this works well as it is so don´t take this the wrong way, just a suggestion :)</td>', 'Nice but did you try a cooler whitebalance, reducing the saturation and punching up the contrast?  I did and I thought it looked much cooler, more gritty somehow?  Anyway, this works well as it is so don´t take this the wrong way, just a suggestion :)', '2006-04-18 08:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321321, 320078, 48228, '<td valign="top">Lovely.....</td>', 'Lovely.....', '2006-04-18 08:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321324, 321898, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really digging the movement of the hand, it does nothing for me but draw my attention away from his face but I like the lighting, very dramatic.</td>', 'Not really digging the movement of the hand, it does nothing for me but draw my attention away from his face but I like the lighting, very dramatic.', '2006-04-18 08:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321326, 321324, 48228, '<td valign="top">A great portrait here, well done.....</td>', 'A great portrait here, well done.....', '2006-04-18 08:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321327, 321839, 27482, '<td valign="top">Are, is that you?  Nice shot but the eyes a little bit too dark compared to the rest of the shot, a little fill lighting close and from the right would have improved this shot a lot but other than that pretty good :)</td>', 'Are, is that you?  Nice shot but the eyes a little bit too dark compared to the rest of the shot, a little fill lighting close and from the right would have improved this shot a lot but other than that pretty good :)', '2006-04-18 08:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321330, 320462, 27482, '<td valign="top">Why only 480 pixles on the long dimension?  Your score would go up heaps if you made full use of the max size here, trust me.</td>', 'Why only 480 pixles on the long dimension?  Your score would go up heaps if you made full use of the max size here, trust me.', '2006-04-18 08:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321331, 321911, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this is too underexposed for me to rate this fairly.</td>', 'Sorry but this is too underexposed for me to rate this fairly.', '2006-04-18 08:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321332, 321794, 48228, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait.....</td>', 'Lovely portrait.....', '2006-04-18 08:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321336, 321874, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, you look kindof scary Arngrimur!  Friggin love this shot, so totally different from most of the shots in this challenge and it´s really intense.  Love the lighting, especially on the eyes and I think the green hue was a good choice!  8 from me :)</td>', 'Haha, you look kindof scary Arngrimur!  Friggin love this shot, so totally different from most of the shots in this challenge and it´s really intense.  Love the lighting, especially on the eyes and I think the green hue was a good choice!  8 from me :)', '2006-04-18 08:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321339, 321451, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but never been a fan of softfocus and this shot doesn´t change my mind about that technique at all, I would have liked this HEAPS better if it were pristine sharp.</td>', 'Sorry but never been a fan of softfocus and this shot doesn´t change my mind about that technique at all, I would have liked this HEAPS better if it were pristine sharp.', '2006-04-18 08:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321341, 321923, 48228, '<td valign="top">Love this image.....Love it.....</td>', 'Love this image.....Love it.....', '2006-04-18 08:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321342, 320077, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with good lighting with one exception, I find the lack of a catchlight in the eyes make them seem very dull and I think it´s hurting this picture.</td>', 'Nice shot with good lighting with one exception, I find the lack of a catchlight in the eyes make them seem very dull and I think it´s hurting this picture.', '2006-04-18 08:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321347, 321483, 27482, '<td valign="top">I know this is Color studio portrait but this is a shot I think would have worked much better in b/w, it´s just a gut feeling I have.  What I mean is that this seems to be in colour just to be in colour, like it´s natural state is to want to be in b/w and it´s out of it´s chosen form.  Heck, I don´t think I am making too much sense but I think you get what I mean :)  Anyway, like the picture, gave it a 7, I think it shows off his character more than most shots in this challenge, that´s why I like it.</td>', 'I know this is Color studio portrait but this is a shot I think would have worked much better in b/w, it´s just a gut feeling I have.  What I mean is that this seems to be in colour just to be in colour, like it´s natural state is to want to be in b/w and it´s out of it´s chosen form.  Heck, I don´t think I am making too much sense but I think you get what I mean :)  Anyway, like the picture, gave it a 7, I think it shows off his character more than most shots in this challenge, that´s why I like it.', '2006-04-18 08:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321352, 320754, 48228, '<td valign="top">So very cute.....</td>', 'So very cute.....', '2006-04-18 08:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321353, 320581, 48228, '<td valign="top">Clever idea...</td>', 'Clever idea...', '2006-04-18 08:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321355, 321727, 19982, '<td valign="top">I feel that turning her head just a little more towards the light, bringing a little more light on her right eye (left side of image) would help, plus a sharper focus on the eyes.</td>', 'I feel that turning her head just a little more towards the light, bringing a little more light on her right eye (left side of image) would help, plus a sharper focus on the eyes.', '2006-04-18 08:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321356, 321315, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I LOVE the colours in this shot, the whole RGB theme :)  Went straight to my favorites and got a 10 from me, only thing that bugs me and that is just a little nitpick is the left eye seems blurry but I guess he just needs to clean his glasses :)</td>', 'Awesome!  I LOVE the colours in this shot, the whole RGB theme :)  Went straight to my favorites and got a 10 from me, only thing that bugs me and that is just a little nitpick is the left eye seems blurry but I guess he just needs to clean his glasses :)', '2006-04-18 08:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321358, 321897, 27482, '<td valign="top">A little dull, post processing wise.  What I mean is that this could use a lot more contrast and brightening up, at least if you wanted to cater to my taste.</td>', 'A little dull, post processing wise.  What I mean is that this could use a lot more contrast and brightening up, at least if you wanted to cater to my taste.', '2006-04-18 08:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321359, 321324, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good lighting and well composed.</td>', 'Nice shot, good lighting and well composed.', '2006-04-18 08:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321363, 321707, 19982, '<td valign="top">The pose, expression and color make me want to give this a higher rating.  But ... there''s just so little detail left in the blacks (in their hair).  The tops of their heads are just globs of black on my screen... I can''t tell if gaussian blur was applied (kinda looks like it) or if the contrast was just boosted too much.  Anyway, I''d prefer to see hair detail rather than helmets.</td>', 'The pose, expression and color make me want to give this a higher rating.  But ... there''s just so little detail left in the blacks (in their hair).  The tops of their heads are just globs of black on my screen... I can''t tell if gaussian blur was applied (kinda looks like it) or if the contrast was just boosted too much.  Anyway, I''d prefer to see hair detail rather than helmets.', '2006-04-18 08:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321364, 321820, 48228, '<td valign="top">I like this.....</td>', 'I like this.....', '2006-04-18 08:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321365, 320965, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, like this heaps, her expression is just so genuine.  I don´t really care for the super smooth skin though, seems overprocessed but nothing that would bring my score down though, too much NI?  Also the blur in the lower left corner, the one that is over her finger is bothering me a bit, drags my attention from her face.  Gave this an 8 :)</td>', 'Haha, like this heaps, her expression is just so genuine.  I don´t really care for the super smooth skin though, seems overprocessed but nothing that would bring my score down though, too much NI?  Also the blur in the lower left corner, the one that is over her finger is bothering me a bit, drags my attention from her face.  Gave this an 8 :)', '2006-04-18 08:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321366, 321573, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the side lighting ... wish the focus was a little stronger.</td>', 'I like the side lighting ... wish the focus was a little stronger.', '2006-04-18 08:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321367, 321893, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ummm, you did see that this challenge is called colour STUDIO portraitt II right?  Does not meet the challenge, a shame as this is a pretty good picture.  Gave this a 3.</td>', 'Ummm, you did see that this challenge is called colour STUDIO portraitt II right?  Does not meet the challenge, a shame as this is a pretty good picture.  Gave this a 3.', '2006-04-18 08:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
