(2321371, 321451, 19982, '<td valign="top">If blur was applied, try masking off the blur around the eyes and mouth.</td>', 'If blur was applied, try masking off the blur around the eyes and mouth.', '2006-04-18 08:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
