(2321465, 320754, 10390, '<td valign="top">This is very nice but would be better if the girl would have looked to the left of the camera instead of the right, then her face would be better lit. But very nice setup.</td>', 'This is very nice but would be better if the girl would have looked to the left of the camera instead of the right, then her face would be better lit. But very nice setup.', '2006-04-18 09:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321469, 321824, 10390, '<td valign="top">Although the girl is smiling, it looks like she''s not comfortable enough and relaxed. Not bad in whole though.</td>', 'Although the girl is smiling, it looks like she''s not comfortable enough and relaxed. Not bad in whole though.', '2006-04-18 09:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321475, 320903, 10390, '<td valign="top">My comment might seem to be a little strange but I think this model needs to have more simplicity in her clothes, she has very clean face with long straight hair, a green simple dress or maybe red would have made this photo much better, also just a regular umbrella, maybe red or white with white background. I think the pictures in the umbrella and the shirt don''t match with the whole, at least not the shirt, but the model is very nice and the lighting is good.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-26 13:37:00.</i></td>', 'My comment might seem to be a little strange but I think this model needs to have more simplicity in her clothes, she has very clean face with long straight hair, a green simple dress or maybe red would have made this photo much better, also just a regular umbrella, maybe red or white with white background. I think the pictures in the umbrella and the shirt don''t match with the whole, at least not the shirt, but the model is very nice and the lighting is good.', '2006-04-18 09:57:49.000000', '2006-04-26 14:37:00.000000', 1),
(2321483, 321103, 10390, '<td valign="top">This looks like a colored portrait from maybe 40-50 years ago... the colors and everything makes this look very old, like from 1950-60. That is not bad, but I just had to mention it. Good photo.</td>', 'This looks like a colored portrait from maybe 40-50 years ago... the colors and everything makes this look very old, like from 1950-60. That is not bad, but I just had to mention it. Good photo.', '2006-04-18 10:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321488, 321807, 10390, '<td valign="top">It looks like the aperture here is too large, more of the models face in focus would be better, or with as shallow dof as this the focus should be on her left eye not the nose.  The light is a bit too yellow as you have probably just used a regular lamp, you could fix this in Photoshop.  Hence this I like the framing and the expression of the model, don''t take me wrong, this is not a bad photo in whole.</td>', 'It looks like the aperture here is too large, more of the models face in focus would be better, or with as shallow dof as this the focus should be on her left eye not the nose.  The light is a bit too yellow as you have probably just used a regular lamp, you could fix this in Photoshop.  Hence this I like the framing and the expression of the model, don''t take me wrong, this is not a bad photo in whole.', '2006-04-18 10:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321491, 321794, 10390, '<td valign="top">This should have been taken with a lower angle, not that much from above, more straight to the model''s face, not bad.</td>', 'This should have been taken with a lower angle, not that much from above, more straight to the model''s face, not bad.', '2006-04-18 10:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321500, 321835, 10390, '<td valign="top">Something on his plate would make the photo better and maybe if you have placed him a little bit further from the corner. It''s good though.</td>', 'Something on his plate would make the photo better and maybe if you have placed him a little bit further from the corner. It''s good though.', '2006-04-18 10:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321502, 321811, 10390, '<td valign="top">I know this is a COLOR studio portrait challenge, but I think this photo would be better in b&amp;w as this has some 1920-30''s look on it..</td>', 'I know this is a COLOR studio portrait challenge, but I think this photo would be better in b&w as this has some 1920-30''s look on it..', '2006-04-18 10:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
