(2321527, 322009, 27482, '<td valign="top">Like this heaps better than the shots you had on keppni.is where you blew out all hightlights, this is pretty nice.  Like the light over the older girls shoulder to give her hairlight but it´s just a tad too bright and almost blows out the hightlights on her chee, I would turn down the bowens light about 1/2 a stop or even a full stop and see if that doesn´t work better.  Anyway, nice portraits and says more about their character than most shots in this challenge so it got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Like this heaps better than the shots you had on keppni.is where you blew out all hightlights, this is pretty nice.  Like the light over the older girls shoulder to give her hairlight but it´s just a tad too bright and almost blows out the hightlights on her chee, I would turn down the bowens light about 1/2 a stop or even a full stop and see if that doesn´t work better.  Anyway, nice portraits and says more about their character than most shots in this challenge so it got a 7 from me.', '2006-04-18 10:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
