(2321608, 320380, 33515, '<td valign="top">I took a quick look at all the thumb nails for this challenge and this is the one that stopped me, I had to view it in the larger size. I am not a fan of toy cars, stuffed animals, or woody doll pictures but this one is different. I don''t even like Kermit and if I have to see another pizza commercial with Ms Piggy I am going to break the TV set, but again this is different.<br/>I can''t tell you how much I like this photo, very well done. I really hope this is scoring well and I will do my part, 10</td>', 'I took a quick look at all the thumb nails for this challenge and this is the one that stopped me, I had to view it in the larger size. I am not a fan of toy cars, stuffed animals, or woody doll pictures but this one is different. I don''t even like Kermit and if I have to see another pizza commercial with Ms Piggy I am going to break the TV set, but again this is different.I can''t tell you how much I like this photo, very well done. I really hope this is scoring well and I will do my part, 10', '2006-04-18 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
