(2322021, 322010, 44743, '<td valign="top">Pretty model, nicely framed.  Nice catchlight in the eyes.  I''m curious to see what focal length lens was used.  It looks like it was a wide-ish ange lens very close to the subject?  (I certainly could be wrong.)  If so, it could tend to distort some of the proportions a bit.  All in all, a nice portrait.</td>', 'Pretty model, nicely framed.  Nice catchlight in the eyes.  I''m curious to see what focal length lens was used.  It looks like it was a wide-ish ange lens very close to the subject?  (I certainly could be wrong.)  If so, it could tend to distort some of the proportions a bit.  All in all, a nice portrait.', '2006-04-18 14:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
