(2322026, 321678, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool effect you got there with the lightsphere but other than that this shot doesn´t do all that much for me, would have been so cool if you had the crazy scientist guy with the red hair and glasses and then this lightsphere, now THAT would have been cool :)  Still very nice though and I gave this a nice score, got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Pretty cool effect you got there with the lightsphere but other than that this shot doesn´t do all that much for me, would have been so cool if you had the crazy scientist guy with the red hair and glasses and then this lightsphere, now THAT would have been cool :)  Still very nice though and I gave this a nice score, got a 7 from me.', '2006-04-18 14:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
