(2322034, 321918, 44743, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the expression.  The light on the forehead is a bit hot for my taste, but overall I like it.</td>', 'I like the pose and the expression.  The light on the forehead is a bit hot for my taste, but overall I like it.', '2006-04-18 14:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
