(2322041, 322016, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too bad this is out of focus, that and some better lighting and you would have had one heck of a good shot, I like her expression.  This with a dark or even black backround and some soft lighting that would leave smooth shadows over her face would have been ace.  You´ll get there.</td>', 'Too bad this is out of focus, that and some better lighting and you would have had one heck of a good shot, I like her expression.  This with a dark or even black backround and some soft lighting that would leave smooth shadows over her face would have been ace.  You´ll get there.', '2006-04-18 14:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
