(2322045, 321261, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sheesh!  Scary photo, and I mean that in a good way :)</td>', 'Sheesh!  Scary photo, and I mean that in a good way :)', '2006-04-18 14:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322051, 321998, 40819, '<td valign="top">Go Airborne</td>', 'Go Airborne', '2006-04-18 14:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322057, 321907, 27482, '<td valign="top">You did read the challenge name didn´t you?  It´s color STUDIO portrait II so this doesn´t meet the challenge obviously.  Anyway, besides that this is a potentially promising photo but if I ever saw a photo that needed some fill lighting, this would be it.  Turn on your flash next time and I promise you you´ll love the results.  Also the red object in the left corner is distracting, clone that out or crop the photo and it would improve heaps.  Sorry but I gave this a 2, 90% because of DNMC and 10% because of the fill lighting/red object in the corner.  On the plus side I like the shallow DOF and that sure is a cute model that I´ll bet is willing to pose for a reshoot of this :)</td>', 'You did read the challenge name didn´t you?  It´s color STUDIO portrait II so this doesn´t meet the challenge obviously.  Anyway, besides that this is a potentially promising photo but if I ever saw a photo that needed some fill lighting, this would be it.  Turn on your flash next time and I promise you you´ll love the results.  Also the red object in the left corner is distracting, clone that out or crop the photo and it would improve heaps.  Sorry but I gave this a 2, 90% because of DNMC and 10% because of the fill lighting/red object in the corner.  On the plus side I like the shallow DOF and that sure is a cute model that I´ll bet is willing to pose for a reshoot of this :)', '2006-04-18 14:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322062, 320011, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Gotta watch those highlights though, I haven´t checked the histogram to verify this but it looks like huge portions of her dress is blow out but oddly it doesn´t really bother me that much about this photo, makes it more angelic somehow but still I would have preferred to see some texture there.  Anyway, like this photo, what a cute little girl!  Mine is 1 years old and I have already forgotten what it was like when she was this small.  Got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Very cute!  Gotta watch those highlights though, I haven´t checked the histogram to verify this but it looks like huge portions of her dress is blow out but oddly it doesn´t really bother me that much about this photo, makes it more angelic somehow but still I would have preferred to see some texture there.  Anyway, like this photo, what a cute little girl!  Mine is 1 years old and I have already forgotten what it was like when she was this small.  Got a 7 from me.', '2006-04-18 14:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322064, 321879, 27482, '<td valign="top">Bothers me a bit that you have all that forehead in the shot and manage to cut off the chin, it somehow just seems awkward, my suggestion is to keep the chin in the photo when composing like this next time.</td>', 'Bothers me a bit that you have all that forehead in the shot and manage to cut off the chin, it somehow just seems awkward, my suggestion is to keep the chin in the photo when composing like this next time.', '2006-04-18 14:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
