(2322476, 321147, 11960, '<td valign="top">Looks like camera blur overcorrected with sharpening.<br/> <br/>That said, I really like this shot. The tones are great. Subtle, yet strong. And I think the pose works. As does the border! =]<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-24 05:45:12.</i></td>', 'Looks like camera blur overcorrected with sharpening. That said, I really like this shot. The tones are great. Subtle, yet strong. And I think the pose works. As does the border! =]', '2006-04-18 16:54:55.000000', '2006-04-24 06:45:12.000000', 1),
(2322477, 321930, 11467, '<td valign="top">Love the child, just don''t like the lighting here. I guess it is the on camera flash on a small camera.<br/>Try doing the photo again with some other external light source e.g. Halogen work light to the left and a reflector on the right. The results will be much better.</td>', 'Love the child, just don''t like the lighting here. I guess it is the on camera flash on a small camera.Try doing the photo again with some other external light source e.g. Halogen work light to the left and a reflector on the right. The results will be much better.', '2006-04-18 16:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322480, 321794, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think this could definitley be better in a portrait crop, or not so centred in the frame. Appart from that, nice idea, image, model</td>', 'I think this could definitley be better in a portrait crop, or not so centred in the frame. Appart from that, nice idea, image, model', '2006-04-18 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322482, 321918, 11960, '<td valign="top">Good stuff... only bothersome bit are the hot spots... which i don''t think are totally blown out, but they''re distracting.</td>', 'Good stuff... only bothersome bit are the hot spots... which i don''t think are totally blown out, but they''re distracting.', '2006-04-18 16:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322485, 319495, 11467, '<td valign="top">That is realy cute. Love the idea, crop &amp; colours. Catchlight in the eyes works well.</td>', 'That is realy cute. Love the idea, crop & colours. Catchlight in the eyes works well.', '2006-04-18 16:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322490, 321451, 11467, '<td valign="top">I find the image too soft, Lighting is a little flat also (though good butterfly lighting). Pose &amp; composition are very good.</td>', 'I find the image too soft, Lighting is a little flat also (though good butterfly lighting). Pose & composition are very good.', '2006-04-18 16:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322495, 321937, 11467, '<td valign="top">Aarg! Wide angles for portraits are not good! Over sharpened also.</td>', 'Aarg! Wide angles for portraits are not good! Over sharpened also.', '2006-04-18 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322499, 321856, 11467, '<td valign="top">So cool. Loe the idea. Somehow a little flat on my monitor, still extra points for originality.</td>', 'So cool. Loe the idea. Somehow a little flat on my monitor, still extra points for originality.', '2006-04-18 17:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322509, 321483, 57290, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2006-04-18 17:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322510, 321579, 48739, '<td valign="top">Really Cool idea...Red is a little strong...</td>', 'Really Cool idea...Red is a little strong...', '2006-04-18 17:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
