(2322516, 321836, 11467, '<td valign="top">A very captivating image. Made me stop &amp; look for a while.<br/>Perhaps a little to bright on her right. Possibly screening the background light would have reduced that. Exposure of the background is Perfect, no lost detail in the hair. Perhaps a little on the shoulder, but that is probably from the light directly hitting her.</td>', 'A very captivating image. Made me stop & look for a while.Perhaps a little to bright on her right. Possibly screening the background light would have reduced that. Exposure of the background is Perfect, no lost detail in the hair. Perhaps a little on the shoulder, but that is probably from the light directly hitting her.', '2006-04-18 17:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322517, 320822, 57290, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful little girl!  Great photo!</td>', 'What a beautiful little girl!  Great photo!', '2006-04-18 17:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322521, 321108, 57290, '<td valign="top">Really nice lighting.</td>', 'Really nice lighting.', '2006-04-18 17:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
