(2322539, 321103, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think that the fstop was too small here. the dog seems in focus but not the boy. Use at least 8 or 11 to get a better DOF.</td>', 'I think that the fstop was too small here. the dog seems in focus but not the boy. Use at least 8 or 11 to get a better DOF.', '2006-04-18 17:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322540, 321824, 50056, '<td valign="top">I saw this on Daily Awards and voted high (don''t know why it wasn''t ranked higher?!) I think it''s a great shot of a pretty girl and a pleasing expression 8</td>', 'I saw this on Daily Awards and voted high (don''t know why it wasn''t ranked higher?!) I think it''s a great shot of a pretty girl and a pleasing expression 8', '2006-04-18 17:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322543, 321081, 11467, '<td valign="top">Ms. Over Processed.<br/>Lighting is not bad. Perhaps a little harsh, needs to be softened to get rid of the harsh shadows.</td>', 'Ms. Over Processed.Lighting is not bad. Perhaps a little harsh, needs to be softened to get rid of the harsh shadows.', '2006-04-18 17:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322545, 321856, 33515, '<td valign="top">Not one of my favorites but for the originality and the amount of thought that went into this you get a 10. It is well done and even with all the white nothing is burned.<br/>I changed my mine by the way, it is one of my favorites.</td>', 'Not one of my favorites but for the originality and the amount of thought that went into this you get a 10. It is well done and even with all the white nothing is burned.I changed my mine by the way, it is one of my favorites.', '2006-04-18 17:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322552, 322001, 11467, '<td valign="top">Get her further away from the background to get rid of the shadows. Mixed lighting (Daylight &amp; halogen??) is causing colour variations between left &amp; right.</td>', 'Get her further away from the background to get rid of the shadows. Mixed lighting (Daylight & halogen??) is causing colour variations between left & right.', '2006-04-18 17:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322555, 321726, 33515, '<td valign="top">I think this color version is better than the B&amp;W</td>', 'I think this color version is better than the B&W', '2006-04-18 17:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322561, 321408, 42005, '<td valign="top">A very lovely "different'' veiled treatment.  The hands over the mouth area, over<br/>the veil so double the title''s meaning.  10</td>', 'A very lovely "different'' veiled treatment.  The hands over the mouth area, overthe veil so double the title''s meaning.  10', '2006-04-18 17:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2322565, 321639, 11467, '<td valign="top">Even though it is a little too soft, I#m giving a 7 as I love the idea, colours, lighting &amp; composition</td>', 'Even though it is a little too soft, I#m giving a 7 as I love the idea, colours, lighting & composition', '2006-04-18 17:23:18.000000', NULL, 1);
