(2322575, 321684, 11467, '<td valign="top">Oh dear..<br/>Move away from the background.<br/>Get your flash off your camera.<br/>Soften the harsh light from the flash.<br/>Don''t use editing software to get rid of an ugly background. This is done by over exposing it with lights.</td>', 'Oh dear..Move away from the background.Get your flash off your camera.Soften the harsh light from the flash.Don''t use editing software to get rid of an ugly background. This is done by over exposing it with lights.', '2006-04-18 17:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
