(2322913, 321794, 39349, '<td valign="top">Love the hair, composition is a bit centered but nothing to knock points off for. Also, (not knocking points off) clone / healing brush out the tan lines, they pull my eye out towards her shoulders and chest away from those wonderful eyes. Overall this is a beautiful shot in every way that you and the lovely model should be very proud of.</td>', 'Love the hair, composition is a bit centered but nothing to knock points off for. Also, (not knocking points off) clone / healing brush out the tan lines, they pull my eye out towards her shoulders and chest away from those wonderful eyes. Overall this is a beautiful shot in every way that you and the lovely model should be very proud of.', '2006-04-18 20:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
