(2324773, 320900, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like this image. It is very clear. I wonder if the model could have looked like he was enjoying the watermelon. The eyes are not smiling. However it is an attractive image.</td>', 'I like this image. It is very clear. I wonder if the model could have looked like he was enjoying the watermelon. The eyes are not smiling. However it is an attractive image.', '2006-04-19 07:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324778, 320647, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity, It is not often you see a model wearing spectacles. Bumped</td>', 'I like the clarity, It is not often you see a model wearing spectacles. Bumped', '2006-04-19 07:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324783, 321639, 32885, '<td valign="top">IMHO I would have liked to see the entire face in focus rather than just the eyes.</td>', 'IMHO I would have liked to see the entire face in focus rather than just the eyes.', '2006-04-19 07:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324790, 321836, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the clarity and especially the skin tones.</td>', 'Nice, I like the clarity and especially the skin tones.', '2006-04-19 07:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324793, 321873, 5728, '<td valign="top">You always bring out the best in Jessamyn. Beautiful!</td>', 'You always bring out the best in Jessamyn. Beautiful!', '2006-04-19 07:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324797, 321635, 32885, '<td valign="top">IMO I would have liked to see the brush and cheeks in focus. I believe they are too soft.</td>', 'IMO I would have liked to see the brush and cheeks in focus. I believe they are too soft.', '2006-04-19 07:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324809, 321253, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of this image. Well done.</td>', 'I like the clarity of this image. Well done.', '2006-04-19 07:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324810, 321876, 32885, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the white background does this image justice IMHO.</td>', 'I don''t think the white background does this image justice IMHO.', '2006-04-19 07:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324813, 320676, 32885, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if the white background enhances this image. The model''s complexion is, IMHO, too light for the background.</td>', 'I am not sure if the white background enhances this image. The model''s complexion is, IMHO, too light for the background.', '2006-04-19 07:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324815, 321875, 32885, '<td valign="top">An excellent capture. I like the clarity and the emotion. Well done. Perhaps a fraction too much light from the left of the image.</td>', 'An excellent capture. I like the clarity and the emotion. Well done. Perhaps a fraction too much light from the left of the image.', '2006-04-19 07:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324820, 321833, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice set up. I like the concept however it is a shame that the model''s face is not in focus.</td>', 'Nice set up. I like the concept however it is a shame that the model''s face is not in focus.', '2006-04-19 07:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324831, 321856, 32885, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image. I like it. I am not sure if a differnt shade of grey (perhaps darker?) would have enhanced the background?</td>', 'Fascinating image. I like it. I am not sure if a differnt shade of grey (perhaps darker?) would have enhanced the background?', '2006-04-19 07:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324833, 321858, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good portrait and capture of both.  Colors are nice, although wonder if a variant in the background may have given this something extra.  A more finely tuned crop, especially at the top, may have also made this even better in my opinion.  Some slight ''issues'' on the girl''s nose, but fairly minor.  The cat really makes this.</td>', '8 - Very good portrait and capture of both.  Colors are nice, although wonder if a variant in the background may have given this something extra.  A more finely tuned crop, especially at the top, may have also made this even better in my opinion.  Some slight ''issues'' on the girl''s nose, but fairly minor.  The cat really makes this.', '2006-04-19 07:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324838, 320011, 48560, '<td valign="top">I like the softness</td>', 'I like the softness', '2006-04-19 07:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324843, 321101, 32885, '<td valign="top">An interesting model choice. Why military? I think a lighter background that contrasts more with the unform would have, IMHO, enhanced this image.</td>', 'An interesting model choice. Why military? I think a lighter background that contrasts more with the unform would have, IMHO, enhanced this image.', '2006-04-19 07:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324850, 321849, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice portrait.  Tonings seem good.  Difficult without knowing the characters of these individuals to comment on that aspect of this portraiture.  Might just be the angle/lighting/etc but the ''brother'' seems to have a slightly better ''depth'' (hard to explain) than the ''sister''.  Difficult, but a more finely tuned crop ''somewhere'', may have refined this even more, in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Very nice portrait.  Tonings seem good.  Difficult without knowing the characters of these individuals to comment on that aspect of this portraiture.  Might just be the angle/lighting/etc but the ''brother'' seems to have a slightly better ''depth'' (hard to explain) than the ''sister''.  Difficult, but a more finely tuned crop ''somewhere'', may have refined this even more, in my opinion.', '2006-04-19 07:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324855, 321726, 32885, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing image. It looks even better in colour. The clarity, detail and emotion is wonderful. Well done.</td>', 'This is an amazing image. It looks even better in colour. The clarity, detail and emotion is wonderful. Well done.', '2006-04-19 07:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324860, 321636, 48560, '<td valign="top">professional looking. very natural colours. nice work.</td>', 'professional looking. very natural colours. nice work.', '2006-04-19 07:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324865, 320647, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice portrait with simplicity.  Difficult to offer much feedback because it depends what you were trying to ''capture''.  Tonings look good.</td>', '8 - Nice portrait with simplicity.  Difficult to offer much feedback because it depends what you were trying to ''capture''.  Tonings look good.', '2006-04-19 07:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324866, 321483, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like this image. I like the shadows and how they do not obscure the clarity of the face as so many others do. Well done.</td>', 'I like this image. I like the shadows and how they do not obscure the clarity of the face as so many others do. Well done.', '2006-04-19 07:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324872, 321309, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  The gaze in the reflection works well.  Not sure how easy focal-wise it would be to do (still retaining the reflection), but a little more skin/eyes/hair detail may have made this even better in my opinion.  Wonder about it flipped horizontally, but I don''t think it''d work the same, who knows.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  The gaze in the reflection works well.  Not sure how easy focal-wise it would be to do (still retaining the reflection), but a little more skin/eyes/hair detail may have made this even better in my opinion.  Wonder about it flipped horizontally, but I don''t think it''d work the same, who knows.', '2006-04-19 07:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324873, 321983, 32885, '<td valign="top">This model does not look, to me, to be particularly joyful. In fact the model looks bored with the entire project. She could be happy?</td>', 'This model does not look, to me, to be particularly joyful. In fact the model looks bored with the entire project. She could be happy?', '2006-04-19 07:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324874, 321147, 48560, '<td valign="top">I''d personally prefer a tighter crop around their faces :)</td>', 'I''d personally prefer a tighter crop around their faces :)', '2006-04-19 07:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324900, 320581, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. Well done.</td>', 'I like the concept. Well done.', '2006-04-19 07:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324904, 321854, 48560, '<td valign="top">why is the lion''s head in focus, while the man''s face isn''t?</td>', 'why is the lion''s head in focus, while the man''s face isn''t?', '2006-04-19 07:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324905, 320835, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like the nice simple and clear image.</td>', 'I like the nice simple and clear image.', '2006-04-19 07:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324908, 320380, 32885, '<td valign="top">One of the very few times a toy actually works. Well done. I like this image very much. Nice and simple.</td>', 'One of the very few times a toy actually works. Well done. I like this image very much. Nice and simple.', '2006-04-19 07:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324914, 321858, 48560, '<td valign="top">Wow! This photo is so striking at first glance and kept me looking on.<br/>The DOF is just right. Lovely!</td>', 'Wow! This photo is so striking at first glance and kept me looking on.The DOF is just right. Lovely!', '2006-04-19 07:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324923, 321633, 32885, '<td valign="top">OK, its a nice woody. The lighting and shadows effect are good.</td>', 'OK, its a nice woody. The lighting and shadows effect are good.', '2006-04-19 07:56:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2324925, 321108, 32885, '<td valign="top">IMHO this image is too dark. The face is too much in shadow. I think there is enough intensity in the subject''s eyes without the need to overdo the shadow effects.</td>', 'IMHO this image is too dark. The face is too much in shadow. I think there is enough intensity in the subject''s eyes without the need to overdo the shadow effects.', '2006-04-19 07:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324926, 320822, 48560, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice high key photo. all attention seem to be collected on the eyes of the child. beautiful.</td>', 'this is a very nice high key photo. all attention seem to be collected on the eyes of the child. beautiful.', '2006-04-19 07:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324927, 321827, 32885, '<td valign="top">What a character. The pose is great and the sly grim makes this image. It is a pity that it is IMHO a bit too dark. I would have liked to see more detail.</td>', 'What a character. The pose is great and the sly grim makes this image. It is a pity that it is IMHO a bit too dark. I would have liked to see more detail.', '2006-04-19 07:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324929, 320738, 48560, '<td valign="top">nice and clean</td>', 'nice and clean', '2006-04-19 08:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324931, 320462, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice image but a bit soft IMHO. I would have liked to see the subject in better focus.</td>', 'Nice image but a bit soft IMHO. I would have liked to see the subject in better focus.', '2006-04-19 08:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324934, 320675, 48560, '<td valign="top">good photo</td>', 'good photo', '2006-04-19 08:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324940, 321811, 35602, '<td valign="top">The concept of this one is really great.  I love the contrast of the pink against the background.  For me, though, I did not care for the really overwhite exposure of the skin.  I assume you were trying to make it marble like.  Even so it is very creative and unique in its approach.  7</td>', 'The concept of this one is really great.  I love the contrast of the pink against the background.  For me, though, I did not care for the really overwhite exposure of the skin.  I assume you were trying to make it marble like.  Even so it is very creative and unique in its approach.  7', '2006-04-19 08:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324942, 321827, 35602, '<td valign="top">Need more light on the left.  Maybe using a reflecting board would have just given it enough to highlight that side of the face.</td>', 'Need more light on the left.  Maybe using a reflecting board would have just given it enough to highlight that side of the face.', '2006-04-19 08:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324963, 321999, 48560, '<td valign="top">what a princess :)</td>', 'what a princess :)', '2006-04-19 08:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324969, 321229, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Nicely done.  One of my top picks.', '2006-04-19 08:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324970, 321328, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  My other top pick for the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done.  My other top pick for the challenge.', '2006-04-19 08:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324976, 320822, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up.  Lighting looks good and picture is sharp.  That stare is pretty intense.</td>', 'Nice close-up.  Lighting looks good and picture is sharp.  That stare is pretty intense.', '2006-04-19 08:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324977, 320380, 48560, '<td valign="top">I voted this a 9.<br/>I loved the exposure as it seems perfect, even on the frog''s green body.<br/>The execution is really good as Kermit Frog looks so alive.<br/>The composition includes his creator''s potrait in the back, and I like that, except it would be better if it''s a little sharper? Just my opinion. cheers.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-17 23:50:55.</i></td>', 'I voted this a 9.I loved the exposure as it seems perfect, even on the frog''s green body.The execution is really good as Kermit Frog looks so alive.The composition includes his creator''s potrait in the back, and I like that, except it would be better if it''s a little sharper? Just my opinion. cheers.', '2006-04-19 08:20:17.000000', '2006-05-18 00:50:55.000000', 1),
(2324979, 320925, 39880, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Lighting is excellent.</td>', 'Great shot.  Lighting is excellent.', '2006-04-19 08:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324982, 321324, 39880, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The shadow over her left eye is kind of distracting.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The shadow over her left eye is kind of distracting.', '2006-04-19 08:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324984, 321633, 22459, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2006-04-19 08:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324985, 321483, 39880, '<td valign="top">Pretty darn good shot.  Lighting is just right.  Nice and sharp.  Well done.</td>', 'Pretty darn good shot.  Lighting is just right.  Nice and sharp.  Well done.', '2006-04-19 08:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324987, 321604, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the reflective look.</td>', 'I like the reflective look.', '2006-04-19 08:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324992, 322008, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice playful expression.  Light seems just a tad blown out on her front.  But the lighting on her face is great.</td>', 'Nice playful expression.  Light seems just a tad blown out on her front.  But the lighting on her face is great.', '2006-04-19 08:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2324996, 321922, 39880, '<td valign="top">just a bit soft.  Colors and lighting look good.</td>', 'just a bit soft.  Colors and lighting look good.', '2006-04-19 08:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325004, 321576, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad but needs sharper eyes to really "pop".</td>', 'Not bad but needs sharper eyes to really "pop".', '2006-04-19 08:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325009, 321827, 22459, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of the image and subject looks like a real character, but this is DPC the average voter will think this is too dark and vote it down not me I love and will score it high.</td>', 'I really like the feel of the image and subject looks like a real character, but this is DPC the average voter will think this is too dark and vote it down not me I love and will score it high.', '2006-04-19 08:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325011, 319974, 27482, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect example why a wide lens is normally not used in portrait photography, it makes the things closest to the camera seem much bigger than the rest and isn´t flattering to most subjects.  Try backing off next time and using a longer lens and I´ll bet you´ll like the results much better...</td>', 'This is a perfect example why a wide lens is normally not used in portrait photography, it makes the things closest to the camera seem much bigger than the rest and isn´t flattering to most subjects.  Try backing off next time and using a longer lens and I´ll bet you´ll like the results much better...', '2006-04-19 08:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325021, 321939, 27482, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this is Kita´s shot, am I right?  Pretty good, I like the composition but on the downside this would be better with some sort of catchlight in the eyes, doesn´t have to be a big one though, just would bring some life to her eyes.  6 from me.</td>', 'I have a feeling this is Kita´s shot, am I right?  Pretty good, I like the composition but on the downside this would be better with some sort of catchlight in the eyes, doesn´t have to be a big one though, just would bring some life to her eyes.  6 from me.', '2006-04-19 08:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325080, 321807, 27482, '<td valign="top">First thing that popped into my mind when I opened this was that it needs better focus on the eyes, other than that a pretty decent photo.</td>', 'First thing that popped into my mind when I opened this was that it needs better focus on the eyes, other than that a pretty decent photo.', '2006-04-19 08:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325162, 321081, 36141, '<td valign="top">Too...well too much of everything for my taste.</td>', 'Too...well too much of everything for my taste.', '2006-04-19 09:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325213, 320967, 49391, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2006-04-19 09:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325219, 321726, 49391, '<td valign="top">SO AWESOME!!!! 10</td>', 'SO AWESOME!!!! 10', '2006-04-19 10:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325220, 319830, 51802, '<td valign="top">The blur doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The blur doesn''t work for me.', '2006-04-19 10:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325222, 320380, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like Kermit.  This is a well done shot.  I like the lighting on Kermit and the Jim Hensen picture in the back.  Well done.</td>', 'I like Kermit.  This is a well done shot.  I like the lighting on Kermit and the Jim Hensen picture in the back.  Well done.', '2006-04-19 10:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325229, 321369, 39880, '<td valign="top">Is that a smirk I see?  Well done.  Great shot.</td>', 'Is that a smirk I see?  Well done.  Great shot.', '2006-04-19 10:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325230, 321856, 49391, '<td valign="top">creative and creepy</td>', 'creative and creepy', '2006-04-19 10:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325233, 321929, 49391, '<td valign="top">So Gorgeous... captivating! 10</td>', 'So Gorgeous... captivating! 10', '2006-04-19 10:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325238, 321878, 39880, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I like your choice of lighting.  Well done.</td>', 'Good shot.  I like your choice of lighting.  Well done.', '2006-04-19 10:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325241, 319738, 49391, '<td valign="top">I love it, though he looks sad... gorgeous.</td>', 'I love it, though he looks sad... gorgeous.', '2006-04-19 10:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325249, 320011, 49391, '<td valign="top">wonderful soft lighting and perfect capture of moment!</td>', 'wonderful soft lighting and perfect capture of moment!', '2006-04-19 10:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325251, 321315, 49391, '<td valign="top">WOW! The colors, composition, everything awesome! 10</td>', 'WOW! The colors, composition, everything awesome! 10', '2006-04-19 10:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325257, 320380, 49391, '<td valign="top">NICE!</td>', 'NICE!', '2006-04-19 10:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325259, 320965, 49391, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, this photo is fantastic!</td>', 'Oh my goodness, this photo is fantastic!', '2006-04-19 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325424, 322010, 15204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I like the way her hair frames her face and fils the frame.  The lighting is soft and well placed.  It seems like there is a yellow cast, but that could be as you intended.   bumping to a 7</td>', 'Beautiful.  I like the way her hair frames her face and fils the frame.  The lighting is soft and well placed.  It seems like there is a yellow cast, but that could be as you intended.   bumping to a 7', '2006-04-19 10:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325559, 321556, 34938, '<td valign="top">stunning face..wow, brathtaking eyes...love the edit. Well done, hope you do well with this...</td>', 'stunning face..wow, brathtaking eyes...love the edit. Well done, hope you do well with this...', '2006-04-19 11:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325580, 319424, 46294, '<td valign="top">Did you use Neat image? It''s a bit too smooth imho.<br/> <br/>EDIT:<br/>No "neat" Image? Wow he''s got a great skin and your lightning is beautiful!!</td>', 'Did you use Neat image? It''s a bit too smooth imho. EDIT:No "neat" Image? Wow he''s got a great skin and your lightning is beautiful!!', '2006-04-19 11:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325638, 319965, 36371, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this. Would have liked it better without the glasses. Or if you must wear them, should be worn properly. They look askew somehow.</td>', 'Love the colors in this. Would have liked it better without the glasses. Or if you must wear them, should be worn properly. They look askew somehow.', '2006-04-19 12:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325721, 321957, 45672, '<td valign="top">Would have been a nice shot, but the over processed look takes away from it.</td>', 'Would have been a nice shot, but the over processed look takes away from it.', '2006-04-19 12:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325723, 322016, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I think this one would have been a little better if it were more in focus.  It seems to be just a little too blury.</td>', 'Nice shot, I think this one would have been a little better if it were more in focus.  It seems to be just a little too blury.', '2006-04-19 12:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325734, 320967, 27482, '<td valign="top">Works very well to have people as backround, something I learned from the Triptych challenge.  This shot works, not terribly fond of the strong lighting from below but it´s not bad either, just think I would have preferred it if the topside lightsource and the bottom lightsource had their power reversed to give off a stronger shadow from her chin.  Anyway, like it, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Works very well to have people as backround, something I learned from the Triptych challenge.  This shot works, not terribly fond of the strong lighting from below but it´s not bad either, just think I would have preferred it if the topside lightsource and the bottom lightsource had their power reversed to give off a stronger shadow from her chin.  Anyway, like it, gave it a 7.', '2006-04-19 12:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325735, 321780, 27482, '<td valign="top">I believe congratulations are in order to the expecting mother :)</td>', 'I believe congratulations are in order to the expecting mother :)', '2006-04-19 12:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325745, 321271, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I loathe soft focus and this is not an image that is going to change that fact, I simply do not understand what people like about soft focus.  I just would have liked this image so much better if it were crystal clear and that is why I only gave it a 5.  Like her expression.</td>', 'Sorry, I loathe soft focus and this is not an image that is going to change that fact, I simply do not understand what people like about soft focus.  I just would have liked this image so much better if it were crystal clear and that is why I only gave it a 5.  Like her expression.', '2006-04-19 13:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325750, 320925, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, I have a feeling I know who took this photo, if I am correct this is a self portrait.  I like the lighting in this one, pretty well done and I´m sure it´s doing well :)</td>', 'Haha, I have a feeling I know who took this photo, if I am correct this is a self portrait.  I like the lighting in this one, pretty well done and I´m sure it´s doing well :)', '2006-04-19 13:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325757, 321985, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry to bring this up but I feel I owe you to be honest, the skin looks very overprocessed, she looks like a plastic doll and not a real person and what a shame, she looks very attractive and a couple of blemishes only give her character wich is what I feel is missing in this picture.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Sorry to bring this up but I feel I owe you to be honest, the skin looks very overprocessed, she looks like a plastic doll and not a real person and what a shame, she looks very attractive and a couple of blemishes only give her character wich is what I feel is missing in this picture.  Nice lighting.', '2006-04-19 13:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325764, 319965, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice job, I really like the lighting in this one and her expression, feel like it tells me a bit about the girl in the photo.  Only to nitpick though, I don´t like the way her glasses, in specific the top rim is cutting through her eye like that, I would have adjusted them so either they are either lower on her nose so that her eyes are above the rim or the total opposite.  Got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice job, I really like the lighting in this one and her expression, feel like it tells me a bit about the girl in the photo.  Only to nitpick though, I don´t like the way her glasses, in specific the top rim is cutting through her eye like that, I would have adjusted them so either they are either lower on her nose so that her eyes are above the rim or the total opposite.  Got a 7 from me.', '2006-04-19 13:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325770, 321408, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love those catchlights, almost done with the voting and been waiting to se a ring catchlight, love those.  Not really loving the post processing as it comes to skintones though, too white/purple somehow for my taste, also composed a little bit too tightly or not tight enough somehow, what I mean is either compose tighter and lose the fingers and just concentrate on her eyes and that area or a slightly wider composition that has all of the left hand in the shot and most of the right one too and show more of her hair, this is somewhere in between and it just doesn´t seem to fit somehow, well to my taste anyway :)<br/> <br/>Like this photo, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Love those catchlights, almost done with the voting and been waiting to se a ring catchlight, love those.  Not really loving the post processing as it comes to skintones though, too white/purple somehow for my taste, also composed a little bit too tightly or not tight enough somehow, what I mean is either compose tighter and lose the fingers and just concentrate on her eyes and that area or a slightly wider composition that has all of the left hand in the shot and most of the right one too and show more of her hair, this is somewhere in between and it just doesn´t seem to fit somehow, well to my taste anyway :) Like this photo, gave it a 7.', '2006-04-19 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325778, 321812, 35602, '<td valign="top">The shadow kills this portrait.  Subject should be placed further from the background, and any shadows can be covered up with a reflecting board positioned so it is directed at the shadow.  Model was very attractive, though, and you did a wonderful job on creating a nice skin tone.</td>', 'The shadow kills this portrait.  Subject should be placed further from the background, and any shadows can be covered up with a reflecting board positioned so it is directed at the shadow.  Model was very attractive, though, and you did a wonderful job on creating a nice skin tone.', '2006-04-19 13:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325786, 320926, 35602, '<td valign="top">This could actually be a great ad photo to sell MP3''s.  I like the eyes closed and the moth slightly open as if she is singing along.  Your lighting on the hair was also pretty good.  The only thing that might have improved the hair would be a halo light above the subject.  Otherwise, well done and interesting.</td>', 'This could actually be a great ad photo to sell MP3''s.  I like the eyes closed and the moth slightly open as if she is singing along.  Your lighting on the hair was also pretty good.  The only thing that might have improved the hair would be a halo light above the subject.  Otherwise, well done and interesting.', '2006-04-19 13:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325808, 321581, 35602, '<td valign="top">Love the smoke in the background.  Even the pipe shows a bit of light.  Loved this portrait.  Need just a bit of reflected light on the bottom of the beard.</td>', 'Love the smoke in the background.  Even the pipe shows a bit of light.  Loved this portrait.  Need just a bit of reflected light on the bottom of the beard.', '2006-04-19 13:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2325834, 321253, 35602, '<td valign="top">I liked the style, but the skin tone seems a bit off.  It seems to have more yellow than it should.  You did a wonderful depiction of textures in this one, and the eyes are very clear.  8</td>', 'I liked the style, but the skin tone seems a bit off.  It seems to have more yellow than it should.  You did a wonderful depiction of textures in this one, and the eyes are very clear.  8', '2006-04-19 13:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
