(2325959, 320925, 34134, '<td valign="top">This is GREAT!!! Great pose, great costume, great lighting and a truly great earring! Great job.</td>', 'This is GREAT!!! Great pose, great costume, great lighting and a truly great earring! Great job.', '2006-04-19 14:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2326037, 321957, 15204, '<td valign="top">Your colors are off, which may have been intended but it doesn''t work for me.  Her skintones look too red and the whites of her eyes are blue (yet her teeth are white).  Other than that, it is a nice, flattering portrait and the composition is good.  A smaller nitpick, having her neckline incomplete (cut off by the crop) leads my eye out of the frame.  A 5 from me.</td>', 'Your colors are off, which may have been intended but it doesn''t work for me.  Her skintones look too red and the whites of her eyes are blue (yet her teeth are white).  Other than that, it is a nice, flattering portrait and the composition is good.  A smaller nitpick, having her neckline incomplete (cut off by the crop) leads my eye out of the frame.  A 5 from me.', '2006-04-19 14:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2326040, 322006, 15204, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and I like the composition.  It is a little overprocessed for my taste, but it suits the mood of the portrait.  6 from me.</td>', 'Nice lines and I like the composition.  It is a little overprocessed for my taste, but it suits the mood of the portrait.  6 from me.', '2006-04-19 14:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
