(2326052, 321901, 15204, '<td valign="top">Next time try angling her shoulders so that she is not posed so square to the camera.   Also, her hand being cut off by the crop makes it look a little disembodied.  I might leave more room below her and take some off the top.  Lovely model and a very nice expression.</td>', 'Next time try angling her shoulders so that she is not posed so square to the camera.   Also, her hand being cut off by the crop makes it look a little disembodied.  I might leave more room below her and take some off the top.  Lovely model and a very nice expression.', '2006-04-19 14:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
