(2327526, 321315, 55480, '<td valign="top">This one stands out from the rest. It is by far my favorite in the competition. I hope it ribbons.</td>', 'This one stands out from the rest. It is by far my favorite in the competition. I hope it ribbons.', '2006-04-19 22:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
