(2327558, 321991, 27605, '<td valign="top">I like the pose as well as the oversaturated colors, but I wish this were taken in more of a "studio-like environment" as required in the challenge description.</td>', 'I like the pose as well as the oversaturated colors, but I wish this were taken in more of a "studio-like environment" as required in the challenge description.', '2006-04-19 22:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327657, 319830, 35804, '<td valign="top">...I like the "twist"...and I gotta say the arm art makes this even more interesting to look at...bold shot.</td>', '...I like the "twist"...and I gotta say the arm art makes this even more interesting to look at...bold shot.', '2006-04-19 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327663, 320965, 35804, '<td valign="top">So full of sweetness in such a nice way...beautiful color and light.</td>', 'So full of sweetness in such a nice way...beautiful color and light.', '2006-04-19 23:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327685, 319628, 35804, '<td valign="top">There is just something oddly compelling about this image and I can''t quite put my finger on it exactly...I just stopped me in my tracks...for me the image just reeks of machismo yet there is this bond between the subjects...plus it has this almost timeless quality about it, it could have been taken yesterday, 10, 20 or even 30 years or more ago...a very interesting shot.</td>', 'There is just something oddly compelling about this image and I can''t quite put my finger on it exactly...I just stopped me in my tracks...for me the image just reeks of machismo yet there is this bond between the subjects...plus it has this almost timeless quality about it, it could have been taken yesterday, 10, 20 or even 30 years or more ago...a very interesting shot.', '2006-04-19 23:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327802, 321824, 48560, '<td valign="top">good pose and a nice smile, coupled with suitable soft treatment.<br/>but I think I should point out that your JPEG compression artifacts are showing. They are quite obvious on her right shoulder. Other than that, great shot!</td>', 'good pose and a nice smile, coupled with suitable soft treatment.but I think I should point out that your JPEG compression artifacts are showing. They are quite obvious on her right shoulder. Other than that, great shot!', '2006-04-19 23:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327809, 321934, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but not in a studio.  More of an environmental portrait.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice, but not in a studio.  More of an environmental portrait.TC', '2006-04-19 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327817, 321907, 48560, '<td valign="top">nice use of DOF to isolate the child from the background. I like outdoor shots like this one. My only complaint on this photo is that the child needs to be brighter?</td>', 'nice use of DOF to isolate the child from the background. I like outdoor shots like this one. My only complaint on this photo is that the child needs to be brighter?', '2006-04-19 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327831, 321581, 48560, '<td valign="top">very sharp, clean image.<br/>like how there appears to be smoke from the pipe, giving this photo a sense of "life". nice work</td>', 'very sharp, clean image.like how there appears to be smoke from the pipe, giving this photo a sense of "life". nice work', '2006-04-19 23:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327837, 321101, 48560, '<td valign="top">the composition and crop appears just nice. good work.</td>', 'the composition and crop appears just nice. good work.', '2006-04-19 23:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327842, 321604, 48560, '<td valign="top">definately one of the more original and creative entries in the challenge. very sharp and clean image. I like it.</td>', 'definately one of the more original and creative entries in the challenge. very sharp and clean image. I like it.', '2006-04-19 23:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327866, 321352, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like the pose. The colors and contrasts are great. What I find a little off is the perspective. There is a lot of shape/contour/depth to most of the shot. But the angle of her face to the camera seems a little off. It is the only part of the pic that looks flat and not as detailed and strong as the rest of the shot.  For example, her left cheek looks totally flat and somewhat sunken.</td>', 'I like the pose. The colors and contrasts are great. What I find a little off is the perspective. There is a lot of shape/contour/depth to most of the shot. But the angle of her face to the camera seems a little off. It is the only part of the pic that looks flat and not as detailed and strong as the rest of the shot.  For example, her left cheek looks totally flat and somewhat sunken.', '2006-04-20 00:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327868, 321328, 48560, '<td valign="top">a pretty face coupled with good mastery of light. Good job!<br/>I like the intense appearance and the angle of light. Soft glow effects are great too. Good luck on this one. Looks like a winner.</td>', 'a pretty face coupled with good mastery of light. Good job!I like the intense appearance and the angle of light. Soft glow effects are great too. Good luck on this one. Looks like a winner.', '2006-04-20 00:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327876, 321408, 37719, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of the shot. What bothers me is the severe contrast between the forehead and nose bridge and the eye makeup. Perhaps with different toning /hue...</td>', 'I like the concept of the shot. What bothers me is the severe contrast between the forehead and nose bridge and the eye makeup. Perhaps with different toning /hue...', '2006-04-20 00:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327888, 321229, 51003, '<td valign="top">A little too much noise but all in all, AWESOME! A 6 here!</td>', 'A little too much noise but all in all, AWESOME! A 6 here!', '2006-04-20 00:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327890, 321324, 51003, '<td valign="top">gorgeous! nuff said! great shot</td>', 'gorgeous! nuff said! great shot', '2006-04-20 00:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327918, 321836, 49667, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone of her skin on her upper chest, but I am dissappointed by the washed out look on the one side of her face.  I think if you could have captured a more true tone on this side of her face, then the image would be worth more than the 7 I gave it.</td>', 'I really like the tone of her skin on her upper chest, but I am dissappointed by the washed out look on the one side of her face.  I think if you could have captured a more true tone on this side of her face, then the image would be worth more than the 7 I gave it.', '2006-04-20 00:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327922, 321227, 48560, '<td valign="top">high-key treatment on this potrait isn''t to my liking. 7<br/>p/s: dont see why this photo needs to be validated, trolls.</td>', 'high-key treatment on this potrait isn''t to my liking. 7p/s: dont see why this photo needs to be validated, trolls.', '2006-04-20 00:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327927, 321222, 48560, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space, making the child seem so small and fragile, serenly peaceful. 9</td>', 'I like the negative space, making the child seem so small and fragile, serenly peaceful. 9', '2006-04-20 00:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327951, 321412, 48560, '<td valign="top">hmm this guy here, I know I''ve seen him from somewhere.<br/>Lets see... is it on one of the cereal boxes where they show missing children?<br/>No no... or maybe from those FIB most wanted posters?<br/>Or, from some cheese commercial, maybe? ;)<br/>I like the treatment you used on this photo - that special glow you seem to have mastered. Good work, pal.</td>', 'hmm this guy here, I know I''ve seen him from somewhere.Lets see... is it on one of the cereal boxes where they show missing children?No no... or maybe from those FIB most wanted posters?Or, from some cheese commercial, maybe? ;)I like the treatment you used on this photo - that special glow you seem to have mastered. Good work, pal.', '2006-04-20 00:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327957, 321969, 10848, '<td valign="top">Precious baby!</td>', 'Precious baby!', '2006-04-20 00:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327959, 321821, 10848, '<td valign="top">I like this, very effective lighting.</td>', 'I like this, very effective lighting.', '2006-04-20 00:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2327961, 321965, 48560, '<td valign="top">I like the warm glow and the dirty face, coupled with that special stare from the model. Good take.</td>', 'I like the warm glow and the dirty face, coupled with that special stare from the model. Good take.', '2006-04-20 00:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
