(2327975, 321309, 48560, '<td valign="top">first of all, that is such a lovely face!<br/>I like the warm and serene feeling about this photo.<br/>sorry I''m not that good with the technicals, but I find the lighting perfect.</td>', 'first of all, that is such a lovely face!I like the warm and serene feeling about this photo.sorry I''m not that good with the technicals, but I find the lighting perfect.', '2006-04-20 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
