(2328014, 321147, 36470, '<td valign="top">ADORABLE portrait.  Lighting could be a tad better as there is the shadow from the son''s head on dad''s face.  So cute :) 8</td>', 'ADORABLE portrait.  Lighting could be a tad better as there is the shadow from the son''s head on dad''s face.  So cute :) 8', '2006-04-20 00:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
