(2328026, 321998, 36470, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting here.  I like how it looks like that is a globe in the background.  Not sure if it is or not! 8</td>', 'Love the lighting here.  I like how it looks like that is a globe in the background.  Not sure if it is or not! 8', '2006-04-20 00:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
