(2328036, 320063, 36470, '<td valign="top">I like her makeup and the background works well for the mood you are trying to convey.  Her position seems a bit akward and posed.  A reflector may have helped lessen the dark shadow under her chin. 6</td>', 'I like her makeup and the background works well for the mood you are trying to convey.  Her position seems a bit akward and posed.  A reflector may have helped lessen the dark shadow under her chin. 6', '2006-04-20 00:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2328053, 321573, 36470, '<td valign="top">Natural light portrait???  I really like the expression you captured on this little guys face.  The lighting is very pleasing. Seems like it could be a tad sharper.  A little more off the top may be more pleasing, but who knows :)  7.5 but I''ll give ya an 8 LOL</td>', 'Natural light portrait???  I really like the expression you captured on this little guys face.  The lighting is very pleasing. Seems like it could be a tad sharper.  A little more off the top may be more pleasing, but who knows :)  7.5 but I''ll give ya an 8 LOL', '2006-04-20 00:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2328054, 320011, 46097, '<td valign="top">Thats just lovely.....such a cutie pie. I do child and baby photography too, and know how hard it can be, so I really appreciate what this good capture means. Well done. I also love the high key, which you''ve nailed perfectly.</td>', 'Thats just lovely.....such a cutie pie. I do child and baby photography too, and know how hard it can be, so I really appreciate what this good capture means. Well done. I also love the high key, which you''ve nailed perfectly.', '2006-04-20 00:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2328062, 321953, 48560, '<td valign="top">this is good. I was taking a long look at this and I wonder if a tight crop around the model''s face would be a stronger photo? Just a thought, as I think this one is pretty as itself. nice work. 8</td>', 'this is good. I was taking a long look at this and I wonder if a tight crop around the model''s face would be a stronger photo? Just a thought, as I think this one is pretty as itself. nice work. 8', '2006-04-20 00:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
