(2328067, 321699, 48560, '<td valign="top">the child seems to be pondering on some deep thoughts - I love it!<br/>the choice of background really adds a lot to the overall feel of the photo.<br/>Good control of light, it appears natural. 9</td>', 'the child seems to be pondering on some deep thoughts - I love it!the choice of background really adds a lot to the overall feel of the photo.Good control of light, it appears natural. 9', '2006-04-20 00:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
