(2328093, 321923, 48560, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you have decided on a deep DOF for this. I like the bright colours and the tact sharp focus used. a natural smile on the model made this great!</td>', 'I''m glad you have decided on a deep DOF for this. I like the bright colours and the tact sharp focus used. a natural smile on the model made this great!', '2006-04-20 00:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
