(2328113, 321833, 46097, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and mood. White balance is just right. Perfect expression, and props. Very well done.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and mood. White balance is just right. Perfect expression, and props. Very well done.', '2006-04-20 01:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
