(2328389, 321579, 41337, '<td valign="top">To be honest I don''t like the look. It''s those drop shadows and also the water being so sharp/in-focus in comparision to the face. Also, I''d probably not have the water running right through the eyes which makes focusing on them difficult. Anyway, just my opinion. Good luck.</td>', 'To be honest I don''t like the look. It''s those drop shadows and also the water being so sharp/in-focus in comparision to the face. Also, I''d probably not have the water running right through the eyes which makes focusing on them difficult. Anyway, just my opinion. Good luck.', '2006-04-20 02:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
