(2330370, 319424, 93, '<td valign="top">Some pretty weak processing artifacts here, especially along the cheekline against the black. The noise in your shadows and some midtones, coupled with the unnatural smoothness of parts of the boy''s face, also give this photo a very unrealistic feel.  I''m also not feeling the pose. Too manufactured. It reminds me of beauty pageant mock-ups or glamour shots. Entirely inappropriate for child portraitures IMO.  Lastly, it lacks the "studio" feel, as it''s too tightly cropped, and could have been taken anywhere. It''s easy to black out a background by lighting your subject brightly.  Not the greatest effort, but I hope some of this helps for next time.</td>', 'Some pretty weak processing artifacts here, especially along the cheekline against the black. The noise in your shadows and some midtones, coupled with the unnatural smoothness of parts of the boy''s face, also give this photo a very unrealistic feel.  I''m also not feeling the pose. Too manufactured. It reminds me of beauty pageant mock-ups or glamour shots. Entirely inappropriate for child portraitures IMO.  Lastly, it lacks the "studio" feel, as it''s too tightly cropped, and could have been taken anywhere. It''s easy to black out a background by lighting your subject brightly.  Not the greatest effort, but I hope some of this helps for next time.', '2006-04-20 19:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
