(2330509, 321911, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice shot, but the exposure is a little off.  if the face were better lit and the background either darker or graded more, it could be a better shot.  and i''m afraid there''s just something about the angle that feels awkward, and annoys a little.  that said, nice colours and textures.</td>', 'a nice shot, but the exposure is a little off.  if the face were better lit and the background either darker or graded more, it could be a better shot.  and i''m afraid there''s just something about the angle that feels awkward, and annoys a little.  that said, nice colours and textures.', '2006-04-20 19:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330519, 321684, 53572, '<td valign="top">it''s really quite a nice shot, with pretty good focus and tones.  but...  the blown out/erased background is very harsh and distracting.  if the background really sucked, it would have been better to select it, and change the tones and blur on it, rather than this white white white.</td>', 'it''s really quite a nice shot, with pretty good focus and tones.  but...  the blown out/erased background is very harsh and distracting.  if the background really sucked, it would have been better to select it, and change the tones and blur on it, rather than this white white white.', '2006-04-20 20:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330527, 321957, 53572, '<td valign="top">this could be a nice shot, but the neat imaging is a bit OTT.  the blue eyes?  maybe a little scary.  the colours are good, and like the rich, flat black.</td>', 'this could be a nice shot, but the neat imaging is a bit OTT.  the blue eyes?  maybe a little scary.  the colours are good, and like the rich, flat black.', '2006-04-20 20:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330530, 322005, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice pic of a lovely girl.  but... the focus is a little weak, and the shadow on her lower cheeks and chin is a bit distracting.</td>', 'a nice pic of a lovely girl.  but... the focus is a little weak, and the shadow on her lower cheeks and chin is a bit distracting.', '2006-04-20 20:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330531, 321864, 2158, '<td valign="top">Love this humourous entry.</td>', 'Love this humourous entry.', '2006-04-20 20:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330534, 321924, 32608, '<td valign="top">what eyes. If not for the reflections...</td>', 'what eyes. If not for the reflections...', '2006-04-20 20:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330537, 320462, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice image, but the focus is poor.  this is too bad, as the colours are quite nice.  a close crop with less floor would have helped too.</td>', 'a nice image, but the focus is poor.  this is too bad, as the colours are quite nice.  a close crop with less floor would have helped too.', '2006-04-20 20:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330545, 321772, 53572, '<td valign="top">not bad, but the flash light is a bit harsh.  some ambient light would have softened this nicely.  de-greening his face and shirt might help a little too - they really are very green.</td>', 'not bad, but the flash light is a bit harsh.  some ambient light would have softened this nicely.  de-greening his face and shirt might help a little too - they really are very green.', '2006-04-20 20:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330549, 321103, 53572, '<td valign="top">a very sweet pic, reminiscent of the 1950s!  however, the focus is poor, or too much NI.  it realy looks like the dog''s eye is infocus, not the boy''s.  graet colours.</td>', 'a very sweet pic, reminiscent of the 1950s!  however, the focus is poor, or too much NI.  it realy looks like the dog''s eye is infocus, not the boy''s.  graet colours.', '2006-04-20 20:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330555, 320835, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice image, but ... a closer crop might help, as well as worming up the skin tones on the left side of her face.</td>', 'a nice image, but ... a closer crop might help, as well as worming up the skin tones on the left side of her face.', '2006-04-20 20:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330559, 321907, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice shot, but the lighting is poor and detracts from the effect.  the trees in the background distract from the boy, as they have a lovely lihgt on them.  if he were lighter, and the basket less shiny, it would be much better.  he looks like he had a great time!</td>', 'a nice shot, but the lighting is poor and detracts from the effect.  the trees in the background distract from the boy, as they have a lovely lihgt on them.  if he were lighter, and the basket less shiny, it would be much better.  he looks like he had a great time!', '2006-04-20 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330574, 321400, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice shot, but the focus is poor, which brings it down.  that''s realy my only complaint - nice colours, nice composition, nice exposure.  is this perhaps due to how you''re preparing your images for challenge?  look at the tutorial for that if it is - i did and it made a huge difference!</td>', 'a nice shot, but the focus is poor, which brings it down.  that''s realy my only complaint - nice colours, nice composition, nice exposure.  is this perhaps due to how you''re preparing your images for challenge?  look at the tutorial for that if it is - i did and it made a huge difference!', '2006-04-20 20:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330582, 322016, 53572, '<td valign="top">a beatutiful image of a beautiful girl - but it''s out of focus.  that really is the only problem here.</td>', 'a beatutiful image of a beautiful girl - but it''s out of focus.  that really is the only problem here.', '2006-04-20 20:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330590, 321901, 53572, '<td valign="top">nice colour and image, but a little flat.  the background looks like it wants to be white, but is just a little under exposed.  perhaps levels could have fixed this?  are the eyes slightly out of focus?</td>', 'nice colour and image, but a little flat.  the background looks like it wants to be white, but is just a little under exposed.  perhaps levels could have fixed this?  are the eyes slightly out of focus?', '2006-04-20 20:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330597, 321807, 53572, '<td valign="top">this could be lovely, but it''s out of focus.  the colours, exposure and compo are great.  what amazing eye colour</td>', 'this could be lovely, but it''s out of focus.  the colours, exposure and compo are great.  what amazing eye colour', '2006-04-20 20:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330605, 321833, 53572, '<td valign="top">Wow.  stunning.  so vermeer.  well done on the attention to detail, the beautiful lighting, the whole tihng.</td>', 'Wow.  stunning.  so vermeer.  well done on the attention to detail, the beautiful lighting, the whole tihng.', '2006-04-20 20:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330607, 321101, 47852, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit squished on the left side... too much room behind his head and not enough in front of his face.  Otherwise, a nice portrait.</td>', 'Seems a bit squished on the left side... too much room behind his head and not enough in front of his face.  Otherwise, a nice portrait.', '2006-04-20 20:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330609, 321604, 53572, '<td valign="top">very nice. original idea, well carried out.</td>', 'very nice. original idea, well carried out.', '2006-04-20 20:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330611, 321309, 53572, '<td valign="top">very nice indeed.  i do like that the only eye looking at the viewer is a reflected one.</td>', 'very nice indeed.  i do like that the only eye looking at the viewer is a reflected one.', '2006-04-20 20:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330649, 321833, 47483, '<td valign="top">Very good and very thoughtful.<br/>The lighting in this photo is just very good. <br/>I am not one of the guys about ''rule of 2 3rd'' or ''rule f 1 3rd'' (whatever it is), but it seems to be working fine in this composition. The subject is well accentuated. Good work over all.</td>', 'Very good and very thoughtful.The lighting in this photo is just very good. I am not one of the guys about ''rule of 2 3rd'' or ''rule f 1 3rd'' (whatever it is), but it seems to be working fine in this composition. The subject is well accentuated. Good work over all.', '2006-04-20 20:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330681, 321832, 48928, '<td valign="top">Keeper of the flame seems a bit random...The keeper of the flame wears a hat?  5</td>', 'Keeper of the flame seems a bit random...The keeper of the flame wears a hat?  5', '2006-04-20 20:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330690, 321726, 48928, '<td valign="top">Good photo but not sure about using the same model over and over.  Tends to lose impact. 7</td>', 'Good photo but not sure about using the same model over and over.  Tends to lose impact. 7', '2006-04-20 20:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330700, 320380, 48928, '<td valign="top">Really good focus and lighting :)9</td>', 'Really good focus and lighting :)9', '2006-04-20 20:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330702, 321835, 48928, '<td valign="top">really coool perspective for portrait....9</td>', 'really coool perspective for portrait....9', '2006-04-20 20:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330747, 321227, 41337, '<td valign="top">Well Elvi this is pretty eye catching! Love the look. Hopefully your style will catch on with DPC voters. Gets an 8 from me.</td>', 'Well Elvi this is pretty eye catching! Love the look. Hopefully your style will catch on with DPC voters. Gets an 8 from me.', '2006-04-20 21:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330750, 321973, 41337, '<td valign="top">Just not a portrait.</td>', 'Just not a portrait.', '2006-04-20 21:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330757, 320077, 41337, '<td valign="top">A catch light in the eyes would have really enhanced this.</td>', 'A catch light in the eyes would have really enhanced this.', '2006-04-20 21:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330762, 321867, 55749, '<td valign="top">She''s pretty, but her face is lost in Shadow.  However, I do like the soft lighting falling across her body. If only you could kick-up the face a bit.   Also, she''s not really painting, accentuated by the fact that the lighting pulls the eye to the canvas.  Personally, I think the spike high heels detract from the image as well.  If it weren''t for the heels the image would seem timeless.  I do like the drape, and the way you''ve placed it. The concept could work... Maybe a square image would be nice, with the focus falling on the girl and not the painting.</td>', 'She''s pretty, but her face is lost in Shadow.  However, I do like the soft lighting falling across her body. If only you could kick-up the face a bit.   Also, she''s not really painting, accentuated by the fact that the lighting pulls the eye to the canvas.  Personally, I think the spike high heels detract from the image as well.  If it weren''t for the heels the image would seem timeless.  I do like the drape, and the way you''ve placed it. The concept could work... Maybe a square image would be nice, with the focus falling on the girl and not the painting.', '2006-04-20 21:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330763, 321897, 41337, '<td valign="top">Could use a contrast boost, otherwise very good.</td>', 'Could use a contrast boost, otherwise very good.', '2006-04-20 21:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330767, 321824, 41337, '<td valign="top">Would like it better if the left side was cropped more (i.e. to crop those dark pants).</td>', 'Would like it better if the left side was cropped more (i.e. to crop those dark pants).', '2006-04-20 21:17:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2330769, 321912, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and how the open shirt leads to the face.  Brilliant lighting, color and DOF.</td>', 'I like the composition and how the open shirt leads to the face.  Brilliant lighting, color and DOF.', '2006-04-20 21:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330772, 321835, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Would work great as a stock image but as a portrait I just don''t know.</td>', 'Nice photo. Would work great as a stock image but as a portrait I just don''t know.', '2006-04-20 21:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330778, 319628, 18349, '<td valign="top">I rarely comment anymore, but as I was browsing the thumbnails of this challenge, this image just wowed me.  It''s awesome...the lighting and the expressions really make you feel a connection not only to the image, but between the subjects themselves.  I didn''t feel that looking at any other shots.  It appears to be a tiny bit soft, and there is a desaturated spot on the top guy''s neck and shoulder that are a little distracting when you stare at it, but on the whole, I''d be damned proud to hang this on my wall.  Beautiful work.  9 if I could vote!  :)</td>', 'I rarely comment anymore, but as I was browsing the thumbnails of this challenge, this image just wowed me.  It''s awesome...the lighting and the expressions really make you feel a connection not only to the image, but between the subjects themselves.  I didn''t feel that looking at any other shots.  It appears to be a tiny bit soft, and there is a desaturated spot on the top guy''s neck and shoulder that are a little distracting when you stare at it, but on the whole, I''d be damned proud to hang this on my wall.  Beautiful work.  9 if I could vote!  :)', '2006-04-20 21:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330781, 322008, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very fun, very expressive...the composition is great and the processing adds flair to the image.  :)</td>', 'Very fun, very expressive...the composition is great and the processing adds flair to the image.  :)', '2006-04-20 21:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330783, 321504, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Like the how you captured the eyes and the facial expression. On the negative, I''m not liking the choice in background. There is just too much contrast going on back there which is distracting for me.</td>', 'Very cute. Like the how you captured the eyes and the facial expression. On the negative, I''m not liking the choice in background. There is just too much contrast going on back there which is distracting for me.', '2006-04-20 21:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330784, 321253, 24642, '<td valign="top">A cool character.  Brilliant composition, how the hat and the jacket help to lead to the face.  Top notch processing.  -10</td>', 'A cool character.  Brilliant composition, how the hat and the jacket help to lead to the face.  Top notch processing.  -10', '2006-04-20 21:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330789, 321309, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the smoothness in light and color.  The subtle reflection is brilliant.</td>', 'I like the smoothness in light and color.  The subtle reflection is brilliant.', '2006-04-20 21:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330790, 321359, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very fun...great lighting and composition...but I do have to mention the chopped-off arm and foot (I''m sure others have mentioned it so I won''t go on).  ;)  Overall it''s really cute and different from all the boring headshots.  7 if I could vote!  :)</td>', 'Very fun...great lighting and composition...but I do have to mention the chopped-off arm and foot (I''m sure others have mentioned it so I won''t go on).  ;)  Overall it''s really cute and different from all the boring headshots.  7 if I could vote!  :)', '2006-04-20 21:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330792, 321573, 24642, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and expression.</td>', 'Great lighting and expression.', '2006-04-20 21:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330795, 320538, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is very nice...sharp as a tack, great color and composition.  8 if I could vote!  :)</td>', 'This is very nice...sharp as a tack, great color and composition.  8 if I could vote!  :)', '2006-04-20 21:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330797, 321678, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very neat.</td>', 'Very neat.', '2006-04-20 21:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330799, 321849, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is very nice...great sharpness and color, nice expressions...the tiny bits of white on the boys'' shirt distract the eyes a bit (might clone those out if you''re so inclined) but overall this is a great subject for a 16x20 on the family room wall.  :)</td>', 'This is very nice...great sharpness and color, nice expressions...the tiny bits of white on the boys'' shirt distract the eyes a bit (might clone those out if you''re so inclined) but overall this is a great subject for a 16x20 on the family room wall.  :)', '2006-04-20 21:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330800, 321309, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lovely...but I do wish I could see all the reflection.  Great idea.  :)</td>', 'Lovely...but I do wish I could see all the reflection.  Great idea.  :)', '2006-04-20 21:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330804, 321807, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful closeup...nice composition and use of DOF.  :)</td>', 'Beautiful closeup...nice composition and use of DOF.  :)', '2006-04-20 21:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330806, 321772, 55749, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, but you''re to close to the background, which causes harsh shadows and flash kickback from the wall.  A 30 inch off camera umbrella would do wonders for this setup.  If you don''t have the off camera equipment, but you have a Bounce-Flash, bounce the light off the ceiling and light up the shadow areas with a white kicker-board placed just below the frame. <br/> <br/>White foam-core board found at an art store is really cheap.  You can even spray-paint one side silver or gold.</td>', 'Cute kid, but you''re to close to the background, which causes harsh shadows and flash kickback from the wall.  A 30 inch off camera umbrella would do wonders for this setup.  If you don''t have the off camera equipment, but you have a Bounce-Flash, bounce the light off the ceiling and light up the shadow areas with a white kicker-board placed just below the frame.  White foam-core board found at an art store is really cheap.  You can even spray-paint one side silver or gold.', '2006-04-20 21:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330807, 321696, 41337, '<td valign="top">I really like how her face fills most of the frame. Would have loved it better if she was looking into the camera so those eyes would open up more.</td>', 'I really like how her face fills most of the frame. Would have loved it better if she was looking into the camera so those eyes would open up more.', '2006-04-20 21:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330808, 321980, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice...great sharpness on the eyes but they might be just a tiny bit too bright.  The muted colors work extremely well together.  Nice background.  My only advice is to check the collar to be sure it''s not crumpled next time... ;)   7 if I could vote.  :)</td>', 'Very nice...great sharpness on the eyes but they might be just a tiny bit too bright.  The muted colors work extremely well together.  Nice background.  My only advice is to check the collar to be sure it''s not crumpled next time... ;)   7 if I could vote.  :)', '2006-04-20 21:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330809, 321963, 18349, '<td valign="top">ROFL!  Great idea.  Not sure I really like the whole cig thing (underage smoking is really one of my pet peeves) but that''s neither here nor there.  Excellent sharpness and color, perfect for an off-the-wall greeting card.  8 if I could vote! :)</td>', 'ROFL!  Great idea.  Not sure I really like the whole cig thing (underage smoking is really one of my pet peeves) but that''s neither here nor there.  Excellent sharpness and color, perfect for an off-the-wall greeting card.  8 if I could vote! :)', '2006-04-20 21:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330812, 320063, 41337, '<td valign="top">Love the look and that background really enhances this. I probably would remove her arm in the shot so that her white shirt just fills that corner.</td>', 'Love the look and that background really enhances this. I probably would remove her arm in the shot so that her white shirt just fills that corner.', '2006-04-20 21:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330814, 321820, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and clarity...the angle does elongate her face a bit much, and the color seems just a tiny bit "off" on my monitor (which could very well be, well...my monitor!) but overall it''s quite nice.  She has mesmerizing eyes.  :)</td>', 'Lovely composition and clarity...the angle does elongate her face a bit much, and the color seems just a tiny bit "off" on my monitor (which could very well be, well...my monitor!) but overall it''s quite nice.  She has mesmerizing eyes.  :)', '2006-04-20 21:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330816, 321324, 18349, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  One of the best in the challenge.  Great color, pose, composition, clarity, and moxy.  :)</td>', 'Stunning.  One of the best in the challenge.  Great color, pose, composition, clarity, and moxy.  :)', '2006-04-20 21:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330819, 321848, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Would be better if everything was in focus like the hair is.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Would be better if everything was in focus like the hair is.', '2006-04-20 21:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330830, 321817, 55749, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Looks like a GQ Fashion shot.</td>', 'Great shot.  Looks like a GQ Fashion shot.', '2006-04-20 21:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330841, 321874, 55749, '<td valign="top">Love this shot... It reminds  me of the seventies movie Scanners!  I''m not a real big fan of green, but you make it work well in this shot.</td>', 'Love this shot... It reminds  me of the seventies movie Scanners!  I''m not a real big fan of green, but you make it work well in this shot.', '2006-04-20 21:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330843, 321924, 18349, '<td valign="top">Is that you, David?  Great shot...the lighting and color are really nice.  :)</td>', 'Is that you, David?  Great shot...the lighting and color are really nice.  :)', '2006-04-20 21:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330846, 321826, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I like the colors and those eyes were captured very well. Looks very professional. The only negative is the hand which blends into the face too much.</td>', 'Great photo. I like the colors and those eyes were captured very well. Looks very professional. The only negative is the hand which blends into the face too much.', '2006-04-20 21:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330848, 320647, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2006-04-20 21:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330853, 321867, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lovely in it''s subtlety and detail.  Very nice!  :)</td>', 'Lovely in it''s subtlety and detail.  Very nice!  :)', '2006-04-20 21:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330857, 320903, 41337, '<td valign="top">This fills the frame really well. Very nice. There seems to be a few hot spots at the top there but nothing too distracting.</td>', 'This fills the frame really well. Very nice. There seems to be a few hot spots at the top there but nothing too distracting.', '2006-04-20 21:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330859, 320967, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and use of DOF.  :)</td>', 'Beautiful composition and use of DOF.  :)', '2006-04-20 21:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330860, 320822, 18349, '<td valign="top">Exquisite!  :)</td>', 'Exquisite!  :)', '2006-04-20 21:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330864, 321872, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2006-04-20 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330867, 321957, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m sure someone has already mentioned this but in case not those whites look blue. I guess that was on purpose but I don''t see how that enhances the shot.</td>', 'I''m sure someone has already mentioned this but in case not those whites look blue. I guess that was on purpose but I don''t see how that enhances the shot.', '2006-04-20 21:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330868, 321876, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2006-04-20 21:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330874, 321794, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the hair blowning but that one clump of hair is a little distracting. Otherwise very professional. Gets a 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice. I like the hair blowning but that one clump of hair is a little distracting. Otherwise very professional. Gets a 7 from me.', '2006-04-20 21:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330881, 321581, 41337, '<td valign="top">I love how this fills the frame. It gives it a very unique look. Everything else is great except what is that in the background? Is that smoke? Looks a little weird since there is no trail from the pipe and it also looks kinda like a mouth.</td>', 'I love how this fills the frame. It gives it a very unique look. Everything else is great except what is that in the background? Is that smoke? Looks a little weird since there is no trail from the pipe and it also looks kinda like a mouth.', '2006-04-20 21:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330889, 321950, 41337, '<td valign="top">Love the expression and the negative space. I probably would have not have included her fist at the top since you didn''t include the rest of the arm. Also, having her flush on the right side instead of leaving that strip of white space would have made this even better.</td>', 'Love the expression and the negative space. I probably would have not have included her fist at the top since you didn''t include the rest of the arm. Also, having her flush on the right side instead of leaving that strip of white space would have made this even better.', '2006-04-20 21:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330896, 321486, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the pose and the way you filled the frame really adds impact. The only thing holding this back, IMO is the eyes could have been sharper and brighter in the retina.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the pose and the way you filled the frame really adds impact. The only thing holding this back, IMO is the eyes could have been sharper and brighter in the retina.', '2006-04-20 21:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330899, 321872, 49773, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-04-20 21:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330900, 321604, 49773, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea and execution. Very nice</td>', 'Wonderful idea and execution. Very nice', '2006-04-20 21:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330902, 320900, 41337, '<td valign="top">The lighting is great in this. Can''t say that enough.</td>', 'The lighting is great in this. Can''t say that enough.', '2006-04-20 21:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330904, 321898, 49773, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrati. I like the motion blur on his hand.</td>', 'Excellent portrati. I like the motion blur on his hand.', '2006-04-20 21:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2330906, 321328, 41337, '<td valign="top">The curly hair over the face really makes the shot.</td>', 'The curly hair over the face really makes the shot.', '2006-04-20 21:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
