(2330947, 321891, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Great eyes you captured and the lighting looks good. The one thing I believe hurts this image is the rogue hair in two spots. The one in the lower left corner (maybe clone/heal that out) and the patch of hair just above her left eye (maybe just brush that back or give her a virtual trimming in photoshop.) Anyway, those are just minor things but I believe they could have a big impact on the voter so I probably would keep that in mind in the future. Just my opinion though. Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice image. Great eyes you captured and the lighting looks good. The one thing I believe hurts this image is the rogue hair in two spots. The one in the lower left corner (maybe clone/heal that out) and the patch of hair just above her left eye (maybe just brush that back or give her a virtual trimming in photoshop.) Anyway, those are just minor things but I believe they could have a big impact on the voter so I probably would keep that in mind in the future. Just my opinion though. Good luck!', '2006-04-20 22:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
