(2331314, 321898, 49667, '<td valign="top">Too dark, but I like how you were able to capture the action of his hand, yet the stillness of his face, nice.</td>', 'Too dark, but I like how you were able to capture the action of his hand, yet the stillness of his face, nice.', '2006-04-20 23:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331321, 321253, 49667, '<td valign="top">There is something funky with the color here... I don''t know if you meant it, or not, but the skin tone looks like it is off.</td>', 'There is something funky with the color here... I don''t know if you meant it, or not, but the skin tone looks like it is off.', '2006-04-20 23:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331325, 321953, 49667, '<td valign="top">The hue of the skin is off a bit, too pink.</td>', 'The hue of the skin is off a bit, too pink.', '2006-04-20 23:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331329, 319974, 49667, '<td valign="top">I think a cooler light would have brought out the red in the lips and teh makeup in the eyes... it may have possibly created a more natural skin tone.</td>', 'I think a cooler light would have brought out the red in the lips and teh makeup in the eyes... it may have possibly created a more natural skin tone.', '2006-04-20 23:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331335, 321867, 49667, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry... I am particular about the details, and I know a person cannot paint a picture without paint and a brush cleaner.  I see neither, so the image is too fake to me.</td>', 'I''m sorry... I am particular about the details, and I know a person cannot paint a picture without paint and a brush cleaner.  I see neither, so the image is too fake to me.', '2006-04-20 23:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331336, 321483, 55749, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant and timeless.  Love the square format.</td>', 'Simple, elegant and timeless.  Love the square format.', '2006-04-20 23:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331349, 320846, 55749, '<td valign="top">Great use of color and lighting.</td>', 'Great use of color and lighting.', '2006-04-20 23:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331354, 321826, 55749, '<td valign="top">This image kills me.... Well done.</td>', 'This image kills me.... Well done.', '2006-04-21 00:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331356, 322008, 49667, '<td valign="top">I wanted to crack a joke, but I don''t want to be rude.  I really think you overdid it with the lighting.  If you look at her shirt, I see a blue and white shirt, is this what you see?  remember, we are "painting" with light.  We have to work with the light so that it gives us the balance that makes a picture perfect.  When there is an over-abundance of light, then all we see is light, and not the beautiful colors underneath it since the light acts a curtain to the color.</td>', 'I wanted to crack a joke, but I don''t want to be rude.  I really think you overdid it with the lighting.  If you look at her shirt, I see a blue and white shirt, is this what you see?  remember, we are "painting" with light.  We have to work with the light so that it gives us the balance that makes a picture perfect.  When there is an over-abundance of light, then all we see is light, and not the beautiful colors underneath it since the light acts a curtain to the color.', '2006-04-21 00:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331359, 321944, 49667, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more detail in her hair... there''s either too much contrast, not enough light, or not enough light in the right position.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more detail in her hair... there''s either too much contrast, not enough light, or not enough light in the right position.', '2006-04-21 00:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331362, 321727, 49667, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit too dark for me.</td>', 'This image is a bit too dark for me.', '2006-04-21 00:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331363, 321108, 49667, '<td valign="top">I like how you put emphasis on the subjects face, but I think it''s a bit too dark.</td>', 'I like how you put emphasis on the subjects face, but I think it''s a bit too dark.', '2006-04-21 00:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331364, 321604, 49667, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Nice Image... too much.</td>', 'Very nice... Nice Image... too much.', '2006-04-21 00:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331373, 321987, 49667, '<td valign="top">OH MAN!  You almost nailed this image!  SO CLOSE, I feel for you.  If only you had the plane over her face to the egg to be in focus then you would have had an awesome image well worth an 8 or 9.  Unfortunately, the beautiful necklace distracts me and the garment she is wearing under the jacket makes me want to look at her boobs--my eye goes right to that area.</td>', 'OH MAN!  You almost nailed this image!  SO CLOSE, I feel for you.  If only you had the plane over her face to the egg to be in focus then you would have had an awesome image well worth an 8 or 9.  Unfortunately, the beautiful necklace distracts me and the garment she is wearing under the jacket makes me want to look at her boobs--my eye goes right to that area.', '2006-04-21 00:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331377, 320645, 49667, '<td valign="top">Very nice... Nice Image... ;-)</td>', 'Very nice... Nice Image... ;-)', '2006-04-21 00:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331379, 321328, 49667, '<td valign="top">There''s too much warmth for me here... I''m not one to light warm light.  I think the contrast is set a little high too.</td>', 'There''s too much warmth for me here... I''m not one to light warm light.  I think the contrast is set a little high too.', '2006-04-21 00:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331381, 320754, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and portrait, but the focus seems a bit soft on her face, and not on purpose.</td>', 'Nice pose and portrait, but the focus seems a bit soft on her face, and not on purpose.', '2006-04-21 00:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331382, 322000, 48717, '<td valign="top">Love "the look", great color composition and focus.  His hair could have used a bit of smoothing on top, but this does not detract from the photo overall.</td>', 'Love "the look", great color composition and focus.  His hair could have used a bit of smoothing on top, but this does not detract from the photo overall.', '2006-04-21 00:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331383, 320835, 49667, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look like it was taken in a studio... The lighting is all off, and a bit dark.</td>', 'This doesn''t look like it was taken in a studio... The lighting is all off, and a bit dark.', '2006-04-21 00:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331384, 319965, 48717, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, could have been nicer without the glasses.  You did a good job of eliminating any glare, but it looks like the model has very nice eyes, which are hard to see with the glasses.</td>', 'This is really nice, could have been nicer without the glasses.  You did a good job of eliminating any glare, but it looks like the model has very nice eyes, which are hard to see with the glasses.', '2006-04-21 00:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331385, 320400, 44534, '<td valign="top">Great picture, my favorite in this challenge, a 10!</td>', 'Great picture, my favorite in this challenge, a 10!', '2006-04-21 00:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331386, 321875, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and the tones captured are great, but the light from the left is a bit harsh</td>', 'Nice focus and the tones captured are great, but the light from the left is a bit harsh', '2006-04-21 00:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331389, 321930, 49667, '<td valign="top">She only has one foot?  I think the image is a bit underexposed, at least by her foot it is.  Perhaps a white background would have helped you here.  Wal-mart sells a white sheet for $3 that works nicely for me.</td>', 'She only has one foot?  I think the image is a bit underexposed, at least by her foot it is.  Perhaps a white background would have helped you here.  Wal-mart sells a white sheet for $3 that works nicely for me.', '2006-04-21 00:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331392, 321937, 49667, '<td valign="top">The hue in the face is too pink for me.  A more natural tone would have helped me to vote 7 or 8.  It looks like the picture was taken with a fisheye lens... If not, then there is some other kind of spacial distortion from something.</td>', 'The hue in the face is too pink for me.  A more natural tone would have helped me to vote 7 or 8.  It looks like the picture was taken with a fisheye lens... If not, then there is some other kind of spacial distortion from something.', '2006-04-21 00:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331393, 321858, 49667, '<td valign="top">I love the color of the eyes, but I think she looks fake, like plastic.</td>', 'I love the color of the eyes, but I think she looks fake, like plastic.', '2006-04-21 00:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331396, 321910, 49667, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of noise in it.  Shooting at a lower ISO could have helped with this.</td>', 'This image has a lot of noise in it.  Shooting at a lower ISO could have helped with this.', '2006-04-21 00:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331397, 321383, 48717, '<td valign="top">The composition here is very nice, but I think the white balance is off.  You have a color cast on your image that is muting the colors in your pic.</td>', 'The composition here is very nice, but I think the white balance is off.  You have a color cast on your image that is muting the colors in your pic.', '2006-04-21 00:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331401, 321801, 49667, '<td valign="top">I think the hue is just slightly on the too pink side of things.  I also don''t really care for the composition of the image.  I try not to cut off the head unless there is a reason, or an effect that I want to achieve.</td>', 'I think the hue is just slightly on the too pink side of things.  I also don''t really care for the composition of the image.  I try not to cut off the head unless there is a reason, or an effect that I want to achieve.', '2006-04-21 00:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331403, 321400, 49667, '<td valign="top">The orange, or yellow, whatever it is, draws my eye directly to her arms.  A more subtle garment may have helped to keep the focus on her face.  Also, the white of her eye looks blue, and her skin is a little pink--perhaps from the saturation.</td>', 'The orange, or yellow, whatever it is, draws my eye directly to her arms.  A more subtle garment may have helped to keep the focus on her face.  Also, the white of her eye looks blue, and her skin is a little pink--perhaps from the saturation.', '2006-04-21 00:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331405, 321897, 48717, '<td valign="top">The composition here is very nice, but I think the white balance is off.  You have a color cast on your image that is muting the colors in your pic.  <br/> <br/>Take that back, maybe it is some sort of warming filter that you used that is creating the tones. I think it is ok after all.</td>', 'The composition here is very nice, but I think the white balance is off.  You have a color cast on your image that is muting the colors in your pic.   Take that back, maybe it is some sort of warming filter that you used that is creating the tones. I think it is ok after all.', '2006-04-21 00:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331406, 321856, 49667, '<td valign="top">This is wild.</td>', 'This is wild.', '2006-04-21 00:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331409, 321103, 49667, '<td valign="top">This image reminds me of the old advertisements for that hamburger joint that isn''t around anymore... I think it''s overprocessed as he, and the cute doggy, look like plastic.</td>', 'This image reminds me of the old advertisements for that hamburger joint that isn''t around anymore... I think it''s overprocessed as he, and the cute doggy, look like plastic.', '2006-04-21 00:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331411, 321328, 55358, '<td valign="top">this is beatiful<br/>one of my top 10<br/>she is intimidating</td>', 'this is beatifulone of my top 10she is intimidating', '2006-04-21 00:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331412, 319830, 48717, '<td valign="top">Well excecuted lens blur.</td>', 'Well excecuted lens blur.', '2006-04-21 00:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331413, 321253, 55358, '<td valign="top">this is one of the best imo, it feels so real to me. it must be the little flaws (the collar, the stray beard hairs etc) i like it and i hope i can make one like this one day</td>', 'this is one of the best imo, it feels so real to me. it must be the little flaws (the collar, the stray beard hairs etc) i like it and i hope i can make one like this one day', '2006-04-21 00:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331415, 321957, 49667, '<td valign="top">Too much saturation, The hue is off from said saturation, her skin is plastic and too much contrast leaves a lot of detail to be desired.  When working with saturation remember to compensate the hue to keep an natural skin tone.</td>', 'Too much saturation, The hue is off from said saturation, her skin is plastic and too much contrast leaves a lot of detail to be desired.  When working with saturation remember to compensate the hue to keep an natural skin tone.', '2006-04-21 00:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331416, 320965, 36920, '<td valign="top">she has beautiful eyes</td>', 'she has beautiful eyes', '2006-04-21 00:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331419, 322006, 55358, '<td valign="top">i love this picture, her eyes draw me in...</td>', 'i love this picture, her eyes draw me in...', '2006-04-21 00:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331464, 321726, 772, '<td valign="top">She is an excellent subject for photography, but these colors don''t seem to integrate well.  I''m not sure why, but there seems to be some disconnection between the age and texture of this woman and the brightly colored veils.</td>', 'She is an excellent subject for photography, but these colors don''t seem to integrate well.  I''m not sure why, but there seems to be some disconnection between the age and texture of this woman and the brightly colored veils.', '2006-04-21 00:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331485, 321726, 43031, '<td valign="top">man, when you pick a subject, you just don''t let go until you''re satiated do you?</td>', 'man, when you pick a subject, you just don''t let go until you''re satiated do you?', '2006-04-21 00:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331491, 321848, 43031, '<td valign="top">caleb stinks. :P back at cha.</td>', 'caleb stinks. :P back at cha.', '2006-04-21 00:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331650, 321579, 57532, '<td valign="top">freakin'' tight... love the high contrast and the water and everything... sweetness.</td>', 'freakin'' tight... love the high contrast and the water and everything... sweetness.', '2006-04-21 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331657, 321971, 57532, '<td valign="top">Good use of color.</td>', 'Good use of color.', '2006-04-21 01:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331668, 321483, 48560, '<td valign="top">very professionally done and studio-like.<br/>like the angle where the light source is coming from.<br/>and really good cropping. good luck.</td>', 'very professionally done and studio-like.like the angle where the light source is coming from.and really good cropping. good luck.', '2006-04-21 02:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331672, 322009, 49930, '<td valign="top">Lovely combo of mother and daughter. I like having the shoulder in the frame but would have liked it better if mothers head was fully there (maybe with both). Well done</td>', 'Lovely combo of mother and daughter. I like having the shoulder in the frame but would have liked it better if mothers head was fully there (maybe with both). Well done', '2006-04-21 02:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331676, 321912, 49930, '<td valign="top">You have really captured the eyes. Also the format of the photo suits the subjects face. Well done - a very pleasing portrait.</td>', 'You have really captured the eyes. Also the format of the photo suits the subjects face. Well done - a very pleasing portrait.', '2006-04-21 02:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331680, 321699, 33672, '<td valign="top">Bumping up! One of the most original photos entered in this theme. Left side of face seems a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Bumping up! One of the most original photos entered in this theme. Left side of face seems a bit overexposed.', '2006-04-21 02:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331682, 321483, 33672, '<td valign="top">I really like the intense but gradual contrast to this photo. Masterful job.</td>', 'I really like the intense but gradual contrast to this photo. Masterful job.', '2006-04-21 02:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331703, 321726, 23251, '<td valign="top">Another nice photo of the same person used in many recent challenges.  I think you will get voter backlash because of it.</td>', 'Another nice photo of the same person used in many recent challenges.  I think you will get voter backlash because of it.', '2006-04-21 02:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331709, 321812, 23251, '<td valign="top">Lovely model, great lighting.  1 or 2 paces away from the wall would have been perfect.</td>', 'Lovely model, great lighting.  1 or 2 paces away from the wall would have been perfect.', '2006-04-21 02:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331712, 322016, 23251, '<td valign="top">Just a little to soft IMHO and the creases in the cloth at the back are distracting.</td>', 'Just a little to soft IMHO and the creases in the cloth at the back are distracting.', '2006-04-21 02:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331715, 320485, 23251, '<td valign="top">Very nice and natural shot.</td>', 'Very nice and natural shot.', '2006-04-21 02:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331720, 321932, 23251, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot but I find the earing to be distracting.</td>', 'Lovely shot but I find the earing to be distracting.', '2006-04-21 03:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331721, 321873, 39880, '<td valign="top">Great job.  Those eyes just draw you in.  Well done.</td>', 'Great job.  Those eyes just draw you in.  Well done.', '2006-04-21 03:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331724, 321874, 39880, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but think of some Star Trek alien.  I like how sharp it is.  Very cool shot.  Well done.</td>', 'I can''t help but think of some Star Trek alien.  I like how sharp it is.  Very cool shot.  Well done.', '2006-04-21 03:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331806, 321408, 56664, '<td valign="top">quite nice, i think you should win</td>', 'quite nice, i think you should win', '2006-04-21 04:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331906, 321794, 39880, '<td valign="top">Looks good.  Lighting is right on.  Well done.</td>', 'Looks good.  Lighting is right on.  Well done.', '2006-04-21 06:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331907, 319768, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp and I like the lighting.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice and sharp and I like the lighting.  Good job.', '2006-04-21 06:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331909, 321315, 39880, '<td valign="top">Great colors and nice theme.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great colors and nice theme.  Nicely done.', '2006-04-21 06:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331913, 321408, 39880, '<td valign="top">Ya can''t help but stare at her eyes.  Well done.</td>', 'Ya can''t help but stare at her eyes.  Well done.', '2006-04-21 06:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331915, 321581, 39880, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Detail is perfect.  Well done.</td>', 'Great shot.  Detail is perfect.  Well done.', '2006-04-21 06:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331918, 321309, 39880, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I''d like to see more of the reflection.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I''d like to see more of the reflection.', '2006-04-21 06:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2331920, 321839, 39880, '<td valign="top">All around nice shot.  Lighting looks great.  Nice and sharp.  Well done.</td>', 'All around nice shot.  Lighting looks great.  Nice and sharp.  Well done.', '2006-04-21 06:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332048, 321867, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, original!</td>', 'Good idea, original!', '2006-04-21 07:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332049, 319424, 18349, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential...the pose and angle are interesting and the contrast and color are great.  I do find the finger to be very distracting.  I also wish his head were rotated toward the camera a bit more (same angle, just a bit more forward).  The skin looks a bit unnatural, like too much noise reduction, and the whites of the eyes are a bit too white.  He just appears less natural and more airbrushed overall.  That being said, it''s still a good image for the challenge.  If I could vote, I''d give it a 7.  Take care!  :)</td>', 'This has a lot of potential...the pose and angle are interesting and the contrast and color are great.  I do find the finger to be very distracting.  I also wish his head were rotated toward the camera a bit more (same angle, just a bit more forward).  The skin looks a bit unnatural, like too much noise reduction, and the whites of the eyes are a bit too white.  He just appears less natural and more airbrushed overall.  That being said, it''s still a good image for the challenge.  If I could vote, I''d give it a 7.  Take care!  :)', '2006-04-21 07:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332050, 320900, 5728, '<td valign="top">Impressive!</td>', 'Impressive!', '2006-04-21 07:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332051, 321103, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, very natural.  I might suggest a tiny bit of contrast boost to make those great colors pop a bit more.  :)</td>', 'Very sweet, very natural.  I might suggest a tiny bit of contrast boost to make those great colors pop a bit more.  :)', '2006-04-21 07:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332052, 321872, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good work!</td>', 'Good work!', '2006-04-21 07:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332053, 321932, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good work, this one talks to me! Good one.</td>', 'Good work, this one talks to me! Good one.', '2006-04-21 07:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332070, 320485, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice!</td>', 'Choice!', '2006-04-21 07:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332160, 321636, 30454, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, perfect lighting. Soft focus works fine here.</td>', 'Nice portrait, perfect lighting. Soft focus works fine here.', '2006-04-21 09:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332162, 322000, 30454, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Should finish in top 10.</td>', 'I really like this one. Should finish in top 10.', '2006-04-21 09:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2332169, 321835, 54731, '<td valign="top">I like this one, I just wish his face didn''t look distorted. A 9!</td>', 'I like this one, I just wish his face didn''t look distorted. A 9!', '2006-04-21 09:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
