(2333049, 321324, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model. Lighting is perfect. I also like your selected DOF, leaving a soft focus on her hair lower frame drawing my eye towards her magnificent blue eyes. The only, and I mean ONLY thing I can offer as a potential change would be to loose the necklace and perhaps not crop so close on the left part of her hat. That being said, I feel this shot is perfect and for that I''m giving this a 10. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful model. Lighting is perfect. I also like your selected DOF, leaving a soft focus on her hair lower frame drawing my eye towards her magnificent blue eyes. The only, and I mean ONLY thing I can offer as a potential change would be to loose the necklace and perhaps not crop so close on the left part of her hat. That being said, I feel this shot is perfect and for that I''m giving this a 10. Well done.', '2006-04-21 15:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
