(2333499, 321811, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nice piece of artwork, with the colour and composition. Technically impressive. Looks a bit more like a study than a portrait though, by which I mean that it''s more about the artist than about the model. I think it would be improved by losing/blurring anatomical detail under the veil, or it may be that you''ve lost too much in the whiting out of the exposed flesh. <br/>Still impressed by the colour and the graphic strength.</td>', 'Nice piece of artwork, with the colour and composition. Technically impressive. Looks a bit more like a study than a portrait though, by which I mean that it''s more about the artist than about the model. I think it would be improved by losing/blurring anatomical detail under the veil, or it may be that you''ve lost too much in the whiting out of the exposed flesh. Still impressed by the colour and the graphic strength.', '2006-04-21 18:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333557, 322000, 3032, '<td valign="top">The angle of his head doesn''t really work for me, perhaps if it would have been a little less it would have given a more natural flow.</td>', 'The angle of his head doesn''t really work for me, perhaps if it would have been a little less it would have given a more natural flow.', '2006-04-21 19:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333558, 321835, 3032, '<td valign="top">Weird perspective, it makes him look rather flat. Interesting effect.</td>', 'Weird perspective, it makes him look rather flat. Interesting effect.', '2006-04-21 19:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333563, 322016, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is a little bit soft and the background is too close (the crases and folds draw to much attention). Increase the distance between subject and background to create better out of focus blur.<br/>I like the diagonal flow of the compostion and to some extent how the light falls. But this is very en profil, would like to see the other part of the face more, even if it only included the slightest hint of the 2nd eye.</td>', 'It is a little bit soft and the background is too close (the crases and folds draw to much attention). Increase the distance between subject and background to create better out of focus blur.I like the diagonal flow of the compostion and to some extent how the light falls. But this is very en profil, would like to see the other part of the face more, even if it only included the slightest hint of the 2nd eye.', '2006-04-21 19:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333568, 321878, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great shot! all the technical details are spot. Though I must say I find the crop/pose a bit odd, with the right hand coming out from the bottom left side like that without seeing a connection to the rest of the body.</td>', 'Great shot! all the technical details are spot. Though I must say I find the crop/pose a bit odd, with the right hand coming out from the bottom left side like that without seeing a connection to the rest of the body.', '2006-04-21 19:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333570, 320903, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the flow of the compostion and the brightness of this.<br/>The elbow part of the arm looks so hard defined against that black background; I wonder if a white / brighter one would have worked better to get a better transition from the bright skin to the background.</td>', 'I like the flow of the compostion and the brightness of this.The elbow part of the arm looks so hard defined against that black background; I wonder if a white / brighter one would have worked better to get a better transition from the bright skin to the background.', '2006-04-21 19:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333571, 321936, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Simple and effective. Do find the left side of the photo just a tad too hot/bright.</td>', 'Very nice! Simple and effective. Do find the left side of the photo just a tad too hot/bright.', '2006-04-21 19:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
