(2333579, 320846, 29011, '<td valign="top">Excellent setup. Brilliant color. Great job by you and the model :)<br/>I like this even more the 2nd time around, bumping up!</td>', 'Excellent setup. Brilliant color. Great job by you and the model :)I like this even more the 2nd time around, bumping up!', '2006-04-21 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333585, 321727, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image and nice capture!  Only one comment really, the cheek and strands of hair coming down show signs of post processing (slight halo, skin tones look funny).  Overall composition is very good.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wonderful image and nice capture!  Only one comment really, the cheek and strands of hair coming down show signs of post processing (slight halo, skin tones look funny).  Overall composition is very good.  Nice job.', '2006-04-21 19:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333586, 321858, 29011, '<td valign="top">Splendid portrait of a little girl and her animal friend. <br/>Just one nitpick, the reflection of the light on her left side of the nose, find that a bit odd. Would perhaps also fix the tiny hotspot on her chin.<br/>Really great job though :)</td>', 'Splendid portrait of a little girl and her animal friend. Just one nitpick, the reflection of the light on her left side of the nose, find that a bit odd. Would perhaps also fix the tiny hotspot on her chin.Really great job though :)', '2006-04-21 19:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333593, 321271, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice soft image, very good.  Only thing to watch out for is the shadow in the back. A second light may help get rid of that.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice soft image, very good.  Only thing to watch out for is the shadow in the back. A second light may help get rid of that.  Nice job.', '2006-04-21 19:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333594, 321556, 3032, '<td valign="top">Her left eye (from her point of view) is smaller than her right eye. To compensate for this it would be better to create a composition where the smaller eye is closer to the camera to get a result that shows both eyes at equal size. Therefore you''d have to shoot the face at an angle and not straight on. This would also compensate for the fact that her mouth is not in the same line as her nose and eyes.<br/>The lighting effect is interesting but a little bit harsh around the edges of the hair.</td>', 'Her left eye (from her point of view) is smaller than her right eye. To compensate for this it would be better to create a composition where the smaller eye is closer to the camera to get a result that shows both eyes at equal size. Therefore you''d have to shoot the face at an angle and not straight on. This would also compensate for the fact that her mouth is not in the same line as her nose and eyes.The lighting effect is interesting but a little bit harsh around the edges of the hair.', '2006-04-21 19:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333598, 321910, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great image, nice lighting.  The grainess gives it a canvas like feel, although that may actually be hurting you in the voting (as DPC''ers hate noise).  Nice capture.</td>', 'Great image, nice lighting.  The grainess gives it a canvas like feel, although that may actually be hurting you in the voting (as DPC''ers hate noise).  Nice capture.', '2006-04-21 19:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
