(2333631, 321807, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great image - the skin tones and eye/lip colors are great (nice and rich). Only nit on this one is for this type of picture, the eyes just really need to pop, and they are coming across a little soft.  Nice overall composition though!</td>', 'Great image - the skin tones and eye/lip colors are great (nice and rich). Only nit on this one is for this type of picture, the eyes just really need to pop, and they are coming across a little soft.  Nice overall composition though!', '2006-04-21 19:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
