(2333653, 322015, 29011, '<td valign="top">Overall a nicely done pic. I do find the noise reduction or whatever smoothing that was applied overdone. And going for this type of crop perhaps if the model''s head was titled just a tad to her left for an even split.</td>', 'Overall a nicely done pic. I do find the noise reduction or whatever smoothing that was applied overdone. And going for this type of crop perhaps if the model''s head was titled just a tad to her left for an even split.', '2006-04-21 19:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
