(2333656, 321309, 3032, '<td valign="top">Sweet gradation into and of the reflection. Nice.</td>', 'Sweet gradation into and of the reflection. Nice.', '2006-04-21 19:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333658, 320903, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is an intersting picture. Colleen looks like a very lovely woman, but unfortunatley she is getting lost in the busyness of the shirt and umbrella. Her alabaster skin, light hair and bright lipstick would have done better against a darker, solid background.  Good lighting and composition though!</td>', 'This is an intersting picture. Colleen looks like a very lovely woman, but unfortunatley she is getting lost in the busyness of the shirt and umbrella. Her alabaster skin, light hair and bright lipstick would have done better against a darker, solid background.  Good lighting and composition though!', '2006-04-21 19:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333660, 321928, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting (focusses on the face = important) and use of diagonals and triangles.</td>', 'Nice lighting (focusses on the face = important) and use of diagonals and triangles.', '2006-04-21 19:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333662, 321907, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very cute capture. All nicely done except that the photo looks underexposed , lacking contrast. The color balance looks a bit off. In this case those things can be fixed in post processing. This is a keeper. Still bumping it up but cant give it a high enough score I would''ve liked to.</td>', 'Very cute capture. All nicely done except that the photo looks underexposed , lacking contrast. The color balance looks a bit off. In this case those things can be fixed in post processing. This is a keeper. Still bumping it up but cant give it a high enough score I would''ve liked to.', '2006-04-21 20:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333664, 321081, 29011, '<td valign="top">Pretty lady, nice smile. Good crop and composition but too much noise reduction or smoothing applied to the skin for my taste.</td>', 'Pretty lady, nice smile. Good crop and composition but too much noise reduction or smoothing applied to the skin for my taste.', '2006-04-21 20:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333669, 321451, 40019, '<td valign="top">The overall composition is very nice and she is well posed. The image has a nice softness to it as well, but in these types of shots you really need the eyes to pop - they really need to be sharp (IMO).  She has some beautiful eyes and there is some nice color in the picture, but it comes across a little flat/muted.  Nice image though.</td>', 'The overall composition is very nice and she is well posed. The image has a nice softness to it as well, but in these types of shots you really need the eyes to pop - they really need to be sharp (IMO).  She has some beautiful eyes and there is some nice color in the picture, but it comes across a little flat/muted.  Nice image though.', '2006-04-21 20:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333670, 321759, 3032, '<td valign="top">You are so fortunate Luc*, not only do you have a lovely girl, but she is also willing to pose for you and have you put up the photos in a competition. :)<br/> <br/>* I have a very good memory for faces (not names) and remember her from the galleries of your site.<br/> <br/>I like the composition of this but the light is a bit strange, too harsh on the background. The contrast just doesn''t work so well for me. 7</td>', 'You are so fortunate Luc*, not only do you have a lovely girl, but she is also willing to pose for you and have you put up the photos in a competition. :) * I have a very good memory for faces (not names) and remember her from the galleries of your site. I like the composition of this but the light is a bit strange, too harsh on the background. The contrast just doesn''t work so well for me. 7', '2006-04-21 20:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333675, 320380, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and good composition. Cool subject. :)</td>', 'Nice lighting and good composition. Cool subject. :)', '2006-04-21 20:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333676, 321957, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the post processing needs some work. The whites of her eyes look blue and her skin has way too much magenta.  Good DOF and sharpness though! Overall a very nice picture - just a little over processed (IMO).</td>', 'Nice composition, but the post processing needs some work. The whites of her eyes look blue and her skin has way too much magenta.  Good DOF and sharpness though! Overall a very nice picture - just a little over processed (IMO).', '2006-04-21 20:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333679, 321081, 40019, '<td valign="top">Yep, those are some perfect teeth!  The eyes look a little funny to me though.  I''m not sure if they are just too sharp from post-process or an illusion do to the shine off of the make-up.  Nice composition!</td>', 'Yep, those are some perfect teeth!  The eyes look a little funny to me though.  I''m not sure if they are just too sharp from post-process or an illusion do to the shine off of the make-up.  Nice composition!', '2006-04-21 20:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
