(2333682, 321383, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and great composition!  Only problem is the lighting, his face and eyes are just too dark.  Background and everything else is great - just need to nail the lighting and you got a great pic here.</td>', 'Cool idea and great composition!  Only problem is the lighting, his face and eyes are just too dark.  Background and everything else is great - just need to nail the lighting and you got a great pic here.', '2006-04-21 20:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
