(2333687, 321324, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and posing, The subtle tilt of the head works well and gives one clear eye to focus on while retaining a catchlight in both. The balance between the hat and the face is good, neither draws too much attention.</td>', 'Good lighting and posing, The subtle tilt of the head works well and gives one clear eye to focus on while retaining a catchlight in both. The balance between the hat and the face is good, neither draws too much attention.', '2006-04-21 20:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2333690, 321707, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice warm image and good capture - seems to grab there personalities very well. I just have a few suggestions. 1) the combination of shirts and background is just WAY too busy, solid color background and active shirts or vice versa would have worked better. 2) a little heavy on the post processing.  Fun pic though - I hope they liked it! (that''s all that really counts you know)  :-)</td>', 'Nice warm image and good capture - seems to grab there personalities very well. I just have a few suggestions. 1) the combination of shirts and background is just WAY too busy, solid color background and active shirts or vice versa would have worked better. 2) a little heavy on the post processing.  Fun pic though - I hope they liked it! (that''s all that really counts you know)  :-)', '2006-04-21 20:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
