(2334166, 321028, 52731, '<td valign="top">She kind of looks like a computer animation, and the skin looks slightly plastic-like. Here eyes however, are very nice. : )</td>', 'She kind of looks like a computer animation, and the skin looks slightly plastic-like. Here eyes however, are very nice. : )', '2006-04-22 00:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334169, 321678, 52731, '<td valign="top">The lighting is fantastic.</td>', 'The lighting is fantastic.', '2006-04-22 00:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334173, 321967, 52731, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The lighting is really nice, I like how her hair blends a little into her surroundings, doesn''t make her seem just stuck in front of a white background, but rather a part of her environment.</td>', 'Lovely shot. The lighting is really nice, I like how her hair blends a little into her surroundings, doesn''t make her seem just stuck in front of a white background, but rather a part of her environment.', '2006-04-22 00:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334181, 321726, 52731, '<td valign="top">I almost feel compelled to lower my vote since I''ve seen her so much lately, and in photos better than this. The portrait is however very nice. I really like her arm and the jewellery on it. The colours are nice and vibrant. Even in her age she seems more lively than most young people. Your portraits never cease to impress me.</td>', 'I almost feel compelled to lower my vote since I''ve seen her so much lately, and in photos better than this. The portrait is however very nice. I really like her arm and the jewellery on it. The colours are nice and vibrant. Even in her age she seems more lively than most young people. Your portraits never cease to impress me.', '2006-04-22 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334238, 321939, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wow i thought my monitor was on fire for a second, love the bold hair color.</td>', 'Wow i thought my monitor was on fire for a second, love the bold hair color.', '2006-04-22 00:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334240, 319738, 40370, '<td valign="top">Love the golden eyes, the border compliments the image nicely.</td>', 'Love the golden eyes, the border compliments the image nicely.', '2006-04-22 00:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334253, 321556, 40370, '<td valign="top">I like the soft coloring on the lips and eyes but the skin is much like a mannequin.</td>', 'I like the soft coloring on the lips and eyes but the skin is much like a mannequin.', '2006-04-22 00:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334265, 319628, 40370, '<td valign="top">Something different, you don''t see brothers as often as sisters posing together, I like the composition but am a bit distracted by the gray patch on the neck and shoulder of the top model.</td>', 'Something different, you don''t see brothers as often as sisters posing together, I like the composition but am a bit distracted by the gray patch on the neck and shoulder of the top model.', '2006-04-22 00:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334267, 320925, 40370, '<td valign="top">Worth walking the plank for ... lol.</td>', 'Worth walking the plank for ... lol.', '2006-04-22 00:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334279, 320903, 20889, '<td valign="top">For me the over all image is too busy, the quality of light looks good. As  I look around in your image I see things I would change like the shirt maybe a plain color, something more to be a more contrasty to your umbrela, like maybe a stripped shirt. Just to give it some more lines, with the great lines in your umbrela. These are just my thoughts hope you do well. She is very pretty girl. Have a grat day.</td>', 'For me the over all image is too busy, the quality of light looks good. As  I look around in your image I see things I would change like the shirt maybe a plain color, something more to be a more contrasty to your umbrela, like maybe a stripped shirt. Just to give it some more lines, with the great lines in your umbrela. These are just my thoughts hope you do well. She is very pretty girl. Have a grat day.', '2006-04-22 00:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334281, 321928, 40370, '<td valign="top">The shadows are dark, I like that you chose black clothing, it helps the shadows work for you rather than against.</td>', 'The shadows are dark, I like that you chose black clothing, it helps the shadows work for you rather than against.', '2006-04-22 01:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334287, 321878, 40370, '<td valign="top">Quality work in this image, the coloring and lighting are especially appealing. The only portion a bit off is the transition from arm to hand, seems to sharpen too quickly. Love it though.</td>', 'Quality work in this image, the coloring and lighting are especially appealing. The only portion a bit off is the transition from arm to hand, seems to sharpen too quickly. Love it though.', '2006-04-22 01:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334290, 321767, 20889, '<td valign="top">Wow what a story you have! But I think you have over done it with the lights, the left hand is blowed way out of the picture. I don''t know how close your model was to the background, but have moved them out a few feet and man this would have been much better. Great I deal hope to see more!</td>', 'Wow what a story you have! But I think you have over done it with the lights, the left hand is blowed way out of the picture. I don''t know how close your model was to the background, but have moved them out a few feet and man this would have been much better. Great I deal hope to see more!', '2006-04-22 01:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334295, 321822, 40370, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl, would love to see her eyes better, angled at the camera just a bit more.</td>', 'Beautiful girl, would love to see her eyes better, angled at the camera just a bit more.', '2006-04-22 01:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334298, 321383, 40370, '<td valign="top">Would like to see a little more light on his eyes, good composition though, even though the eyes are dark my focus is still drawn there.</td>', 'Would like to see a little more light on his eyes, good composition though, even though the eyes are dark my focus is still drawn there.', '2006-04-22 01:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334301, 321820, 40370, '<td valign="top">Huh ... Redhead without freckles, love the hair and eyes but the skin tone seems a little pink, fun way to fill the frame.</td>', 'Huh ... Redhead without freckles, love the hair and eyes but the skin tone seems a little pink, fun way to fill the frame.', '2006-04-22 01:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334302, 321932, 40370, '<td valign="top">Stunning.</td>', 'Stunning.', '2006-04-22 01:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334306, 321576, 40370, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, very natural tones.</td>', 'Nice lighting, very natural tones.', '2006-04-22 01:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334315, 321811, 40370, '<td valign="top">Curious editing, very creative. It would be interesting to see as a B&amp;W with only the make-up and scarf colorized.</td>', 'Curious editing, very creative. It would be interesting to see as a B&W with only the make-up and scarf colorized.', '2006-04-22 01:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334319, 321934, 40370, '<td valign="top">Great color and natural pose, would like to see a different backdrop though, the stripes (the side of a house?) are just a tiny bit dreary.</td>', 'Great color and natural pose, would like to see a different backdrop though, the stripes (the side of a house?) are just a tiny bit dreary.', '2006-04-22 01:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334325, 321612, 40370, '<td valign="top">She looks like she''s having a blast. Cute pose.</td>', 'She looks like she''s having a blast. Cute pose.', '2006-04-22 01:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334333, 321937, 40370, '<td valign="top">The angle and tight crop of this image really affects my perception of the shape of the model''s head, kind of unflattering. Maybe if there was more negative space on the left side, as though he were just turning toward the camera, it would represent his casual expression better.</td>', 'The angle and tight crop of this image really affects my perception of the shape of the model''s head, kind of unflattering. Maybe if there was more negative space on the left side, as though he were just turning toward the camera, it would represent his casual expression better.', '2006-04-22 01:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334340, 321991, 40370, '<td valign="top">Beautiful multi-colored image, just a little too soft overall, especially considering the full body shot. Maybe crop the foot and the bright landing.</td>', 'Beautiful multi-colored image, just a little too soft overall, especially considering the full body shot. Maybe crop the foot and the bright landing.', '2006-04-22 01:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334358, 320846, 40370, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors, cute little model, my single trivial complaint is the black socks, would have liked to see her petite little toes in this one.</td>', 'Awesome colors, cute little model, my single trivial complaint is the black socks, would have liked to see her petite little toes in this one.', '2006-04-22 01:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334359, 321867, 40370, '<td valign="top">I love this image, the muted colors are the perfect edit.</td>', 'I love this image, the muted colors are the perfect edit.', '2006-04-22 01:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334364, 320581, 40370, '<td valign="top">Inventive. The white bg is a tad bright, an out of focus backdrop (like brick or desk setting) may have complimented this portrait.</td>', 'Inventive. The white bg is a tad bright, an out of focus backdrop (like brick or desk setting) may have complimented this portrait.', '2006-04-22 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334367, 321944, 40370, '<td valign="top">I like the glow on her hair (lower left, would love to see more of the red tones in her beautiful locks.</td>', 'I like the glow on her hair (lower left, would love to see more of the red tones in her beautiful locks.', '2006-04-22 02:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334393, 321324, 14620, '<td valign="top">Yep, pretty perfect. 10 from me!</td>', 'Yep, pretty perfect. 10 from me!', '2006-04-22 02:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334398, 320967, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is an beautiful, poignant portrait.  The lighting and composition are perfect. 9</td>', 'This is an beautiful, poignant portrait.  The lighting and composition are perfect. 9', '2006-04-22 02:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334400, 321108, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very cool, perfect title.  The lighting and composition work very well here. 9</td>', 'Very cool, perfect title.  The lighting and composition work very well here. 9', '2006-04-22 02:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334402, 322010, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  Love the warm tones and very nice framing. 8</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  Love the warm tones and very nice framing. 8', '2006-04-22 02:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334403, 321315, 14620, '<td valign="top">This just makes me laugh!!  Great colors and model. :-)</td>', 'This just makes me laugh!!  Great colors and model. :-)', '2006-04-22 02:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334404, 320337, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I like the darkness of it but how his eyes and face still glow.  Very masculine portrait. bumping up...<br/> <br/>Plus, I''m just a sucker for freckles. :-)</td>', 'This is very nice.  I like the darkness of it but how his eyes and face still glow.  Very masculine portrait. bumping up... Plus, I''m just a sucker for freckles. :-)', '2006-04-22 02:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334408, 321878, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. The warm tones work well with the background.  The one nitpik I have is that his arm seems oddly disconnected somehow. But still gets an 8 from me.</td>', 'This is really nice. The warm tones work well with the background.  The one nitpik I have is that his arm seems oddly disconnected somehow. But still gets an 8 from me.', '2006-04-22 02:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334409, 321858, 14620, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  Wonderful colors and perfect DOF and composition.</td>', 'Adorable!  Wonderful colors and perfect DOF and composition.', '2006-04-22 02:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334410, 321873, 14620, '<td valign="top">She has the most gorgeous eyes.  Very nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'She has the most gorgeous eyes.  Very nice composition and lighting.', '2006-04-22 02:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334416, 321980, 14620, '<td valign="top">The colors and lighting are very good, nice natural expression.  Maybe a bit to centered and squaured for my taste.  I''d like to see a tighter crop, more of him and less background. 7</td>', 'The colors and lighting are very good, nice natural expression.  Maybe a bit to centered and squaured for my taste.  I''d like to see a tighter crop, more of him and less background. 7', '2006-04-22 02:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334420, 321621, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo.  I like the composition alot, but the background seems really unnatural for some reason.  Not sure what it is, but lacking shadow or depth or something.   Other than that, I quite like it.</td>', 'This is a cool photo.  I like the composition alot, but the background seems really unnatural for some reason.  Not sure what it is, but lacking shadow or depth or something.   Other than that, I quite like it.', '2006-04-22 02:43:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2334453, 321965, 43031, '<td valign="top">I like the portraits that seem to tell more of a story, let you feel like you know the subbject a bit better after seeing it. I think this does that very well. Great lighting, and just enough DOF, 8 for now.</td>', 'I like the portraits that seem to tell more of a story, let you feel like you know the subbject a bit better after seeing it. I think this does that very well. Great lighting, and just enough DOF, 8 for now.', '2006-04-22 03:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334461, 321856, 56061, '<td valign="top">Freaky!</td>', 'Freaky!', '2006-04-22 03:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334468, 321971, 43031, '<td valign="top">You know, I''m usually pretty loose with DNMC comments lately, but I really don''t think this meets portrait in either of it''s meanings very well. You''re either showing me a person''s face, and letting that tell me about them, or you''re showing me something about the person in another fashion. The problem being here is, I don''t know what you''re trying to tell me with this, and I can''t see their face. I''m sure the necklace has some significance, but you''re not laying it out for me. <br/> <br/>But, the lighting and pose are nice, the desat worked well to highlight the necklace. I think the extra exposed skin is more of a distraction than additive to whatever message you might have been going for.</td>', 'You know, I''m usually pretty loose with DNMC comments lately, but I really don''t think this meets portrait in either of it''s meanings very well. You''re either showing me a person''s face, and letting that tell me about them, or you''re showing me something about the person in another fashion. The problem being here is, I don''t know what you''re trying to tell me with this, and I can''t see their face. I''m sure the necklace has some significance, but you''re not laying it out for me.  But, the lighting and pose are nice, the desat worked well to highlight the necklace. I think the extra exposed skin is more of a distraction than additive to whatever message you might have been going for.', '2006-04-22 03:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334477, 321726, 39111, '<td valign="top">getting a bit tired of seeing the same woman again and again.  sorry, just being honest :/</td>', 'getting a bit tired of seeing the same woman again and again.  sorry, just being honest :/', '2006-04-22 03:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334498, 320964, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice and natural, I like!!!</td>', 'Nice and natural, I like!!!', '2006-04-22 04:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334597, 321827, 28029, '<td valign="top">This could have been even better with some slight light adjustments. While I like the figure portrayed with highlights, the depiction is missing some richness- the lighting is a little too vague. Its still an 8 in my book, though.</td>', 'This could have been even better with some slight light adjustments. While I like the figure portrayed with highlights, the depiction is missing some richness- the lighting is a little too vague. Its still an 8 in my book, though.', '2006-04-22 07:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334605, 321315, 44980, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colours and expressions. Good luck</td>', 'Fantastic colours and expressions. Good luck', '2006-04-22 08:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334606, 321873, 49667, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning picture... No, Amazing!  I love how you were able to conserve the tone of her skin, and even the texture.  I honestly cannot stop looking at it.<br/> <br/>UPDATE:  Ok, I''ve looked at this so many times, your counter is probably through the roof right now. lol  It''s just an amazing shot and I can''t wait to read how you did it.<br/> <br/>UPDATE2: lol  I can''t wait to see who took this picture.  Fascinating!</td>', 'This is a stunning picture... No, Amazing!  I love how you were able to conserve the tone of her skin, and even the texture.  I honestly cannot stop looking at it. UPDATE:  Ok, I''ve looked at this so many times, your counter is probably through the roof right now. lol  It''s just an amazing shot and I can''t wait to read how you did it. UPDATE2: lol  I can''t wait to see who took this picture.  Fascinating!', '2006-04-22 08:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334607, 321368, 49667, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I don''t like this... To tell you why I would have to sit back and think about it, but by the time I thought about my answer, I think my face would look much like his.  Actually, now that I''ve thought about it.  I do like this, I''m just wishing it were a chick that looks this good.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like this, but I don''t like this... To tell you why I would have to sit back and think about it, but by the time I thought about my answer, I think my face would look much like his.  Actually, now that I''ve thought about it.  I do like this, I''m just wishing it were a chick that looks this good.  Nice job.', '2006-04-22 08:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334744, 321936, 44743, '<td valign="top">I like the closeup.  Good expression.</td>', 'I like the closeup.  Good expression.', '2006-04-22 11:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334776, 321907, 55749, '<td valign="top">Open shade with a bright background, you''d do better using a hand held spot meter than relying on your camera meter.  To dark... Lighten the whole image a bit and use curves to brighten up the mid-ranges.</td>', 'Open shade with a bright background, you''d do better using a hand held spot meter than relying on your camera meter.  To dark... Lighten the whole image a bit and use curves to brighten up the mid-ranges.', '2006-04-22 11:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334777, 320462, 55749, '<td valign="top">Nice use of natural light... However, I think there''s to much rug in the foreground.  A tighter crop would do wonders for this image.</td>', 'Nice use of natural light... However, I think there''s to much rug in the foreground.  A tighter crop would do wonders for this image.', '2006-04-22 11:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334790, 321633, 54490, '<td valign="top">I usually give the benefit of the doubt that the photographer had a different interpretation of the challenge when something appears DNMC to me, so I don''t mark down for it. But in cases like this, despite Woody''s good posture and formal pose, he isn''t a person.</td>', 'I usually give the benefit of the doubt that the photographer had a different interpretation of the challenge when something appears DNMC to me, so I don''t mark down for it. But in cases like this, despite Woody''s good posture and formal pose, he isn''t a person.', '2006-04-22 12:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334792, 321639, 28029, '<td valign="top">I like the softness, the colors, the DOF, the subject, the lighting. I find the border distracting. I am curious to see if others are looking for a sharper image. For me, this works well. 9.</td>', 'I like the softness, the colors, the DOF, the subject, the lighting. I find the border distracting. I am curious to see if others are looking for a sharper image. For me, this works well. 9.', '2006-04-22 12:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334793, 321821, 28029, '<td valign="top">The strong lighting on the bachground fights with the main subject. Otherwise well done. 7</td>', 'The strong lighting on the bachground fights with the main subject. Otherwise well done. 7', '2006-04-22 12:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334794, 321836, 28029, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting. Great subject and pose. 8.</td>', 'Very interesting lighting. Great subject and pose. 8.', '2006-04-22 12:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334798, 321483, 28029, '<td valign="top">Excellent portraiture. 9</td>', 'Excellent portraiture. 9', '2006-04-22 12:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334874, 321483, 42013, '<td valign="top">Very good, just enough bg/hair lighting to separate his head. 9</td>', 'Very good, just enough bg/hair lighting to separate his head. 9', '2006-04-22 13:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334884, 322000, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the picture but the angle seems a little steep, like he is about to fall. 7</td>', 'I like the picture but the angle seems a little steep, like he is about to fall. 7', '2006-04-22 13:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334899, 321827, 42013, '<td valign="top">My favorite, Good luck</td>', 'My favorite, Good luck', '2006-04-22 13:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334905, 321937, 42013, '<td valign="top">Lighting is nice.  Red could be toned down just a bit and camera angle or lens selection seems to make his chin/hand out of proportion in relation to his head. POssibly intentional but i think it gives the portrait a strange feel.</td>', 'Lighting is nice.  Red could be toned down just a bit and camera angle or lens selection seems to make his chin/hand out of proportion in relation to his head. POssibly intentional but i think it gives the portrait a strange feel.', '2006-04-22 13:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334908, 321864, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice pic with creative prop placement ;)</td>', 'Nice pic with creative prop placement ;)', '2006-04-22 13:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
