(2334980, 321227, 37430, '<td valign="top">Bizarre. Bold. Beautiful. Blue(?).10.<br/> <br/>Post Challenge Results - <br/> <br/>I expected this to finish in top 5. I''m really surprised to see it at 69''th place. This is very original, different and well processed. This is real work of art. I would like to know how you did it esp post-processing.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-24 06:05:48.</i></td>', 'Bizarre. Bold. Beautiful. Blue(?).10. Post Challenge Results -  I expected this to finish in top 5. I''m really surprised to see it at 69''th place. This is very original, different and well processed. This is real work of art. I would like to know how you did it esp post-processing.', '2006-04-22 14:23:33.000000', '2006-04-24 07:05:48.000000', 1),
(2334982, 321028, 37430, '<td valign="top">Sweet. I like the soft diffused lighting. 9.</td>', 'Sweet. I like the soft diffused lighting. 9.', '2006-04-22 14:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334983, 321872, 37430, '<td valign="top">red.hot.redhot.10.<br/> <br/>The rough background further enhances the beauty of smooth skin. Good job.</td>', 'red.hot.redhot.10. The rough background further enhances the beauty of smooth skin. Good job.', '2006-04-22 14:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334985, 322008, 37430, '<td valign="top">Amazing natural expression in controlled studio shot! I love the pastel soft colors. Beautiful subject.10.</td>', 'Amazing natural expression in controlled studio shot! I love the pastel soft colors. Beautiful subject.10.', '2006-04-22 14:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334988, 320587, 37430, '<td valign="top">I wish DOF was more deep. Good angle and expression.7.</td>', 'I wish DOF was more deep. Good angle and expression.7.', '2006-04-22 14:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334989, 321408, 37430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Beautiful eyes. Wonderful post-processing. Would like to know how you did it. 10.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Beautiful eyes. Wonderful post-processing. Would like to know how you did it. 10.', '2006-04-22 14:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334993, 321726, 56999, '<td valign="top">Spectacular image, congratulations.</td>', 'Spectacular image, congratulations.', '2006-04-22 14:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334995, 321521, 37430, '<td valign="top">Sweet girl. Flowers perfectly compliment her innocent beauty. Just a small point- it would have been even better without flash(?) reflection in her eyes. Still a lovely photo.9.</td>', 'Sweet girl. Flowers perfectly compliment her innocent beauty. Just a small point- it would have been even better without flash(?) reflection in her eyes. Still a lovely photo.9.', '2006-04-22 14:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2334998, 321910, 37430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Perfect lighting. Some details seem to have burnt out and there seems to be some noice but still a wondrful capture.8.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Perfect lighting. Some details seem to have burnt out and there seems to be some noice but still a wondrful capture.8.', '2006-04-22 14:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
