(2335974, 321042, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great color on the hair and eyes, not too keen on the BG though it''s neutral enough and well enough set up and lit to not be a problem either. I used an off-center and partly dynamic pose myself, so I like that aspect as well : )</td>', 'Great color on the hair and eyes, not too keen on the BG though it''s neutral enough and well enough set up and lit to not be a problem either. I used an off-center and partly dynamic pose myself, so I like that aspect as well : )', '2006-04-23 02:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335979, 322013, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting overall and the mist effect. The model''s expression doesn''t seem to fit the scene somehow, at least in the most common interpretations I''d make of this setting. It will be interesting to read your notes afterwards.</td>', 'I like the lighting overall and the mist effect. The model''s expression doesn''t seem to fit the scene somehow, at least in the most common interpretations I''d make of this setting. It will be interesting to read your notes afterwards.', '2006-04-23 03:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335981, 321359, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like it that the really look like they''re having fun. I''m not so sure about that backdrop ...</td>', 'I like it that the really look like they''re having fun. I''m not so sure about that backdrop ...', '2006-04-23 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335990, 321101, 1031, '<td valign="top">If forced to quibble about <i>something</i> I''d want the BG just the tiniest bit lighter so his right sleeve stands out more. Even at this resolution I can make out the stitching in the embroidery and the patterns of the fabric and buttons; and that''s an especially nice job positioning the glasses and eyes. I''m sure you''ll both be proud to display a print of this : )</td>', 'If forced to quibble about something I''d want the BG just the tiniest bit lighter so his right sleeve stands out more. Even at this resolution I can make out the stitching in the embroidery and the patterns of the fabric and buttons; and that''s an especially nice job positioning the glasses and eyes. I''m sure you''ll both be proud to display a print of this : )', '2006-04-23 03:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335994, 321678, 1031, '<td valign="top">Certainly well-controlled lighting; interesting effect.</td>', 'Certainly well-controlled lighting; interesting effect.', '2006-04-23 03:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2335999, 321975, 1031, '<td valign="top">The shadows look a little harsh for my taste, especially that of her hand across her lower face. The effect seems somewhat less apparent to me if the photo is cropped in even tighter from the sides to a square, eliminating almost all of the background.<br/> <br/>I''d have taken out one of the catchlights in her left eye, so they match. Nice job keeping some texture/detail in the skin and fabric. You are lucky to have such an excellent model available : )</td>', 'The shadows look a little harsh for my taste, especially that of her hand across her lower face. The effect seems somewhat less apparent to me if the photo is cropped in even tighter from the sides to a square, eliminating almost all of the background. I''d have taken out one of the catchlights in her left eye, so they match. Nice job keeping some texture/detail in the skin and fabric. You are lucky to have such an excellent model available : )', '2006-04-23 03:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336001, 321812, 1031, '<td valign="top">It would be nice to get rid of the rest of the shadow on the wall, but when I''ve tried on mine it doesn''t turn out that well anyway.</td>', 'It would be nice to get rid of the rest of the shadow on the wall, but when I''ve tried on mine it doesn''t turn out that well anyway.', '2006-04-23 03:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336028, 321944, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good portrait. I like the lighting, pose and choice in background. Also the colors came out well. Scoring it an 8.</td>', 'Good portrait. I like the lighting, pose and choice in background. Also the colors came out well. Scoring it an 8.', '2006-04-23 04:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336045, 321486, 44611, '<td valign="top">I don''t think she looks particularly innocent, but I do like this image.  I like the way the model is looking at the camera and the way the pose fits the frame.</td>', 'I don''t think she looks particularly innocent, but I do like this image.  I like the way the model is looking at the camera and the way the pose fits the frame.', '2006-04-23 04:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336071, 321911, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the choice in background. The main thing holding this image back however is the lack of contrast, which could be fixed with a levels/curves adjustment in post. <br/> <br/>As far as the composition, I kinda like what you were doing here however I feel this could be better if she was looking directly to the right since there is more negative space there.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the choice in background. The main thing holding this image back however is the lack of contrast, which could be fixed with a levels/curves adjustment in post.  As far as the composition, I kinda like what you were doing here however I feel this could be better if she was looking directly to the right since there is more negative space there.', '2006-04-23 05:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336072, 320926, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2006-04-23 05:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336074, 320965, 41337, '<td valign="top">This is so incredible. Wow. 10!</td>', 'This is so incredible. Wow. 10!', '2006-04-23 05:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336076, 321309, 41337, '<td valign="top">Love that reflection and composition. Ribbon worthy, IMO.</td>', 'Love that reflection and composition. Ribbon worthy, IMO.', '2006-04-23 05:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336077, 321858, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great! Hopefully others will notice the photographic skill used here when their digital art sirens go off. Such wonderful details you captured especially in the eyes and the DOF and striking colors really makes this pop. Btw, she looks kinda like that actress Dakota Fanning!</td>', 'Great! Hopefully others will notice the photographic skill used here when their digital art sirens go off. Such wonderful details you captured especially in the eyes and the DOF and striking colors really makes this pop. Btw, she looks kinda like that actress Dakota Fanning!', '2006-04-23 05:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336078, 320473, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed at how many talented photographers there are at DPC and you appear to be one of them. I like everything about this. Good luck!</td>', 'I''m amazed at how many talented photographers there are at DPC and you appear to be one of them. I like everything about this. Good luck!', '2006-04-23 05:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336079, 321939, 41337, '<td valign="top">Striking portrait. Bumping up.</td>', 'Striking portrait. Bumping up.', '2006-04-23 05:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336080, 320485, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like how you have highlights in the hair which prevent that part of the image from being bland.</td>', 'Very nice. I like how you have highlights in the hair which prevent that part of the image from being bland.', '2006-04-23 05:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336081, 321971, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but it''s not a portrait IMO (i.e. no face).</td>', 'Nice photo but it''s not a portrait IMO (i.e. no face).', '2006-04-23 05:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336082, 321315, 39675, '<td valign="top">Top shelf work.  10 - Only question would be what is the dark thing in the lower right corner?</td>', 'Top shelf work.  10 - Only question would be what is the dark thing in the lower right corner?', '2006-04-23 05:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336083, 321678, 39675, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  The lean of the head toward the light works perfectly.  Outstanding!</td>', 'Awesome.  The lean of the head toward the light works perfectly.  Outstanding!', '2006-04-23 05:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336084, 322005, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very cute however I don''t like the background. Even though it''s not in focus the wood background still has a lot of detail that draws attention back there.</td>', 'Very cute however I don''t like the background. Even though it''s not in focus the wood background still has a lot of detail that draws attention back there.', '2006-04-23 05:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336086, 321999, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I really like the dark background you chose. Also like the lighting. The composition is good but I might have moved her slightly to the right so there is a bit more negative space in the direction she is looking.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I really like the dark background you chose. Also like the lighting. The composition is good but I might have moved her slightly to the right so there is a bit more negative space in the direction she is looking.', '2006-04-23 05:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336087, 319495, 41337, '<td valign="top">Lots of good children portraits and this is one of them. I like everything about this.</td>', 'Lots of good children portraits and this is one of them. I like everything about this.', '2006-04-23 05:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336089, 321936, 41337, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments. Excellent lighting and DOF. One of the more unique photos in the challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'Returning for comments. Excellent lighting and DOF. One of the more unique photos in the challenge. Good luck!', '2006-04-23 05:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336090, 320400, 44611, '<td valign="top">The puppy is as cute as pie.. just totally adorable.  If I could see some of the little boy''s face this would be an outstanding image.  In spite of this this is still high scoring for me because the picture really shouts love and affection.  Beautifully captured.</td>', 'The puppy is as cute as pie.. just totally adorable.  If I could see some of the little boy''s face this would be an outstanding image.  In spite of this this is still high scoring for me because the picture really shouts love and affection.  Beautifully captured.', '2006-04-23 05:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336092, 321807, 41337, '<td valign="top">Love the composition. Wish the eyes were more in focus. Good luck.</td>', 'Love the composition. Wish the eyes were more in focus. Good luck.', '2006-04-23 05:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336094, 321907, 41337, '<td valign="top">The subject is a bit too dark. Maybe a fill flash/reflector?</td>', 'The subject is a bit too dark. Maybe a fill flash/reflector?', '2006-04-23 05:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336098, 321822, 41337, '<td valign="top">Looks like something I''d see on a billboard ad. Looks good.</td>', 'Looks like something I''d see on a billboard ad. Looks good.', '2006-04-23 05:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336099, 321827, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice low key portrait.</td>', 'Nice low key portrait.', '2006-04-23 05:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336100, 321410, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2006-04-23 05:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336101, 321521, 41337, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments and bumping up. First off, the composition is great, can''t say that enough. I really like the choice in centering her. Also, I particularly like how she fills the frame from corner to corner. That plays well with the centered focus. The only thing I don''t really care for is that yellow flower. I''d lose it or replace it with one of the other ones instead.</td>', 'Returning for comments and bumping up. First off, the composition is great, can''t say that enough. I really like the choice in centering her. Also, I particularly like how she fills the frame from corner to corner. That plays well with the centered focus. The only thing I don''t really care for is that yellow flower. I''d lose it or replace it with one of the other ones instead.', '2006-04-23 05:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336102, 321987, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not a good title. Sorry. :) I do like everything about the photo except for that pale egg and her out of focus arm. Maybe I''m not getting it. Anyway, just my .02 cents. Good luck.</td>', 'Not a good title. Sorry. :) I do like everything about the photo except for that pale egg and her out of focus arm. Maybe I''m not getting it. Anyway, just my .02 cents. Good luck.', '2006-04-23 05:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336109, 321875, 46097, '<td valign="top">This is very oversharpened.....which is such a pity, cos in other respects I find it to be a wonderful portrait. Such expressive eyes.</td>', 'This is very oversharpened.....which is such a pity, cos in other respects I find it to be a wonderful portrait. Such expressive eyes.', '2006-04-23 06:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336135, 321222, 46063, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful!</td>', 'Just beautiful!', '2006-04-23 07:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336137, 321821, 36717, '<td valign="top">Simply great oicture,<br/>great lighting.</td>', 'Simply great oicture,great lighting.', '2006-04-23 07:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336145, 321907, 42984, '<td valign="top">Needed to be "studio-like environment"</td>', 'Needed to be "studio-like environment"', '2006-04-23 08:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336216, 321376, 32133, '<td valign="top">So sweet!</td>', 'So sweet!', '2006-04-23 09:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336225, 319965, 32133, '<td valign="top">I wish she wasn''t wearing glasses.  It''s a big distraction and breaks up the face too much.  Otherwise, the lighting and model are beautiful.</td>', 'I wish she wasn''t wearing glasses.  It''s a big distraction and breaks up the face too much.  Otherwise, the lighting and model are beautiful.', '2006-04-23 10:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336238, 320645, 21816, '<td valign="top">Great photo but I took off a point for the border. It''s a bit thick for this image I believe! Well done!</td>', 'Great photo but I took off a point for the border. It''s a bit thick for this image I believe! Well done!', '2006-04-23 10:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336240, 321991, 21816, '<td valign="top">I''d say this isn''t a studio portrait! A pleasant image though.</td>', 'I''d say this isn''t a studio portrait! A pleasant image though.', '2006-04-23 10:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2336242, 320473, 21816, '<td valign="top">It could be me but it looks slightly over sharpened!</td>', 'It could be me but it looks slightly over sharpened!', '2006-04-23 10:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
