(2336412, 321794, 45003, '<td valign="top">Very good studio portrait. I''d liked it more if you had put her on the right side or on the left side.</td>', 'Very good studio portrait. I''d liked it more if you had put her on the right side or on the left side.', '2006-04-23 13:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
