(2336415, 322015, 45003, '<td valign="top">I like this composition a lot, but it''s a shame this one isn''t sharp. It looks like you blurred too much or used NeatImage a bit too much.</td>', 'I like this composition a lot, but it''s a shame this one isn''t sharp. It looks like you blurred too much or used NeatImage a bit too much.', '2006-04-23 13:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
