(2337157, 321893, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice looking couple but it doesn''t look much like a "studio", sorry to be so picky.</td>', 'Nice looking couple but it doesn''t look much like a "studio", sorry to be so picky.', '2006-04-23 19:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337158, 321907, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute kid! Doesn''t look much like a "studio" though, and the lighting is a little dull, almost like he is in the shade.</td>', 'Cute kid! Doesn''t look much like a "studio" though, and the lighting is a little dull, almost like he is in the shade.', '2006-04-23 19:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337160, 321081, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting is way too harsh for her face, the reflections off her eyes, lips and teeth are really distracting. She looks like a pretty girl, the makeup is overdone and there appears to be too much neat image on her nose and cheeks. Sometimes natural is better.</td>', 'I think the lighting is way too harsh for her face, the reflections off her eyes, lips and teeth are really distracting. She looks like a pretty girl, the makeup is overdone and there appears to be too much neat image on her nose and cheeks. Sometimes natural is better.', '2006-04-23 19:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337162, 321957, 43774, '<td valign="top">She''s very pretty but either your lighting or post processing has gone wrong. The whites of her eyes are blue and her skin is way too red. You''ve also used too much neat image, giving her skin an artificial, plastic look. Sometimes natural is better.</td>', 'She''s very pretty but either your lighting or post processing has gone wrong. The whites of her eyes are blue and her skin is way too red. You''ve also used too much neat image, giving her skin an artificial, plastic look. Sometimes natural is better.', '2006-04-23 19:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337163, 321423, 43774, '<td valign="top">Image appears dull/washed out. A little more contrast would help.</td>', 'Image appears dull/washed out. A little more contrast would help.', '2006-04-23 19:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337165, 321973, 43774, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look much like a studio portrait to me, sorry.</td>', 'This doesn''t look much like a studio portrait to me, sorry.', '2006-04-23 19:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337167, 321579, 43774, '<td valign="top">I am not fond of this at all. It doens''t look much like a studio portrait. The harsh flash is not helping either.</td>', 'I am not fond of this at all. It doens''t look much like a studio portrait. The harsh flash is not helping either.', '2006-04-23 19:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
