(2337169, 322002, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute props and child. Maybe if he were not so centered?</td>', 'Cute props and child. Maybe if he were not so centered?', '2006-04-23 19:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337172, 321639, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, although I am not usually fond of soft focus. I''d love to see what this looks like sharper.</td>', 'Nice, although I am not usually fond of soft focus. I''d love to see what this looks like sharper.', '2006-04-23 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337174, 321812, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice gaze on her face. Not sure the background works, I can see a shadow from her head, a clean background is always nice.</td>', 'Nice gaze on her face. Not sure the background works, I can see a shadow from her head, a clean background is always nice.', '2006-04-23 19:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337175, 321699, 38706, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and framing.  I suspect it would be better if there was a little less focus on the busy background.</td>', 'Nice colours and framing.  I suspect it would be better if there was a little less focus on the busy background.', '2006-04-23 19:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337182, 319628, 34134, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool shot. Good color tone. Might be a bit washed out on the right shoulder, and I don''t know about the nose shadow on the guy in front, but the expressions you''ve captured are wonderful.</td>', 'This is a pretty cool shot. Good color tone. Might be a bit washed out on the right shoulder, and I don''t know about the nose shadow on the guy in front, but the expressions you''ve captured are wonderful.', '2006-04-23 20:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337186, 321991, 32754, '<td valign="top">too much neatimage, it seems.</td>', 'too much neatimage, it seems.', '2006-04-23 20:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337188, 321832, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this: it has a gritty and natural feel...his hands clasped together may have been better than holding an object in them..</td>', 'I like this: it has a gritty and natural feel...his hands clasped together may have been better than holding an object in them..', '2006-04-23 20:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337196, 321483, 32754, '<td valign="top">very well done</td>', 'very well done', '2006-04-23 20:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337204, 321939, 42198, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting - I''m just not sure the focus is right, it looks a bit soft (unless that''s intentional)</td>', 'Good composition and lighting - I''m just not sure the focus is right, it looks a bit soft (unless that''s intentional)', '2006-04-23 20:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337205, 321772, 41799, '<td valign="top">Pretty sure that I''ll be one in a long line of people giving this advice but I feel I should explain my lower than average score.<br/> <br/>On-camera flash = evil (a safe conclusion for 90% of the time). You will notice a harsh shadow behind your subject and a very ''flat'' light on his face. The key to portraiture (I''ve not mastered it yet by any means, but I''ve been taught by many experienced photographers) is to have the key light, the primary light, at least 10 degrees off the axis of the camera. It gives depth to the face, makes the scene seem more ''real'' to a viewer, and totally gets rid of the ''snapshot'' look which flash photography unfortunately carries.<br/> <br/>Positives: Kudos on not blowing out any of the highlights on the subject. Whether this was manually set or done by the camera, I am impressed at the even nature of the exposure. There are no glaring hot spots (apart from at the top, but I''m still not sure if that''s just a color of paint on the wall).</td>', 'Pretty sure that I''ll be one in a long line of people giving this advice but I feel I should explain my lower than average score. On-camera flash = evil (a safe conclusion for 90% of the time). You will notice a harsh shadow behind your subject and a very ''flat'' light on his face. The key to portraiture (I''ve not mastered it yet by any means, but I''ve been taught by many experienced photographers) is to have the key light, the primary light, at least 10 degrees off the axis of the camera. It gives depth to the face, makes the scene seem more ''real'' to a viewer, and totally gets rid of the ''snapshot'' look which flash photography unfortunately carries. Positives: Kudos on not blowing out any of the highlights on the subject. Whether this was manually set or done by the camera, I am impressed at the even nature of the exposure. There are no glaring hot spots (apart from at the top, but I''m still not sure if that''s just a color of paint on the wall).', '2006-04-23 20:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337208, 321974, 42198, '<td valign="top">Nice expression, but it appears a bit over-processed.</td>', 'Nice expression, but it appears a bit over-processed.', '2006-04-23 20:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337209, 321081, 42198, '<td valign="top">Nice smile, but appears over-processed</td>', 'Nice smile, but appears over-processed', '2006-04-23 20:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337216, 321707, 41799, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting. Remarkably rich colors.<br/>I fear you might get hit with a few "DNMC!"s as it definitely does not look like an actual studio setup. If it is, I want that backdrop!<br/> <br/>Only other comment would be that the post-processing seems a bit extreme.The glow effect, in my opinion, detracts from the image.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting. Remarkably rich colors.I fear you might get hit with a few "DNMC!"s as it definitely does not look like an actual studio setup. If it is, I want that backdrop! Only other comment would be that the post-processing seems a bit extreme.The glow effect, in my opinion, detracts from the image.', '2006-04-23 20:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337219, 321854, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition, but the focus in the face area is not a sharp as it is on the statue and arms area.  So, either a greater dof or a different focal point might work better for this shot.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition, but the focus in the face area is not a sharp as it is on the statue and arms area.  So, either a greater dof or a different focal point might work better for this shot.', '2006-04-23 20:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337221, 322001, 48717, '<td valign="top">The focus here is great, but the light is harsh kinda like you used a direct flash.  Not sure what your set up is, but a warmer light would have helped this look less like a snap shot.</td>', 'The focus here is great, but the light is harsh kinda like you used a direct flash.  Not sure what your set up is, but a warmer light would have helped this look less like a snap shot.', '2006-04-23 20:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337222, 321576, 48717, '<td valign="top">The lighting and focus on your subject is really good, but the background fence is a bit of a distraction.  The crop used, head only, does not lend to a portrait feeling which might hurt you for this challenge.  So, another approach might be a more shallow depth of field. to better blur the background, and a crop to include more shoulders and torso.</td>', 'The lighting and focus on your subject is really good, but the background fence is a bit of a distraction.  The crop used, head only, does not lend to a portrait feeling which might hurt you for this challenge.  So, another approach might be a more shallow depth of field. to better blur the background, and a crop to include more shoulders and torso.', '2006-04-23 20:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337224, 321028, 41799, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo. The blur helps to set apart the eyes which, I feel, are the strength of the composition. Rich colors, strong whites, good ''attitude''. 8</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo. The blur helps to set apart the eyes which, I feel, are the strength of the composition. Rich colors, strong whites, good ''attitude''. 8', '2006-04-23 20:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337227, 321824, 20889, '<td valign="top">I think you have done a wonderful job, great light and color. Like how the earing matches the hair also, so it deserves a good score also. Nice use of the thrids.<br/> <br/>Good luck</td>', 'I think you have done a wonderful job, great light and color. Like how the earing matches the hair also, so it deserves a good score also. Nice use of the thrids. Good luck', '2006-04-23 20:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337232, 321385, 20889, '<td valign="top">Gave me a bit of a laugh, a little on the soft side.</td>', 'Gave me a bit of a laugh, a little on the soft side.', '2006-04-23 20:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337234, 321335, 48717, '<td valign="top">Love the blues, and you did a great job on the skin tone.  She looks miserable though, she must not like swim lessons too much.</td>', 'Love the blues, and you did a great job on the skin tone.  She looks miserable though, she must not like swim lessons too much.', '2006-04-23 20:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2337242, 321521, 20889, '<td valign="top">Like your ideal, but I think if you would have stuck with one flower maybe the one to her left would have been just fine. Because the yellow and red seem to draw my eyes away from the main subject.</td>', 'Like your ideal, but I think if you would have stuck with one flower maybe the one to her left would have been just fine. Because the yellow and red seem to draw my eyes away from the main subject.', '2006-04-23 20:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
