(2337270, 321889, 48717, '<td valign="top">The eyes are such a give-a-way ;-)<br/> <br/>Anyway, the composition, lighting, and contrast are all very nice, as well as the use of the green in the shirt and the tie into the color of eye shadow.  The focus on the face seems to me a bit soft, but at the same time not so bad.</td>', 'The eyes are such a give-a-way ;-) Anyway, the composition, lighting, and contrast are all very nice, as well as the use of the green in the shirt and the tie into the color of eye shadow.  The focus on the face seems to me a bit soft, but at the same time not so bad.', '2006-04-23 20:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
