(2338030, 321873, 34938, '<td valign="top">Glad to see your shot got a ribbon...the dof comments by some were OK, but in the end it''s about the connection of the photo to the viewer...in my view, you look at the shot, you look at the eyes, you look at that face and you go WOW! all of the little distractions fade away...well done!</td>', 'Glad to see your shot got a ribbon...the dof comments by some were OK, but in the end it''s about the connection of the photo to the viewer...in my view, you look at the shot, you look at the eyes, you look at that face and you go WOW! all of the little distractions fade away...well done!', '2006-04-24 01:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
