(2338084, 321858, 34938, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot Alan...wish it finished higher for you. I gave it a 10...I cannot belive anyone would give this a 1, 2 or 3 like they did...well done...it deserved better</td>', 'This is an amazing shot Alan...wish it finished higher for you. I gave it a 10...I cannot belive anyone would give this a 1, 2 or 3 like they did...well done...it deserved better', '2006-04-24 01:59:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338087, 320822, 48228, '<td valign="top">You were ribbed as you so deserved a ribbon in every sense.....I gave you one of your "10''s" as I absolutely love this portrait..... What a little charmer you have there with magic blue eyes.....<br/> <br/>How did some of our members, give this image the following when voting,<br/>3 - ones<br/>1 - two<br/>3 - threes<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-24 01:06:19.</i></td>', 'You were ribbed as you so deserved a ribbon in every sense.....I gave you one of your "10''s" as I absolutely love this portrait..... What a little charmer you have there with magic blue eyes..... How did some of our members, give this image the following when voting,3 - ones1 - two3 - threes', '2006-04-24 02:00:34.000000', '2006-04-24 02:06:19.000000', 0),
(2338110, 321309, 27133, '<td valign="top">Sooo you beat me by .005.  LMAO!!!  You can''t get much closer than that.  But anyways...fantastic job for someone who was really panicking with this challenge in the beginning.</td>', 'Sooo you beat me by .005.  LMAO!!!  You can''t get much closer than that.  But anyways...fantastic job for someone who was really panicking with this challenge in the beginning.', '2006-04-24 02:05:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338111, 321328, 14386, '<td valign="top">Proves to everyone that you''re the man to beat in portraits.  Amazing shot.  I wish I have your creativity (and the studio).:)</td>', 'Proves to everyone that you''re the man to beat in portraits.  Amazing shot.  I wish I have your creativity (and the studio).:)', '2006-04-24 02:05:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338117, 321967, 34938, '<td valign="top">Sorry this didn''t do better Garry...actually, I am really disappointed that people didn''t vote this better...I mean, how does a shot like this get 1x1, 2x2, and 2x3??? It seems the majority were 6''s. This is a better than 6 shot. I gave it 10. Well done...</td>', 'Sorry this didn''t do better Garry...actually, I am really disappointed that people didn''t vote this better...I mean, how does a shot like this get 1x1, 2x2, and 2x3??? It seems the majority were 6''s. This is a better than 6 shot. I gave it 10. Well done...', '2006-04-24 02:06:23.000000', NULL, 0),
