(2338130, 320738, 34938, '<td valign="top">Knew this was yours Nicole...well done. I really think it deserved to finish much higher. You are really good at these kind of shots. This is really my favourite shot of you...the pose is so relaxed and friendly...excellent. Makes me want to go and buy backdrops and studio lights</td>', 'Knew this was yours Nicole...well done. I really think it deserved to finish much higher. You are really good at these kind of shots. This is really my favourite shot of you...the pose is so relaxed and friendly...excellent. Makes me want to go and buy backdrops and studio lights', '2006-04-24 02:08:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338131, 319628, 19952, '<td valign="top">These are the twins, Marac? You must have done something right, man. I would have never posed like this with my twin brother when we were teenagers. I like this shot a lot!</td>', 'These are the twins, Marac? You must have done something right, man. I would have never posed like this with my twin brother when we were teenagers. I like this shot a lot!', '2006-04-24 02:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338134, 320822, 93, '<td valign="top">Are you sure you aren''t copying some of my techniques? ;)<br/> <br/>Great portrait.. between you and Bazz, Team Pentax continues to be a contender eh?</td>', 'Are you sure you aren''t copying some of my techniques? ;) Great portrait.. between you and Bazz, Team Pentax continues to be a contender eh?', '2006-04-24 02:09:21.000000', NULL, 0),
