(2338138, 322002, 48228, '<td valign="top">So close to a 6 score dear friend.....I loved it, and I also know it touches your heart as well, and that''s what matters.</td>', 'So close to a 6 score dear friend.....I loved it, and I also know it touches your heart as well, and that''s what matters.', '2006-04-24 02:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
