(2338164, 321309, 48228, '<td valign="top">Love this Rikki, especially the pose allowing us to visually see her reflection as well.....I am so proud of you, as this is a great image, well done.....</td>', 'Love this Rikki, especially the pose allowing us to visually see her reflection as well.....I am so proud of you, as this is a great image, well done.....', '2006-04-24 02:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
