(2338343, 320967, 43434, '<td valign="top">This is awesome ... I am really pleased you shared this shot .. and the thoughts behind it.</td>', 'This is awesome ... I am really pleased you shared this shot .. and the thoughts behind it.', '2006-04-24 04:21:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338349, 320380, 25355, '<td valign="top">One of my few tens. Well done, Tim.</td>', 'One of my few tens. Well done, Tim.', '2006-04-24 04:31:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338358, 321309, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is one of the very few images I scored lower than the group. I only gave it a 6. I review images scored lower than the group to see what I overlooked and most of the time the group is right. <br/> <br/>Image composition here is fantastic, especially with the hair and reflection. Lighting and color are basically good. But a couple technical issues were bothersome. The whiteness of the eyes seems unnatural. Focus on your model is in that never, never land where it is not soft enough to be considered artistically soft focused but not quite sharp enough to be considered in best focus. The ear ring draws strong attention to this fact. The reflection in the mirror (a very nice touch I might add) appears to be in better focus than your model. That should be the other way around.</td>', 'This is one of the very few images I scored lower than the group. I only gave it a 6. I review images scored lower than the group to see what I overlooked and most of the time the group is right.  Image composition here is fantastic, especially with the hair and reflection. Lighting and color are basically good. But a couple technical issues were bothersome. The whiteness of the eyes seems unnatural. Focus on your model is in that never, never land where it is not soft enough to be considered artistically soft focused but not quite sharp enough to be considered in best focus. The ear ring draws strong attention to this fact. The reflection in the mirror (a very nice touch I might add) appears to be in better focus than your model. That should be the other way around.', '2006-04-24 04:36:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338363, 321873, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on getting a ribbon with this image. Lighting and skin tonality are near technical perfection and the crop highlighting her eyes makes this a very, very strong composition. Super portrait! Well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Congratulations on getting a ribbon with this image. Lighting and skin tonality are near technical perfection and the crop highlighting her eyes makes this a very, very strong composition. Super portrait! Well deserved ribbon.', '2006-04-24 04:44:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338366, 321328, 27133, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  I am really taken with your background.  Can you please enlighten me.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  I am really taken with your background.  Can you please enlighten me.', '2006-04-24 04:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338373, 321328, 20608, '<td valign="top">KIWI! KIWI! KIWI! KIWI! KIWI! KIWI! KIWI!<br/> <br/>Lets do it again man... This HAD to be your shot, brilliant</td>', 'KIWI! KIWI! KIWI! KIWI! KIWI! KIWI! KIWI! Lets do it again man... This HAD to be your shot, brilliant', '2006-04-24 04:56:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338379, 321324, 5792, '<td valign="top">You are a master of portraiture. Your command of lighting, especially in one as difficult to light as this, is nothing less than astounding. Your strict attention to technical excellance is the strength of this composition. Like in this case, what you put into your portraits is often so subtle, so good, and yet so natural that DPC voters often overlook it. We are just not that sophisticated. We often look for funk and flash. ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-24 04:48:35.</i></td>', 'You are a master of portraiture. Your command of lighting, especially in one as difficult to light as this, is nothing less than astounding. Your strict attention to technical excellance is the strength of this composition. Like in this case, what you put into your portraits is often so subtle, so good, and yet so natural that DPC voters often overlook it. We are just not that sophisticated. We often look for funk and flash. ;)', '2006-04-24 05:07:14.000000', '2006-04-24 05:48:35.000000', 0),
(2338386, 321957, 42125, '<td valign="top">In my opinion you did not deserve the brown ribbon.<br/>All sort of comments that you are receiving about wrong colours.<br/>For me I have also received such a comments probably because I am colourblind and I always have to get help with the colours if I make changes in them.<br/>Better luck next time.<br/>Edited: I see in your profile that I (the egg) was trying to teach you (the hen) :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-24 04:19:49.</i></td>', 'In my opinion you did not deserve the brown ribbon.All sort of comments that you are receiving about wrong colours.For me I have also received such a comments probably because I am colourblind and I always have to get help with the colours if I make changes in them.Better luck next time.Edited: I see in your profile that I (the egg) was trying to teach you (the hen) :-)', '2006-04-24 05:17:16.000000', '2006-04-24 05:19:49.000000', 0),
(2338392, 321726, 20608, '<td valign="top">10 .. 1s????? i feel like swearing at those a$$holes.. who the HELL can give this AMAZING photograph a FRICKIN 1? then find another 9 A$$HOLES to follow them.. its SLANDEROUS!!!<br/> <br/>With that OFF my chest now I can say, SHE and YOU are simply FANTASTIC, what a SUPER model, brilliant image that, to me, conveys a beauty in ageing presented by a man that is one of the greatest photographers I know. Even WITH the ABUSE of 1s 2s and 3s this image STILL finished top 10 and SHOULD of ribboned.<br/> <br/>I could NEVER be tierd of seeing Rosalinda she is beautifull.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-24 04:29:39.</i></td>', '10 .. 1s????? i feel like swearing at those a$$holes.. who the HELL can give this AMAZING photograph a FRICKIN 1? then find another 9 A$$HOLES to follow them.. its SLANDEROUS!!! With that OFF my chest now I can say, SHE and YOU are simply FANTASTIC, what a SUPER model, brilliant image that, to me, conveys a beauty in ageing presented by a man that is one of the greatest photographers I know. Even WITH the ABUSE of 1s 2s and 3s this image STILL finished top 10 and SHOULD of ribboned. I could NEVER be tierd of seeing Rosalinda she is beautifull.', '2006-04-24 05:29:01.000000', '2006-04-24 05:29:39.000000', 0),
