(2338639, 321872, 28710, '<td valign="top">Wow. Unbelievably hot. Stunning stuff. Is she Korean? Mixed?<br/> <br/>Too bad you mentioned that she''s a smoker. There is something so incredibly unsexy about a girl that smokes... To the point that even her appearance doesn''t look the same afterwards.</td>', 'Wow. Unbelievably hot. Stunning stuff. Is she Korean? Mixed? Too bad you mentioned that she''s a smoker. There is something so incredibly unsexy about a girl that smokes... To the point that even her appearance doesn''t look the same afterwards.', '2006-04-24 09:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338642, 320967, 28710, '<td valign="top">An absolutely perfect shot in my books. I love the skin textures in the high tones. I also like the perfect balance of your daughters'' poses behind your wife, having exactly the right parts of their face/eye covered. <br/> <br/>Fantastic.</td>', 'An absolutely perfect shot in my books. I love the skin textures in the high tones. I also like the perfect balance of your daughters'' poses behind your wife, having exactly the right parts of their face/eye covered.  Fantastic.', '2006-04-24 09:09:06.000000', NULL, 0),
