(2338669, 321328, 332, '<td valign="top">Congrats Gary. A well deserved ribbon. Love that background. The lighting takes me straight to her eye. Well done. The "first to 25" will be close ;)</td>', 'Congrats Gary. A well deserved ribbon. Love that background. The lighting takes me straight to her eye. Well done. The "first to 25" will be close ;)', '2006-04-24 09:32:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2338677, 321944, 5885, '<td valign="top">You run a risk when submitting photos with darker portions on DPC. While you and I see the hair detail fine, it''s not guarenteed that ALL voters will. My notebook for instance would not do the hair detail justice at all.<br/> <br/>I gave you a 9. It''s a fine portrait.</td>', 'You run a risk when submitting photos with darker portions on DPC. While you and I see the hair detail fine, it''s not guarenteed that ALL voters will. My notebook for instance would not do the hair detail justice at all. I gave you a 9. It''s a fine portrait.', '2006-04-24 09:40:01.000000', NULL, 0),
