(2338957, 321309, 47933, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice image Rikki and what can I say about this beautiful model? The composition is lovely along with the lighting. I find it odd that when someone first uses a post processing program or technique like Neat Image everyone wonders in amazement, then after most people know what it is or how to use it it''s considered a hindrance. I realize that you didn''t use NI but the fact that your model''s skin is so beautiful here may have hurt your score. Isn''t that ironic?</td>', 'I think this is a nice image Rikki and what can I say about this beautiful model? The composition is lovely along with the lighting. I find it odd that when someone first uses a post processing program or technique like Neat Image everyone wonders in amazement, then after most people know what it is or how to use it it''s considered a hindrance. I realize that you didn''t use NI but the fact that your model''s skin is so beautiful here may have hurt your score. Isn''t that ironic?', '2006-04-24 11:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
