(2339498, 321833, 22538, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everybody for fine comments. <br/>The workflow from <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=323428" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/22538/thumb/323428.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/22538/thumb/323428.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/22538/thumb/323428.jpg"/></a> to the one submitted inlcuded:<br/>1) Fairly heavy NoiseNinja because my P&amp;S is pretty noisy at ISO200.<br/>2) Curves to increase mid-tone contrast.<br/>3) Slight overall saturation in Hues<br/>4) Extra boost to the Reds in Hues to bring out the colour of the dress<br/>5) Burn around the edges of the image and the headdress<br/>6) Dodge arround the face<br/>5) Crop, resize, USM &amp; SFW</td>', 'Thanks to everybody for fine comments. The workflow from  to the one submitted inlcuded:1) Fairly heavy NoiseNinja because my P&S is pretty noisy at ISO200.2) Curves to increase mid-tone contrast.3) Slight overall saturation in Hues4) Extra boost to the Reds in Hues to bring out the colour of the dress5) Burn around the edges of the image and the headdress6) Dodge arround the face5) Crop, resize, USM & SFW', '2006-04-24 14:50:21.000000', NULL, 0),
