(2339763, 321726, 48245, '<td valign="top">I like this picture as well but I liked the other one better ;-)...<br/> <br/>I did a quick questimate that the folks that voted this so low were doing it as a protest (bad voters... each photo is an individual entry on its own merits) and probably cost this picture at least .25 points to the average which would have pushed this to the ribbon catagory. Probably not first but in the ribbon category. <br/> <br/>I like the level of detail Librodo is able to get out of his photos. As someone else posted, he doesn''t seem to take a bad picture... I think it is time for him to post one of his bad pictures ;-).<br/> <br/>Great photo!</td>', 'I like this picture as well but I liked the other one better ;-)... I did a quick questimate that the folks that voted this so low were doing it as a protest (bad voters... each photo is an individual entry on its own merits) and probably cost this picture at least .25 points to the average which would have pushed this to the ribbon catagory. Probably not first but in the ribbon category.  I like the level of detail Librodo is able to get out of his photos. As someone else posted, he doesn''t seem to take a bad picture... I think it is time for him to post one of his bad pictures ;-). Great photo!', '2006-04-24 17:25:06.000000', NULL, 0),
