(2340124, 321412, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, let''s see Leroy.  I think I wondered if this was yours for some reason.<br/> <br/>Here are my issues:<br/>1) The highlight on the face is quite a bit.  You might get away with it, except it blends quite well with the highlight on the muslin in the back.<br/>2) The red overall in the background is a bit too much.  It looks like PP (which it may or may not be).  I think perhaps you were going for the complement between the green shirt and the red which is good, but the red comes out more as a really blasted pink.<br/>3) The pose?  The dude looks a bit like he needs to be wearing an S&amp;M outfit.  I looked to the title to help me with the pose, but when I didn''t see help, I just scratched my head.  I''m glad it''s not typical, but I didn''t quite get it.</td>', 'Well, let''s see Leroy.  I think I wondered if this was yours for some reason. Here are my issues:1) The highlight on the face is quite a bit.  You might get away with it, except it blends quite well with the highlight on the muslin in the back.2) The red overall in the background is a bit too much.  It looks like PP (which it may or may not be).  I think perhaps you were going for the complement between the green shirt and the red which is good, but the red comes out more as a really blasted pink.3) The pose?  The dude looks a bit like he needs to be wearing an S&M outfit.  I looked to the title to help me with the pose, but when I didn''t see help, I just scratched my head.  I''m glad it''s not typical, but I didn''t quite get it.', '2006-04-24 19:59:06.000000', NULL, 0),
