(3572991, 321483, 56002, '<td valign="top">2:<br/> <br/>1:  Echo MacClavey - I would like to tell you that this is a lovely image.<br/>2:  <i>He lives up the street from me and above all he is a fine gentlemen.</i> - those words warm my heart.  I am thrilled to hear someone verbally assert that, as important as art is, it needn''t top the list of what is most important in life.  I would be most honored if someone were to one day think of me <i>what a fine gentleman he is</i>.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-24 09:51:46.</i></td>', '2: 1:  Echo MacClavey - I would like to tell you that this is a lovely image.2:  He lives up the street from me and above all he is a fine gentlemen. - those words warm my heart.  I am thrilled to hear someone verbally assert that, as important as art is, it needn''t top the list of what is most important in life.  I would be most honored if someone were to one day think of me what a fine gentleman he is.', '2007-04-23 10:16:26.000000', '2007-04-24 10:51:46.000000', 0),
